<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="6">

  <DocumentRef DateTime="20260818T200419" id="91a93ccf-d06d-4566-a89e-3f4a3711c4c5">
    <XRef DateTime="20260809T235802" id="f0553c2d-6e03-4733-89a4-d43ff5a8134f"/>
  </DocumentRef>

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="bdb64e8d-aea6-4d9c-84f6-b483b014db75">
      <Text>EPISODE 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="39f70697-a04f-4c56-b4ba-bcc35755d754">
      <Text>TITLE CARD: </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="895f2d76-9c21-405e-9e98-0ebc51bbbfc2">
      <Text>All title cards have a black background</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="5c891678-f59a-43d0-9a20-cceeb8402d1b">
      <Text>Here Again I(Pastel Red)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="81f1df8e-50ff-4f92-8662-c68f83b6ffe3">
      <Text>FADE IN:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="1" Type="Scene Heading" id="f9ab687c-8c26-4502-aaad-733abb5485a3">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. ABANDONED SHACK </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> EARLY MORNING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Note" id="ccf16f1f-b689-4eda-b9ad-22b2b7db4b53">
      <Text>All color is assumed black &amp; white unless otherwise specified</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3e247400-c1e3-4b9e-96bf-cf3165a6b687">
      <Text>On the floor, a folded pair of black short shorts with a black leather belt sit on black canvas combat boots.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6c95a390-e8bd-4320-b69f-7821210a2800">
      <Text>A corpse lies on the floor, head facing the doorway.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4b84e5ff-1a13-49a7-bd95-017dd89afbbb">
      <Text>A thin blanket drapes over ROWAN.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4cc19a18-242b-4f49-9ef2-ee8ab597aad9">
      <Text>Rowan stirs, then slouches off the bed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6c536fcb-7878-4344-9452-6779e50bf402">
      <Text>Nude, she examines herself in the mirror for bruises and scars.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="85810069-be2b-46f9-9d27-ac187c789fec">
      <Text>She slings the corpse over her shoulders, opens the door and throws it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="85810069-be2b-46f9-9d27-ac187c789fec">
      <Text>After closing it, she walks into the bathroom.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="698ebc4f-3286-4a1e-8497-e0c5fd2a5e70">
      <Text>The bathroom feels only slightly cleaner than the rest of the shack.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="507d7428-e93d-45fe-b802-3c25a04f7214">
      <Text>Rowan turns the shower on, waits a few beats for warmth, and steps in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2fc05c08-6658-4296-a122-b4a303f08d00">
      <Text>She reaches for a small bar of soap.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2fc05c08-6658-4296-a122-b4a303f08d00">
      <Text>The bar of soap runs out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="58b72c5c-7f26-4056-ba14-e3eef3bc22b8">
      <Text>Frustrated, she steps out of the shower and back into the other room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6eb3fd4b-917b-43f3-a592-052c2b71c9a5">
      <Text>Still wet, she dresses herself, tying the button—up across her chest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a639d5bb-b7f9-454a-b034-ea9c7012882b">
      <Text>Sitting back on the bed and lacing up her boots, she exhales audibly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7766eaca-c548-42a0-a85b-30c241385669">
      <Text>She steps out of the shack again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="2" Type="Scene Heading" id="633e177d-1370-4b2d-96c4-cd0512bf4880">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MERCHANT">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="7a4f2ff7-d170-4585-ae5d-fdb821bad74e"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>int. Store </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> LATER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="137c3c66-2b30-410a-ae49-9cec9e038a03">
      <Text>Rowan scans aisles for soap.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cbe30f22-5c03-4512-bb22-389ad551eb24">
      <Text>She pulls a fistful of dollars from her back pocket and tosses it on the counter as she tries to leave.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f237bd7a-42be-4fc0-b658-2921bb1477b7">
      <Text>Merchant</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c50dc2a8-a046-4977-b028-50597dd5cd33">
      <Text>Hey!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="284c0460-cbf6-4ff1-98f5-d16727b01699">
      <Text>She turns around and stares him down. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="131e5866-ce08-43f0-afb0-168dcc2e9dea">
      <Text>Scared, he quickly nods his head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="131e5866-ce08-43f0-afb0-168dcc2e9dea">
      <Text>She leaves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="3" Type="Scene Heading" id="17c85c76-38c0-4639-baa1-427fbf65aae4">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. ABANDONED SHACK </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> LATER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="55656f06-03e3-4513-9068-7f3c63c8af59">
      <Text>Rowan finishes her shower and steps out. Grabbing a neatly folded towel from the rack.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="da61b58e-2ee9-4000-a136-3b99328d91a9">
      <Text>She dries herself off, wraps the towel around her waist and returns to the other room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="4" Type="Scene Heading" id="b369729f-0cdd-42e4-b165-42230386230c">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BRUTISH MAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="8d42bdd9-dc9a-4ba5-9a7e-4712540e226b"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. SMALL HAMLET </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> LATER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0af423c7-b4a2-4466-915a-53b25802d79b">
      <Text>Rowan, dried and dressed, sits on the stairs outside a building, peeling an orange.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="afd773a1-c4a5-4fd7-9dbe-a81562facf02">
      <Text>A brutish man approaches her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e6275ab6-da8e-4f77-97ff-483889e3e433">
      <Text>BRUTISH MAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0697a203-cec8-4e57-9b44-e75233da7180">
      <Text>Hey, pretty lady. Mind sharing a piece?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="942a0ec6-79fa-4300-9234-a602369e8bd4">
      <Text>She looks up at him, unfazed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2f86e547-3615-413c-9416-57d99317225b">
      <Text>He pulls her chin up to make eye contact and leans to her ear.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ba74c24c-157e-43b8-afab-dde5b9103d65">
      <Text>BRUTISH MAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="446803a3-c578-4c8f-a96b-8f2c83b01370">
      <Text>Come on...I promise you it'll be worth it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="22a6030e-92a8-4bc3-9ba5-3464099da095">
      <Text>She eats another piece and chews loudly in his ear.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="60cb937d-e25f-4964-b651-b69e50eac183">
      <Text>The man rights himself and reaches for her shirt by the knot.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="99e98446-9558-4686-a9d4-5cee7f542473">
      <Text>She punches him in the chest, crunching bones and bleeding.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="14729a36-751d-4aa3-b238-1c0467d02181">
      <Text>He keels over, dead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="34f11d3b-cbef-4371-bca3-31641089b0eb">
      <Text>She stuffs the rest of the orange, then walks away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="5" Type="Scene Heading" id="6949b43f-7ed0-43f5-b176-20246049a6e1">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BARTENDER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="c6ee9b78-cd96-48a6-ad2e-e18004755574"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="fb3da8c3-b578-4e3a-9d25-642ca1f2d428"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="3671a5fe-a8db-4e41-b4ea-5bdf1f1e95b9"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Tavern </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fc59130c-fc54-4a60-b139-b319509bf278">
      <Text>Rowan sits at the bar top with a drink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="561c8019-6d13-427e-a12c-ff6714d0ae50">
      <Text>Two men walk in and beset her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="81604343-4a7b-4675-af72-62778b83fa98">
      <Text>BARTENDER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e9e9d943-068f-433b-9541-2990c83e105c">
      <Text>What can I get y’all?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="14814b67-ae67-4836-8dc6-115ecb924f72">
      <Text>Man</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ea900bf8-62ce-4f21-9cf5-5f3e680e7df0">
      <Text>What she’s having, two of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">em</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0d42ca70-8783-4232-bfe8-a1b9000d6ed1">
      <Text>He nods and walks off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cb9bbf08-ac55-4ab6-b69a-41a3e9a8966a">
      <Text>The man turns to Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3626f5b2-074c-4f9c-b84d-4f2ec2781fe6">
      <Text>Man</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="94985832-2c31-4c09-a3e7-c9a98ea29aaa">
      <Text>Heard you took out </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Yankem</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c8533a40-926e-4856-8e97-c70760426fe5">
      <Text>Rowan takes a drink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ca8ce5f0-221e-4885-8e69-1d4d9c6f07b4">
      <Text>MAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8ae9e8ce-4ce9-4401-8cad-a19489aca968">
      <Text>A woman like you could do some real damage with guys like us. How about it?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="445e7ed5-7486-4837-a894-79e0d1e9af50">
      <Text>He sticks his hand out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a3d6b141-67a9-42bd-b4a0-cbda77654170">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fdd581d7-5550-4bcb-959e-fa9ed366c5ef">
      <Text>I’ll pass.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="69d224cb-6da0-422b-90c4-b3659dba29d3">
      <Text>Man</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3372ae33-5cb5-4874-96dd-4c666c873666">
      <Text>Come on, it’ll be worth your time. I promise.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fd955017-1f3e-46d4-8259-b482de516056">
      <Text>She swivels to him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="481561ce-13b2-4722-bc5c-f1aebab5dbaa">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b1663d22-79d0-434f-a8a2-a318536ba167">
      <Text>Tell you what, you both leave right now, I won’t hurt you guys.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3dac478a-47a3-4f5c-8fd6-e41c742bf0b0">
      <Text>He lays a hand on her forearm; she looks down, then at him, then takes another drink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="89ac149e-f335-4df5-9cf9-ebaa914a06fb">
      <Text>The man looks at the other over her shoulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b6657fb8-284f-4421-9363-93024dbab3ee">
      <Text>They both throw a punch; she leans back, and their fists crash.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9eb33be5-cfad-49d2-bcd6-2f25697069bc">
      <Text>She grabs both their heads and smashes them into each other, then gets up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6736ee9c-ac61-46f3-b685-df91ff78e67f">
      <Text>BarTENDER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1b73cf6a-b629-417f-9be7-fab0f35408e1">
      <Text>You </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gotta</Text>
      <Text> pay!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1560a110-9237-4aa9-bf3b-a4ed7716fcf7">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d61b0464-fd73-413e-9e7f-01d64a22d027">
      <Text>They’re good for it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b0fc2964-cd7d-4783-b4af-57a7e90ea8cc">
      <Text>She leaves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="a02afd1f-912f-4088-9f7b-ee9f2203601d">
      <Text>FADE TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="6" Type="Scene Heading" id="ca81ebe0-3a6c-4552-99a9-bb69c34b67ef">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="4" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GANG MEMBER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="0bb997c9-4be3-4183-aa41-f1c3f2a2101c"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="2abe715b-1bff-44cf-ad3b-422136b20843"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. ABANDONED SHACK </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> LATER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Shot" id="f70409d8-7a10-45ee-b1f1-bff70927cecd">
      <Text>MONTAGe of rowan working out &amp; CALISTHENICS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="14ee53c6-dbe7-4f6e-9273-a4770b97df51">
      <Text>A loud knock at the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8b6ddb97-7d38-4441-a832-cff772aa743b">
      <Text>Frustrated, she stands up and opens it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8949c594-cdaf-497d-813e-ce890b6ae61b">
      <Text>Another gang of eight guys, looking like </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Yankem’s</Text>
      <Text> gang, stands at the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bdc2c6e9-1bed-4d7f-8913-9827122d106e">
      <Text>GANG MEMBER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="20274f29-17aa-45ab-9a04-e71bb566cc7e">
      <Text>We're gonna need you to step </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="10c03d38-1e9d-440d-8d79-391c57e13780">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fdc37c9c-bf36-4c5b-952f-10756e219ef7">
      <Text>You guys gonna help me finish my workout?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="079c9ff5-d9f1-4b9f-a3e2-11c3a745c3a3">
      <Text>Two more pull her by the shirt and yank her outside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="7" Type="Scene Heading" id="a2448e11-9850-4e39-978c-2a0857990afe">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="4" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="afb36039-94dc-41fe-bf6a-886ad3ffd19a"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. ABANDONED SHACK </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bb317af5-da9b-4df4-b72f-40e69443e490">
      <Text>Rowan readies a fighting stance, veins &amp; eyes turning pastel red.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b143f557-7631-4656-9b93-d0ba20e2755d">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d3a1875e-fef4-4673-b02a-67333bdbff69">
      <Text>I'll take that as a yes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="02e540e6-d86b-45ee-84e6-cd34ffe60d54">
      <Text>The guys charge her at once. She ducks one's swing and uppercuts the other, snapping his neck. She grapples the other to the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1729ea92-9764-4388-b5f3-a6403b50638f">
      <Text>She snaps his arm, stands up, and leg sweeps the closest guy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8da30f30-c202-42fc-8f37-c477b53e6586">
      <Text>One manages to tackle her down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="50e940b7-327b-4f26-b494-57c450d9e6bc">
      <Text>He begins wailing on her; she knees him in the back, snapping his spine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="127639c0-f7ca-4761-bbb6-a4d443b044c6">
      <Text>She quickly grabs his head and snaps his neck.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a84b89b4-4cfb-4f4c-b0fd-0823a4cd887b">
      <Text>She tosses him off; the others rush in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="966a7128-31c5-404d-9af7-ba1c9e7ccba4">
      <Text>She forces her way up as the punches don’t bother her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1a0a7ace-bfaf-4038-be39-f41408749d99">
      <Text>The guys step back and look at her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="21240e51-dfd1-4262-bb01-0d29fe618b5c">
      <Text>Rowan rolls her neck and reloads her arms.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="02d75625-0e3b-440a-a941-858aa9beede6">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ae6b5bf7-38b0-4ad7-af06-5a3cf26e3437">
      <Text>Last dance, boys. Takers?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="13115bbf-5733-4c23-a355-110c974d82ae">
      <Text>The guys charge her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c813b81f-615b-4693-bf03-bbcbb47cae95">
      <Text>Each one that approaches is killed in one punch, except for the last one.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eb9076ab-98ca-4714-8ae9-8188b966322d">
      <Text>She grabs him by the neck.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f060757f-8ff1-49ed-a7a9-5beedaba318a">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b0768af3-e025-4063-bf70-54ec41e5367e">
      <Text>Tell </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Yankem’s</Text>
      <Text> stupid fucking friends that they aren't invited to play anymore.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5f257be4-848b-48e2-9fd9-b619ddace3b2">
      <Text>The guy nervously nods, is released, and scrambles away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a8e79773-b6ad-4734-be84-bbd10cd79601">
      <Text>She rips the shirt off one of the dead men and wipes her hands with it, tossing it on his face after.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c2290746-a9a5-4c1c-b503-65025c26b5be">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="ff96aa7e-9652-4174-9ca8-5221d49d08a7">
      <Text>(Whispering to self)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cca6e37f-5c13-4743-997a-acd47c3fb2dd">
      <Text>Douches almost ruined my fucking pump.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b8afd2f3-6f2e-4c4d-bf45-12f8cb5e7594">
      <Text>Turns around and walks back inside the shack.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="0c800c4a-a210-4ba1-ab9e-31139b16364f">
      <Text>EPISODE 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="5be0b3e0-a48d-43d8-b1eb-c6fd66d977e6">
      <Text>TITLE CARD:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="0581a367-d7ee-461f-bca3-7f02eac9c966">
      <Text>Little Dreamer </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">II</Text>
      <Text> (pastel blue)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="1dc74319-afca-4d7a-8efc-4af67a5366f8">
      <Text>FADE TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="8" Type="Scene Heading" id="983accde-661e-4b48-8fae-b2cd7b3eb756">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="6" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. WENDY'S SHACK </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> EARLY MORNING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5395e430-ab4c-4046-a17f-6e1688293bf8">
      <Text>WENDY, ginger hair, longer rounded black nails with deep blue paisley patterns, is asleep in bed beneath a large comforter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5395e430-ab4c-4046-a17f-6e1688293bf8">
      <Text>An acoustic guitar with a pastel blue sigil in the hole sits in the corner of the room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2f2b54ee-9a2f-413e-ad17-83aba71196c5">
      <Text>A pastel blue pleated robe haphazardly rests on the floor, and an oversized pastel blue floppy hat sits on the knob of the bed frame.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2f2b54ee-9a2f-413e-ad17-83aba71196c5">
      <Text>Short black leather gladiator sandals flop atop each other near the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1d0529b6-741f-4bb3-9d48-e51f7dddbd9a">
      <Text>She rolls out of bed in pastel blue underwear, meanders into the bathroom and washes her face from the sink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a40487b8-36bd-40a4-a931-ac2d973ff2ac">
      <Text>She puts on a pastel blue bra, dons the robe, equips the hat, straps up her sandals, slings the guitar over her back and steps out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="9" Type="Scene Heading" id="e866e80b-d65b-452a-9167-23902a7be11e">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="6" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GANG LEADER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="b2821275-0282-43f0-adeb-a82a64ed4d69"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. SMALL WASTELAND TOWN </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d6f183fe-110b-452d-acb2-987465e5cd8f">
      <Text>As Wendy walks down the road, a child smiles and waves as she passes, and she smiles back with a small gesture.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f9b4752c-71fb-4727-a97c-d18db9312840">
      <Text>Several people wave and nod to her as she makes her way toward the center of town.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f9b4752c-71fb-4727-a97c-d18db9312840">
      <Text>She stops in front of a fountain, takes the guitar in hand and sits, legs crisscross, on the edge, then plays a soft melody.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a88b3c7f-ef1f-43a5-bfe4-8f142226202b">
      <Text>Teardrop—shaped wisps emanate from within, gliding about, pulsing in rhythm with the music, ushering nearby patrons.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3300a9ff-39ac-4134-a280-70f13967467c">
      <Text>A crowd gathers around her as the music intensifies; some people are brought to tears.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2148bb14-5d10-4bf1-aace-7895182ff9fc">
      <Text>In the background, a gang arrives on buggies and motorcycles, arriving as the song ends.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b053b98d-8e16-448b-a4c6-639527e1adb0">
      <Text>They push through the crowd and stand over Wendy. The crowd forms a larger circle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="abe9de2e-8110-46ff-9b34-9d1a59e183c4">
      <Text>She strikes a chord progression, and the wisps quickly gather beneath her, floating her up to eye level with the leader.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f098cfef-f8e5-428b-bf65-479112fd3765">
      <Text>The gang leader tips his undertaker hat to her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="64924e06-8630-4908-b3f4-c5f5427e83aa">
      <Text>GANG LEADER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="12b7d86a-78f7-45ab-bd8d-3b9e49241a7b">
      <Text>I heard your town had the most blue in the region, came to check it out for myself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="71e377f0-0dd6-43ac-a6c8-d26cf1ab991c">
      <Text>She lets a chord ring out, then tips her hat back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6e578b25-4601-4f5a-934b-e6806adc9638">
      <Text>He quickdraws his revolver, but a quicker strum forms a shield in front of the bullet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Shot" id="9c99244b-2b94-430e-9ae2-432245d98537">
      <Text>Impact frame: silhouette of a girl being struck by blue lightning while playing an acoustic guitar.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1056af78-f2dd-4af7-962c-d19e4821d1c3">
      <Text>When the shield dissipates, her hand is in a different chord shape.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="db7d40b3-86f2-452d-9374-db6a876fc928">
      <Text>Another song begins, and a swarm of wisps attacks the gang.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="43ca63ad-e537-4529-ae1e-0a4a32954c4b">
      <Text>The gang tries to fend off the swarm. Bats, chains, bullets- all dodged and blocked swiftly by the wisps.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eca28400-5347-463e-8dca-ba0a3f0ef44f">
      <Text>A stray bullet nearly hits the kid from earlier; a wisp shield forms before it can land.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="10fdec59-c12c-42fc-8320-3c30f0352b27">
      <Text>The gang is killed until only Wendy and the leader remain.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="10fdec59-c12c-42fc-8320-3c30f0352b27">
      <Text>They stand across the crowd from each other, his gun aimed at her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ed0d4d1f-2cce-42df-b2bc-05a8b435b7c5">
      <Text>The wisps encircle him; Wendy grins back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f559053b-c897-47b2-bfea-5df4bc03f88e">
      <Text>The gang leader softens his gaze, tipping his hat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f559053b-c897-47b2-bfea-5df4bc03f88e">
      <Text>Wendy nods softly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a6acc283-dcc3-4e6d-b7a6-303ae8e6803f">
      <Text>He tries to pull the trigger. Wendy quickly strums hard, and the wisps punch through his body.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dd8378f4-6e74-4633-adcc-16dd2e7ec3be">
      <Text>A bloody body, with holes throughout, crumples to the ground, and everyone cheers, hoisting Wendy into the air as the wisps slowly fade out as the music stops.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="33dd609f-dcde-4b11-961e-906d0e4be0d6">
      <Text>FADE TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="10" Type="Scene Heading" id="567c3800-ce6f-4391-85ef-e2d9cfcbb4e0">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 6/8" Page="7" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WISP">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="33210207-ad4d-438d-b344-16ca29e6a5e2"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="1395a762-c1b6-4ef2-a75c-b367bee06a67"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. WENDY'S SHACK </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> LATER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5821ca69-331f-41cb-a0fa-56f8552e7474">
      <Text>Wendy is packing a bag, whistling. A WISP is floating nearby.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8d574b73-9eae-4ac5-a152-f41dfd846342">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="99077341-2e40-4660-aaf4-12e5f98baad6">
      <Text>(Morse Code Pulse)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2330cd00-902f-4cb6-a3e4-9f0dc511cade">
      <Text>You seem glum today, all things considered.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ef6cd488-4c7a-4b44-ae24-accc05d75954">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b41fc7fd-3115-4610-b8ce-f65e1f94d883">
      <Text>Totally not obvious, huh?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e726782f-0dc9-4448-9ae6-4a7a5afd5b72">
      <Text>She stops packing and looks at the wisp.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="48b7dd8e-5594-45b7-8665-411a3562c5ef">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b41fc7fd-3115-4610-b8ce-f65e1f94d883">
      <Text>It's because I want something new.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fa92c26e-5021-4608-a13a-176222a86e0f">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="563d310f-cb77-4d99-a386-458a439c1830">
      <Text>Are you telling me you don’t want the endless praise?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="be677bdc-894e-46ea-9a87-7cc67c953d3b">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="feff8713-cb24-40e8-9fb0-1e8e1337347e">
      <Text>No.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="099c7f1d-fc43-4046-9af3-4f2193701bd2">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fbe40a51-c253-4d92-91f7-a3e809abc7c0">
      <Text>The free food and place to stay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f7b7a1c8-8848-44a7-a558-a5d7a07d037f">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3485307a-30f3-43dd-b7e0-60df7000f392">
      <Text>No.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a92679b6-3f05-46aa-aa17-710ade364ad3">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1a59feba-64a2-4cca-abce-dd02c75cb367">
      <Text>Is it that you're tired of dealing with all the men in town?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="07dd0127-f644-45a6-9827-86f1cac906c6">
      <Text>She glares; it floats back a little.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="adc560c1-7776-44ab-b817-9beea16d48b1">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="98dcb602-379d-449e-ae2b-b338d8ae5258">
      <Text>Alright! Then tell me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2870ec9e-68c3-487f-bdf7-8f4bf6a08620">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6a32ca13-fa9d-4cdf-80e8-a4cdd54d55dd">
      <Text>I want to go out and explore.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6ed86e2d-31b4-48d8-900c-35c79b0d4125">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2f2bd479-6c35-4e00-b019-044c6af74c55">
      <Text>Oh no, the ‘I want to find myself’ arc.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c5bfa4be-6414-4c2c-bbfa-f5a907aab278">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d6396f88-856d-4068-ab07-a076e62b62b3">
      <Text>Shut up! I'm bored and want to find something more interesting.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="647c6d46-3409-4d8b-8842-6f840032885e">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6f03c71e-a519-4c2c-9da2-b3f3b1aaf66c">
      <Text>Maybe we'll start a band, find stronger men to beat up, even find a girl</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="487cd498-b651-4f2b-9232-0e93152b3c14">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0eb7a3d2-ad3b-4675-8a8e-d4398a78cdb7">
      <Text>One more word and you’re gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6e1b11f1-55a7-4c7a-9094-164355437686">
      <Text>The wisp drops a few inches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e2ec3eb5-a667-42b7-a63b-02c399f15cef">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c8838cb4-c8ce-4ccf-813f-45ac10d584cd">
      <Text>Fine, then please tell me where we’re going.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="68fbd832-7e1b-438d-af8f-3b76f9c1df04">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c1c78472-98b5-44e0-96c6-ff7f18bf73ef">
      <Text>I don't know, but I don't care.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="14f663ea-e768-419a-94d0-fc220e64e21a">
      <Text>A beat of silence; the wisp looks at the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="456925f4-e312-4151-b2ad-4e6611bb1e15">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d7f929c0-c6a3-43a6-8e3a-5a53ad45c93e">
      <Text>Then what are you waiting for? Let's go!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5e4c53fa-b40f-48ba-bab7-2716feacd225">
      <Text>The wisp flies over to the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9c72443e-0a37-44c4-bace-fd8c2692c1c0">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6fff9328-f117-4eb3-aed4-487813b6b2ed">
      <Text>What, really?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="00f70ed8-04a5-4252-84eb-5cdf1cad805f">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c7a8d8cb-555e-40f6-8d2a-164f9cd9f7e7">
      <Text>This was your idea; can you tell me why you are backing out now?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9ad2e805-7a63-46c9-b762-2c64e07791e5">
      <Text>Wendy stands, slings the guitar around and picks up her bag.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9b00a21b-aaa9-47bf-9080-71484e0a3576">
      <Text>She hesitates.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b738ce47-eb9c-4601-a1cc-3c6b1c38183f">
      <Text>The wisp pushes her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c5c60d91-87c1-4a8b-a130-e0b5371b5928">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a9b59b29-1ba9-4f28-a78f-1a35455af324">
      <Text>Alright, alright! I'm going.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f6ca38c1-c07d-4154-a37a-1a6635b8cbbe">
      <Text>Wendy leaves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="11" Type="Scene Heading" id="1f686cd0-c880-42c0-90d7-097b6e31db79">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 4/8" Page="9" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="ff0f5e56-ff49-4205-a240-450db18fbfd8"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DENIZEN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="ef88cf36-2b26-4ee2-a3d3-ade3d58d7ce6"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VILLAGE ELDER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="2ccb0424-79e8-462e-adc2-ad9e924169bb"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHILD">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="49fc2cb9-c8d4-4ed5-9e2d-83a0c2dab8ac"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. SMALL TOWN </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b2e60bb3-be12-49af-8d31-f7d376f48a79">
      <Text>Wendy walks out, looks around, then makes her way to the center of town.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b0250545-5da7-4d4a-a4bd-7f8d10dd2f0c">
      <Text>Once at the center, she sits, crisscross, on the edge of the fountain. People begin to gather.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c9fb8a1b-0acc-4b49-a9e1-fea7fd144eb6">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f20c8ea0-df31-47cc-abbc-8313a7384bd0">
      <Text>No performance today, guys, but I do have an announcement.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fb8593c8-aee4-42e1-80ef-0eed3be5edc6">
      <Text>The people look at each other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="579ad05c-3836-46e3-b40f-f2dad81658d4">
      <Text>DENIZEN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a042f64a-ce05-4942-b64e-d68e556a6e4f">
      <Text>What is it?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9509cae5-621b-4c8d-81b9-82463c5c3de1">
      <Text>Wendy takes a deep breath, then huffs and stands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="05672aba-0178-4123-acfb-4ae63ec1ceff">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9e713202-3faf-4e93-af8b-1773a7032cd1">
      <Text>It's time I take my leave now! You have all been generous beyond repayment.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9ec96ba1-5552-4256-8005-e93e75a757c0">
      <Text>VILLAGE ELDER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fb433bc4-c3ee-4c4d-9ded-ceb583f960a6">
      <Text>What are we going to do? How will we defend ourselves?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6434e678-7db8-432a-837d-20486b053b8d">
      <Text>Wendy stares out at the growing crowd.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5de06823-5c06-486d-865b-6448cc6bbee0">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="368b61e2-d40c-4fcf-801d-ad0e034320dc">
      <Text>I think you guys will be more than capable of defending yourselves. You did before I got here, and you will after I leave.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2dc2b350-5872-4630-a7ae-046e20511ba2">
      <Text>VILLAGE ELDER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ef1754e9-71aa-4f53-ab25-379f3fb0290b">
      <Text>But we've grown so much with you being here. You can't leave!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5c3ea2fa-d3db-4235-b06e-d2df0d9b0087">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1fbf2a9b-5ae6-4752-8322-350f890ec309">
      <Text>You have a capable militia, and an even more capable leader.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a5e9bd29-bb32-48bb-94e3-44e14184f14f">
      <Text>She smiles at the elder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="93a95133-989f-4856-b5c6-0ceb5bef3615">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="501bfdb8-a674-4c68-ade8-8589c0b3c9e9">
      <Text>I think you guys will do fantastic.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5138000d-e1ea-48c3-b7eb-cebd42d5e83a">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1e47228e-0038-4c61-9598-dd72e068b4c0">
      <Text>Besides...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c9561d07-dc55-414a-bf73-c412e4c6eb00">
      <Text>She begins to leave, the crowd parting for her like a funeral procession.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="679b49ce-666c-47b6-8e1c-e24a8c636e85">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9f8239c9-8f3e-48c7-bf82-c03ab21c2b09">
      <Text>I'll be back someday!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="36ff772b-79ce-492a-8db5-eb0dc5b588ae">
      <Text>The same child grabs her robe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="017504a8-df35-4c26-9319-22e800c30204">
      <Text>CHILD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="aa021900-38ef-4ba1-bf69-981e6cb74d86">
      <Text>Don't go, Wendy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2402ea09-bd10-4822-97ac-1dfbee1d44b3">
      <Text>She stops, turns and kneels in front of him, rubbing his hair.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f49a492b-925d-4fcb-8721-0664a696960b">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="26566fee-7fd6-4311-8e55-43acff150284">
      <Text>I'll miss you too.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4ac9df44-d416-420a-9d39-7df16b3e5deb">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="69b233a6-f1a8-4ce5-8e2d-46ea6d8f7fd6">
      <Text>I'll miss all of you!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8dc8ad5c-2517-4153-ae74-01d88a701b6c">
      <Text>She continues, then walks off into the distance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="1a226a5c-846f-4029-8714-3ed192cfc92c">
      <Text>FADE TO BLACK.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="dc605d97-51ea-401a-804d-0791a8aa9576">
      <Text>Episode 3</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="95bf2fc9-2a47-4745-acb1-a8c84eccaafe">
      <Text>TITLE CARD:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="1bec9132-cc1d-45e3-a460-b128bf6bf7d4">
      <Text>Sirens </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">III</Text>
      <Text> (Pastel Purple)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="ae3b2869-5417-4954-877d-95e1ae9a0224">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="12" Type="Scene Heading" id="cb438c92-64eb-4cb8-87fd-c28668694f7c">
      <SceneProperties Length="4 1/8" Page="12" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WISP">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="3f39776f-2aba-4363-84b3-b70638da9ae1"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BARTENDER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="0c4588d7-a317-4f99-9bd9-5685a4bbb0dd"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="THUG 1">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="1ae48d62-3e5b-4dcc-b918-d1ad3bf4931d"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="THUG 3">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="b566e9be-a758-432c-8b30-fcf3c243d662"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="a04d83ca-2742-4162-a1bd-45e5ec48beb3"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="THUG 2">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="2985aa15-1011-4a30-960c-df35ae03dac2"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="7fe3095b-07a0-44ea-8907-35eb866564e5"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Bar </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> AFternoon</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4892c6be-2af3-4d79-a67a-153a374c345c">
      <Text>Wendy, whistling with a wisp flying beside her, walks in and sits down, setting her bag down beside her. The bartender walks over; she looks up, he nods and pours a beer, setting it in front of her. She takes a drink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bb86a604-6836-4131-8880-4d0df0e4240e">
      <Text>Rowan walks inside; the bartender recognizes her immediately and gives her a bad look; she shoots a bad one back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="77b1352a-72df-43b5-a495-bc78f2815697">
      <Text>Then sits three stools down from Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="41be74a0-cac8-4689-ad8a-69e96abd6873">
      <Text>The bartender sets a drink in front of Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="62d6f26e-6fa5-4d3e-9af1-d1b7322a366e">
      <Text>Wendy looks over to Rowan as she takes a drink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dda0e974-c6f6-47ec-be37-87a82a782308">
      <Text>Wisp</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="d31c9c70-945d-4b7a-b28f-411d75db3a1e">
      <Text>(Morse code pulse)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0dfada0b-15b9-474a-b967-9987fc3d7d40">
      <Text>Damn.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fa016bd4-8906-4295-b294-367af730677e">
      <Text>Wendy takes a long drink. She sets it down as the wisp appears from behind the glass.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a5b72eca-be80-4929-bfae-78a7e594581b">
      <Text>Wisp</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e41f089b-3a4e-4abc-a193-0f30fa1aecae">
      <Text>Gonna say hi?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a63b0c4a-c00d-484c-bb24-82aa690287ff">
      <Text>Wendy shakes her head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="025783ca-59a2-4b3d-b11e-1e1ed551323c">
      <Text>Wisp</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0684796d-4622-4469-8933-0902ab136fbc">
      <Text>No eye contact?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ff9d6860-f0c6-454a-9310-bcd56d07f2e9">
      <Text>Another head shake.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="98d87592-8776-462b-93e1-18ec61394c3c">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="372fdf00-7a25-439e-86f2-9c65186d3f3e">
      <Text>Not even a glance?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="83f2ed8e-d271-483e-91e4-19e53fec9be0">
      <Text>Another head shake</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> like a pitcher disagreeing with a catcher.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d055af9c-266a-4c23-bacb-8912b3366641">
      <Text>Wisp</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="25e19e78-16d6-4328-8117-b268fa9c46ef">
      <Text>So nothing?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b999afd8-9ad3-4e0c-a1c9-916056a34228">
      <Text>Wendy gives a slight nod.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="350b9a7c-7fc2-4681-90c4-9785f07eddc5">
      <Text>Wisp</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1526a5ef-69b1-4232-9e5c-d36d9ad9840a">
      <Text>Wuss.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="16830f14-2b7d-4f64-b0a5-b3ab059e7d34">
      <Text>A group of three men walks inside and fills the seats between R&amp;W.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="02c463b1-1344-484e-8d63-c0959fdc5100">
      <Text>More similar—looking thugs walk in and take the other tables.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9f8c6db8-8ee6-45b1-99cb-dacafc2339fa">
      <Text>BarTENDER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="92d349d9-1a60-4d5b-8469-108e73edc0cd">
      <Text>What’ll it be, boys?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6f796464-6e92-44e4-954b-2c5de6fb5dd2">
      <Text>Thug 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dc65d0c7-8ae5-4d12-bbd8-84b78d5bc55c">
      <Text>A round of beer for all of us, including in the back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cdf3b7e1-d42a-4ecd-853f-59878c6ace9c">
      <Text>He nods and starts pouring the drinks, dispensing them as they’re prepared.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fe18e2dc-d9b9-484c-9c94-d02bb3b62bee">
      <Text>The thugs clink and drink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ea473f99-070c-4946-a2eb-333cd3ad68a5">
      <Text>One leans over to Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b9139be3-45f5-439c-b4e9-b9b6eee3f2ae">
      <Text>Thug 3</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5433d0ec-9875-45ea-adf4-3236af192b31">
      <Text>Hey, I heard you took out a lot of  </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Yankem’s</Text>
      <Text> gang the other day. That true?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="34c37fab-3f59-4ef4-90b3-f55749805143">
      <Text>Rowan gives the man a snide look.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="31386c2d-318c-407b-b927-6056f31675f6">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2d67a192-ff20-48e2-af56-fddbd685f64a">
      <Text>What’s it to ya?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1feef88d-1ee6-496a-aa66-eee5d727ca70">
      <Text>THUG 3</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="99c92975-9b8e-4a6d-b6f0-95c416fad8d8">
      <Text>Ah ha, ha, that’s hot, that’s hot.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2dfb16d1-729f-4409-aca7-c70873313d82">
      <Text>The guy takes a drink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a5656832-3697-4f9d-a928-af6e0fbc3e0c">
      <Text>Thug 3</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="93eac3ec-1e67-43ad-8be4-795fa23117e2">
      <Text>Do you live around here then?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dfa13290-9955-4b18-a865-59535a5e1f3f">
      <Text>Thug 2 looks over at Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a6e67588-46ee-4474-8297-a16acf3f5235">
      <Text>Thug 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="030ea595-6e64-4211-b847-4f47982b55e9">
      <Text>Rare to find a gal that drinks beer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="68313970-2741-4a29-b046-3da9d234edb1">
      <Text>Wendy turns towards the guy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0c850399-aae9-4671-be9c-0062846e7c66">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c9ff2319-dda6-41a8-ac86-b93cf8278c7d">
      <Text>Rare to find a thug not trying to force himself on a gal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="aa68cb07-15f5-463b-b674-6efff2e631c4">
      <Text>She takes a drink, making deep eye contact with the thug, who chuckles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5daf571c-58a5-41c0-baf5-86f4a3b82eb0">
      <Text>THUG 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d2239a16-c629-4cee-b531-738f2030c5e7">
      <Text>Well, not to sound cliché</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5d4f009f-35ea-4346-acaf-fcf037e23ccd">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a21adf82-3ea0-4d1b-a6cc-8edbb9c6f6c1">
      <Text>Then don’t.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="955a2541-a6a3-421c-91da-4f3df6741677">
      <Text>Awkward beat of silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4c69f8eb-9527-4aab-85a5-611f3e7a82f5">
      <Text>THUG 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0724da6a-c053-4912-ae13-a6c7830ae031">
      <Text>Well, I care less about the violence and more about the protection they provide.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2368e8e7-cd6e-43c0-bd04-6fff1da34f02">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="be9c923b-7fe6-4131-b23f-433167a7c40f">
      <Text>Really? Would you rather band with a gang of thugs than defend your hometown for the same protection and less rejection?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="35b543ab-d6b5-46aa-8453-f5f7f27c1284">
      <Text>The thug thinks on it for a moment.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b172fc58-0f57-4cf8-a8e4-06c43f9a73cf">
      <Text>WendY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3ce0cb29-9a4f-421b-836a-854c9d1bdc7b">
      <Text>I figured.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="abf66481-4cf3-4fca-bfb2-68e4161d0d9d">
      <Text>She takes another drink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2688772a-37df-4e7d-9c0b-b089f710f8dd">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c239ed7c-bc50-4219-9a5b-a0c326cea332">
      <Text>Cool.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="40806a75-fca8-443b-a6ff-271199586612">
      <Text>Half a beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cc3ad541-b52d-4f49-b875-a74ff4a8174d">
      <Text>Thug 3</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="018a0b5b-a36d-4262-8a9a-497c9ed5beb0">
      <Text>Yeah, I just came here from another town.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5ceb4dca-94d8-4cf7-a923-5b9ad78f0fb5">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b14749d8-20bb-442d-8002-a9667a7fc923">
      <Text>Cool.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="91375c7c-0a7b-464f-9074-0d771fa5d4f6">
      <Text>THUG 3</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="da747b28-cfc4-46f0-b7e3-55a17984f12c">
      <Text>Yeah, there was this chick we were hunting down after she killed a bunch of our friends.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="08f742b4-da2d-4220-8cdf-21be1cfc1b35">
      <Text>Rowan remains silent.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cad1868b-ae03-4274-8e8e-e16eea162ddd">
      <Text>Thug 3</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0de7f206-733f-45ee-867a-dc96d4672218">
      <Text>Actually, she’s talking to my friend right now, see?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="29f14498-d98f-46d7-be74-d779f0d1fd3c">
      <Text>He points over to the second thug.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bafc6db3-0276-44e3-b915-9151fc5b8e90">
      <Text>Thug 2 leans closer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d393f31c-e135-48e6-810b-00fb64e1545e">
      <Text>Thug 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="92db76cd-bd92-49c0-9505-f77cd4db8a14">
      <Text>Look, it’s not like that.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6c2f1bb6-97c0-4256-90a5-3a4e5834297b">
      <Text>Wendy rolls her eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="93cf7c5d-54f4-469e-acd5-0394803e7338">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="97797ef6-d072-493f-af79-c1d4c5987d41">
      <Text>I’m sure it isn’t.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3d4199cc-a025-4271-9e4c-2e72ecace74e">
      <Text>THUG 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dc640b32-6377-4186-8097-2e9c5c4a410b">
      <Text>I’m serious! Look, the rest of these guys are here to kill you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="af5fd8df-8f36-4dc8-bcbd-e37c3113a3a2">
      <Text>Wendy raises an eyebrow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fa455eb3-1a42-422d-9cc0-742c82f10076">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="421ea839-83b0-4fac-8356-555846d551d5">
      <Text>Really? Couldn’t tell, since you all look the same as the guys I took out the other day.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8c34ed89-79d0-4b53-a42d-13b3509bfd87">
      <Text>THUG 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8aadbb6a-e016-4757-ad2b-60484f9d2d7d">
      <Text>That’s why I’m talking to you. I convinced them that if you at least joined, then we wouldn’t have to kill you!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2b0fa283-7918-4c4e-9d9f-7d28e1fc587d">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="727ecbed-af5b-49c0-be4d-4bec056260ec">
      <Text>You guys would forgive me just like that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="755c60d7-76b0-4268-bb32-ded537c8a953">
      <Text>THUG 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8a563f51-a0eb-4170-9267-46989d5b9702">
      <Text>Yeah, I mean, who cares? A couple dead rascals to the one girl that stopped them all. Plus, you’d be protected by us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3888701d-bd56-4c66-b563-b978df72b092">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="07190e17-f9fd-4465-b3c7-a478e8cf2095">
      <Text>I’ll think about it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a1a832f8-48ae-4b48-9e69-baa159e76109">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="52275fdb-d3b9-4777-ada0-21696ff35790">
      <Text>(To Thug 3)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4253ffe5-fb44-4244-ba8f-e7337adbbee1">
      <Text>Do you expect that to work?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8143c7bf-88f8-4386-9ba1-f0725a5fe861">
      <Text>Thug 3</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="982e2706-1841-454a-b8b3-6287444d9573">
      <Text>Hey, she’s pretty cute, and strong too, I guess. Might as well try, am I right?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="42473b5b-2926-4b0b-ac7c-7323ede738b5">
      <Text>Rowan rolls her eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4a63d93f-f1b8-40fc-94ee-6628d290fd7f">
      <Text>Thug 3</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="aba59fb6-b741-4991-a596-444e93f01c73">
      <Text>Tell you what, how about this, after we figure out whether she’s gonna live or die, we can go back over to your place and</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="12309d16-15bf-4a8f-b6cb-ebe4de1b9ea0">
      <Text>He places a hand on her arm. She glares back. He grins nervously.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b41ff2bc-99d7-4393-bfd1-0d3d87fe16f1">
      <Text>Wendy finishes her drink, puts some cash down, and begins to walk away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="21288c77-04ab-433a-9cf2-4e91a0bc7700">
      <Text>Thug 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7b6a32fe-814e-40fe-8ccb-66ad259e193d">
      <Text>Hey, where’re you going?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="af7f41d7-244a-44f5-a09a-b2aeb86b28ae">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="87fc06b2-fbfe-4391-81a8-4690892eb528">
      <Text>Somewhere that isn’t here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a960072b-87ce-44bc-bc4b-1df8441f6344">
      <Text>She walks out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4109efc3-c445-4eed-aea5-82f85e45c371">
      <Text>Thug 1 looks at her, then to Thug 2.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c3821271-1e75-4453-86d1-0f30427f2e41">
      <Text>Thug 2 immediately bolts off his stool and out the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="13" Type="Scene Heading" id="c5fafaeb-3851-42f4-abf5-e1a10f41c15b">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="16" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="THUG 2">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="780a4c4b-92e5-49b2-a879-6c5cace2b043"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="69fddf0e-e3c3-45d7-a423-44d6a27627f0"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Small HAMLET </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> ConTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2eb5c8b3-ea48-4b73-b2cf-ecb19a498e21">
      <Text>Thug 2 runs out, looking for Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ea2e1b5e-fbcd-4358-afd2-075ba69325ab">
      <Text>Wendy walks toward the other side of town.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f7443e74-703f-4d77-9461-8aaa72fe44a3">
      <Text>The thug jogs up to her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="572d51ca-ad7c-4c48-a090-22b1597b9887">
      <Text>Thug 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="497240fc-4a6f-401f-acf9-5576d0d96b34">
      <Text>Hold up! Look, I’m really tryna cut you a break here. My friends, they don’t play. If you want to live, I’d seriously recommend you take my offer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b3789c96-c2c8-484b-a3db-fd0a0c4d19b9">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="197fe6a0-6337-479e-a260-2a9a4a7a4d29">
      <Text>I think I’m good, but thank you for the offer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a4ad7a69-f228-4d36-bf38-7e6c2c69ed90">
      <Text>THUG 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="516d86be-adbf-4e64-8ebc-ba7474d553ab">
      <Text>Suit yourself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bb15ef42-50b0-4fc6-926d-da5a7da79e13">
      <Text>He whistles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="94b11356-9c3c-494a-89a0-7a3b4c3211b8">
      <Text>A few beats pass; he whistles again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c2357e9b-c768-4f6f-ac9a-fd9c644af576">
      <Text>He looks back to Wendy and gives a nervous chuckle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="48981cd1-3e84-4e31-b4e6-ae5ba7501064">
      <Text>Thug 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="926341c3-d7c2-43c0-85b6-c0353e95c528">
      <Text>You know, that usually gets them goin’.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c7aaa32e-3fd3-40c4-ab7c-b3ea92e08900">
      <Text>He whistles again, then turns back to Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5af6b971-099d-4d31-9d9c-351ca6c749ec">
      <Text>Wendy is whistling softly, and a group of wisps attacks the thug, killing him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="df43a2af-8280-4aa2-b973-bd39b294ee60">
      <Text>Wendy returns to the bar and walks inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="14" Type="Scene Heading" id="bced1d70-ec0a-4b85-b1fe-bac598e43233">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="17" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="24fd905a-f4df-4d89-85a2-c8fd8a993d1c"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Bar </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> continUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4d6fc58c-95cb-48fd-978e-36ef6cc63a09">
      <Text>Rowan’s sitting at the bar drinking, veins and eyes pastel red. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0292cb1f-cfe0-48e1-a596-37b2fb1de95a">
      <Text>Around the bar are broken tables and dead bodies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b3cb0cf1-38dd-43b2-88f2-3a51a37d85a2">
      <Text>Wendy smirks, walking over to her bag, lifting it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9c187aa1-10a4-40e7-ab0d-ff10ec6335a3">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6239e6d8-b733-4e6f-bd06-e9bac62716cf">
      <Text>Hey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5e87a3a1-53df-446c-8dfb-cc22501806db">
      <Text>Rowan turns.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a0b6535e-0eb4-4f3b-84cb-6a3f8092e2fb">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8e3b556c-2af3-4638-b2f8-623d0ea1b880">
      <Text>Why don’t we head out?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d3668825-3827-4d25-8a6d-bca262f49389">
      <Text>Rowan finishes her drink, the red fading.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d3668825-3827-4d25-8a6d-bca262f49389">
      <Text>Rowan tosses some change on the counter and walks out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="15" Type="Scene Heading" id="e5e36860-6a16-4b2c-a5f2-d4621dd5f240">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="17" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="01e6eea4-a076-4c64-a661-d0f6f6198d7d"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="d9cf4af3-53c6-405f-b734-961c5e595bae"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Small HAMLET </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> conTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e6257134-6896-4bf2-acdd-cce122172b47">
      <Text>Rowan begins walking to her place. Wendy walks out shortly after and approaches a buggy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c7a28241-23be-4f29-aa19-230204469895">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3a80a760-7248-4346-920f-71145378a16f">
      <Text>Hey!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9bc98b1d-46f4-408a-b7e2-92318be8a1e2">
      <Text>Rowan stops and looks back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3042e38d-819d-490a-8497-e06be72ed16e">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e5cff982-c1e3-4a45-a3c0-85622952e18d">
      <Text>Where do you think you’re going?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5c478c81-5d52-4fad-8c54-eaa3214e3fcf">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0c9cb704-67d6-4eed-a70c-944f66ba3f89">
      <Text>Home.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3f00853e-666c-47b6-b65f-2e3c99aff541">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8c5c8968-41ee-4ebd-8905-9c61b95b4d2c">
      <Text>I think not. Can’t have someone like you stuck here; you must be bored out of your mind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cd7f8245-cb7a-4d41-95af-ac622573bec5">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="de84c9ec-2519-4d0a-ab72-d05a686b48b8">
      <Text>I think I’m good actually, but thanks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="810c9ae0-b515-4527-bd87-bf54b9e762f2">
      <Text>Rowan continues walking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4c648328-b999-4c49-92e1-b0cd8bce3180">
      <Text>Wendy’s face reads determined, and she begins strumming. Wisps flow from the guitar and swirl around Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d7cf7f95-f73d-4e9b-a569-4a7ffbe29352">
      <Text>Rowan throws her head back then turns around, taking a fighting stance as her veins and eyes turn pastel red.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="685d61ff-c25c-447f-866f-f86aa08a5591">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7d061a4c-6ecc-4a69-aeee-6b5cf154ebc6">
      <Text>Ah, ah, ah. I’m not trying to fight. I’m trying to tell you that I want you with me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f71a1a11-077c-46a4-9141-1390af1c3d46">
      <Text>The wisps nudge at Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2cd66f82-6b18-4b30-8bd0-982fb6b2f8c7">
      <Text>Rowan relaxes and looks at the wisps, feigning puppy eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6addb52b-e95a-4e77-b2af-ddd4a27e3810">
      <Text>Rowan exhales, then walks back to the buggy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="86e705e4-5871-4d3a-b681-a74fbdf6614b">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8cec5357-391d-4b6e-be80-92ac0fc97d57">
      <Text>Yay!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d4b2fb57-7d71-44b7-bc8a-0ef026f6085f">
      <Text>She scampers over to the other side of the buggy and sits inside, the wisps dissipating with the music. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="32c46e08-6829-4634-a8d7-a4b421bf7284">
      <Text>Rowan sits inside the buggy and starts it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ff8cee53-8db2-4bf6-ae46-66c90955f506">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="90dda5a4-97a6-444b-be6a-9e8eb113d811">
      <Text>So, where are we going?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="49c97c22-34ef-40cd-8f5b-c9e3b0b34589">
      <Text>Rowan glares at Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="faaa9d4b-af3c-4c93-94d2-f50fa0cd933f">
      <Text>Wendy grins back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="2f19ea55-e16f-4f23-a1a9-b8475ff61e55">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="51e615ef-961f-475f-9e82-4f5d2f24a9e1">
      <Text>Episode 4</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="d63c77b2-1515-42d4-871e-ec6de63b9137">
      <Text>TITLE CARD:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="d49c132f-afa0-4910-93d2-9e59cae75de3">
      <Text>Black IV (Rose Red)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="48dd19a4-1d13-4fa2-a481-32332476422a">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="16" Type="Scene Heading" id="9275dea0-3942-4699-96f4-51cc0f4e4363">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 7/8" Page="19" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="7dae9175-758e-43a0-abc5-b2795e65a3d1"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="3e41a6c3-fcd8-401b-b494-5ea3081a3d8d"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int./Ext. Buggy </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="96f61573-b236-456a-91ea-527ff22b5994">
      <Text>R&amp;W are driving down a highway.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="53c682ec-0e30-4a67-b400-21fae074ca03">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="21ffeabe-3d5a-4df3-9745-843936d7fea4">
      <Text>What’s your name?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="37e3f312-41f1-4df8-8695-6f1e9b0fecbb">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5046e3a3-99f8-4f2b-9593-ca0c3df6c1e4">
      <Text>Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="137abcf4-95cf-4cfa-9b90-0deae17f9a31">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="62207ef0-4ee4-48db-9a6f-7cacfb77e60b">
      <Text>Interesting name for a girl. Do you know why your parents chose it? I’m Wendy, by the way.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3806b4c4-1eb0-47d9-a8f5-b9d71ffbb245">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a9692e2a-dc64-4918-bf5b-59ee8db5bab7">
      <Text>Nope.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fe2f2926-d556-422f-9652-fe115f713000">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7f5027c1-9789-4e8e-86ca-8071c0cec9ae">
      <Text>My parents told me that they named me after this character Owen Hardy. I can’t remember where it’s from, oh wait, duh, it’s from a book.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7475c4c3-bb02-49c3-9a07-7afc826a7a04">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8d67c3df-23ef-4a7f-b379-ab2cca531662">
      <Text>That’s nice.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="63e1dc68-380c-4607-af9f-2b1b31e3d547">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3ec26ed2-0ac5-4dc0-a1a6-19d51414bad2">
      <Text>When I was younger, before my parents died.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9c87b6ca-67bb-4e7d-baee-f8ba18bd64db">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0ea2b785-c60e-4d24-ad87-4e567715adcb">
      <Text>Sorry your parents died.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5b872112-1587-414c-a42d-d8f70d8848a4">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7a2be53a-a427-4b50-8971-ca9c219da81e">
      <Text>Don’t worry, I’m as over it as you can be by this point.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e43152ba-9493-45db-8122-2974dc789ad4">
      <Text>An empty beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7156ed00-d4ae-461a-944b-f88e8fe7edab">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a51cbc88-47c3-4178-9bb4-25f7995653e7">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Anywhosers</Text>
      <Text>, so the duh was because when I was younger, they took me to meet the author. Back when all this was still normal and not like a nuclear holocaust. He was really cool; apparently he’s a drummer for a band too. But, I digress. There was this other time where they took me on a vacation across the country. It was really sweet because we were at the water park and this girl ended up complimenting my bikini, which, in hindsight, was weird, but again, I digress. I said, ‘Oh my god, thank you! Yours is cute too!’ They were this really cool paisley pattern. Do you know what paisley is?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e35a8ea4-79df-41d9-8b3f-1bf99cd9fcc6">
      <Text>Rowan shakes her head once.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5824ac00-bd7b-4a95-913a-e53b7bd630af">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="540c9344-5525-4150-b020-968adf3b27f0">
      <Text>Well, paisley is this </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">mathmecal</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">mathemacal</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>mathematical, bleh, can’t speak apparently.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d9d2d0b3-ef57-4c1e-a27b-f6ff7cf7120e">
      <Text>She nervously chuckles; Rowan remains silent.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2b5e89aa-8af0-40cb-bdb4-d464fc58145c">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="83689d06-aec8-4768-9ec1-ad28c8e7df76">
      <Text>Anyway, so they’re this really cool math</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>e</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>ma</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ti</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">cal</Text>
      <Text> pattern that’s supposed to represent some fractal stuff. I don’t know too much beyond that, but I know they looked cool...so yeah, she ended up walking away after that, but I stopped her because I was like, in my head like, ‘hey, how do you just say something like that and not follow it up?’ So I stopped her and said, ‘You wanna get some ice cream together?’ Oh, by the way, this was an all—inclusive resort, so I wasn’t trying to get her to pay for it or anything, for the record...so yeah, we go over to the ice cream stand. I got my favorite flavor, rocky road, and she got something too: salted caramel drizzle over vanilla. I remember watching the guy pour it over the ice cream, and when he handed it to this chick, I was immediately like, ‘Can I try it?’ So she let me have a bite from her cone. Wait, are you a biter or a licker?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="616430ee-a5ff-4afd-be0b-8fc6990f2dd6">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f133be5c-2fe9-41a6-8254-b13982caf0cb">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7b5377d1-dc1f-4a12-9546-e2f8d45fb3a5">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="95daec43-a3ac-4a0f-b0ea-5d46eeb7a50a">
      <Text>When you eat your ice cream, do you bite or lick it?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f63a2d31-827f-4539-9aad-3b5287eaa411">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="44a8605b-e4d5-4060-b9af-ead7cdeae7f3">
      <Text>Oh, I don’t know, I don’t think about that stuff. But I guess I’m a licker.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="451d185d-5e6a-494d-b22a-5c5cd1a9bb37">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e5f589b0-189b-4a45-8a9a-3c4bc4f4d395">
      <Text>Oh, gotcha. Well, I’m a biter. So yeah, it was the first bite of her cone, and she let me have it. But I don’t think she really cared, honestly. But whatever, anyway, yeah...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d31a1bf1-8c97-42ca-b4e7-ed533f2dfbe0">
      <Text>She thinks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f1784802-8bac-4c24-b154-9559f3049302">
      <Text>WenDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e5f589b0-189b-4a45-8a9a-3c4bc4f4d395">
      <Text>Yeah...so she lets me try, and oh my god, Rowan, have you ever tried it before?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="06b93fea-a910-4789-977d-763e1b9dc89d">
      <Text>Rowan shakes her head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="deb97dee-a784-4470-ba86-817c104fa09f">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2501c74a-59aa-463c-aac6-2f64a9f23fa3">
      <Text>Rowan, how have you not? It’s so good, like, if there were a way I could have you try it, I would, seriously. So I try it, and I’m like, ‘This is really good!’ And she said, ‘Yeah, I know, right?’ So I was like, ‘You wanna try mine?’ And she said, ‘Yeah,’ so I let her, and it was before I even had a bite of it, so she ends up licking it</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> oh my god, and you’re a licker too, twins! Anyway, she licks it and is like ‘wow this is really good too,’ and I’m like ‘duh, it’s rocky road, it’s the best flavor in the whole wide world.’ So we ended up eating our ice cream together, and we played together for the rest of the day. I never saw her again. But, from that day on, I’ve always put salted caramel drizzle on my rocky road ice cream. Do you have any stories?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="d5a731e6-5492-40de-9017-de99fb0c826e">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="17" Type="Scene Heading" id="33d1952f-2dc5-4ffa-8414-af94ec917d6a">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="22" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="42eb1946-a358-4434-9dc4-7f229cd798a9"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="9903ca1d-d4ea-4784-95bb-37f6776ffb21"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. town </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> evening</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5aa0652c-a364-42ab-b2a4-4816d25e0228">
      <Text>Rowan pulls up to a tavern.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4b796d53-84e0-41b0-8633-8cb438e9e89f">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="708e56e5-0ffb-438b-82fd-58523bb9f61e">
      <Text>Why haven’t you said anything this whole ride?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="635c36de-040a-4991-8424-a267cbd83703">
      <Text>Rowan looks over and makes brief eye contact.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a283a943-b050-4c93-b85a-95d8cdda8c3c">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e00f519f-f91a-4bd3-8375-cf7f47e45aa4">
      <Text>You just talk a lot.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a0817261-0429-43c8-a32a-c8a1349a673c">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="586a20de-a027-42c6-b623-f23f86c3ae19">
      <Text>Wendy covers her head with her hat and turns away, huffing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e07676a4-e070-4ce6-9975-aaf129b4a954">
      <Text>Rowan steps out of the buggy, grabs Wendy’s bag, and walks inside the hotel.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5105a441-78e2-4f46-a00e-60720edf160f">
      <Text>JEFF watches them enter from a distance and slips into an alley.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="45205af9-26e3-412e-bac9-3f650ec9a016">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="db20d176-341a-4f4d-aab0-4732df1227ec">
      <Text>Episode 5</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="5e6bbe5e-142e-4a80-9d25-7ff365a4bc8d">
      <Text>TITLE CARD:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="20034069-ccfd-4c61-a3f4-2706a488fece">
      <Text>Sex Type Thing V (Name: Brick Red/Numeral: Sky Blue)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="da5767a7-f687-495b-a45f-9344b2c0fb5e">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="18" Type="Scene Heading" id="19951169-aff8-46c1-8565-6041511fd6c8">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="23" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SCOTT">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="a2f26f12-8ba7-4332-9ab2-34f4961d68e0"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JEFF">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="c6a1972d-08a1-4cb3-991e-888f784c4cfc"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHESTER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="09aed075-4d97-479e-8a83-121d1003aaf0"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MIHAI NICULESCU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="5581fd58-639d-4491-b2cf-632538ec1ef4"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Man Cave </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> Later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="276676bc-0e01-4ba6-8ebf-2b46d6c1963b">
      <Text>Jeff enters. SCOTT sits in a recliner, and CHESTER lies on the couch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bd10a4d4-2699-478f-b93c-a11e613cf1e5">
      <Text>Scott looks to Jeff, then extends his arm, and they dap up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bf9cb145-e2bd-46cb-bd05-161dea9b27d6">
      <Text>Scott</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c3dcae62-e7d9-4b1b-9f51-6e461d6138c3">
      <Text>Jeff! Dude, what’s up? Take a seat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="54fa6f65-9cc4-4d6f-9032-6bcd61b065ab">
      <Text>Scott pulls out a cigarette and lights it, then offers one to Jeff, who raises a soft hand. Jeff sits on the chair next to the couch, opposite Scott’s recliner.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="983be10a-ab8c-4c5c-b87f-c133316928a5">
      <Text>Jeff</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="465897f6-0400-4a42-a4cc-a59c4aa39731">
      <Text>Dude, two chicks just got into town. Babes. Thought you two might want to introduce yourselves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d18f6a29-50e0-494f-bf7c-93a540acb0f4">
      <Text>Scott laughs. Chester sits up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e487e468-bf6e-4b5b-bef9-4a2521f36425">
      <Text>Chester</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d33b0ed7-205f-47a6-8b48-dc782064c370">
      <Text>Easy stuff, no trouble at all, right, dude?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9620eef1-edb0-46cd-82b9-16bfd386f260">
      <Text>They dap each other up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="afea97e2-b8f2-4dd9-9005-3c3bbdedc5b2">
      <Text>ScOTT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="49783e1e-486c-40be-9327-cae79bf52bca">
      <Text>Where are they at?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cc7e64f1-b869-47f9-95fb-af78b68c6a60">
      <Text>Jeff</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="477a1caf-a473-4698-b7ff-160812567aa2">
      <Text>They just got to the hotel down the block. You guys should go before they get into a room. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="10f36e3d-d694-49dd-b919-844c1ce7b736">
      <Text>Chester pulls out a wad of cash and hands Jeff a twenty.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2e0b0a04-92c7-44d9-8879-cf9aaf094176">
      <Text>Chester</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5f5630a1-4b8e-4deb-8809-bd5ef0f31b7b">
      <Text>Buy yourself something nice.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="99620f3e-a088-4c18-b0a5-25a7bd94478e">
      <Text>He takes the money, daps up Chester, then watches as they get up and leave. Jeff daps Scott on the way out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a6afa91c-1c8a-4592-80db-db5a4f2037f2">
      <Text>Jeff walks over to the phone, picks it up and calls someone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="86c520a4-0a58-47a7-92fd-aa292d1482cc">
      <Text>Jeff</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="edad6baa-3174-42c2-8869-8ed9d03ae90d">
      <Text>Hey, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">brochacho</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fcdac283-c88d-4f4a-81ed-19a656c650a5">
      <Text>Mihai Niculescu (o.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="33f3fc7b-f613-496d-a5be-b804abc3bf1b">
      <Text>Don’t call me that.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c7316027-cbd0-4c68-bb23-edf6f7e16895">
      <Text>JEFF</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="44c08aa1-ad51-4190-8a29-1f45da371331">
      <Text>Yes, sorry. Mihai, another two colors on the scene, dude. Thought you might wanna know.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="382003bf-3d59-41b8-a01a-b85f84cbad7d">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU (o.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b467b6d5-4124-4d41-8039-9a3249b51235">
      <Text>Interesting.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e8230925-3164-4534-aff3-e0ca8297f1a5">
      <Text>He hangs up. Jeff, deflated, hangs up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="19" Type="Scene Heading" id="b56c4f6b-a493-43ad-a33c-15efa7248144">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 4/8" Page="24" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SCOTT">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="198d1603-dae2-4121-b6ae-85d8bcc6adb4"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="2e74a5aa-c787-4097-ba09-7e024d539013"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="a56dc2bf-62c6-471b-b371-a9af6e0d5b22"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHESTER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="0c22ceb1-91f7-4b22-8e0f-dc94591a57bc"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Hotel Lobby </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e7221829-edd5-4be1-b62a-6567c6dc3e7e">
      <Text>Scott &amp; Chester walk inside and see R&amp;W about to head out, notably bagless.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d992fc7e-9e79-4ca0-bede-5b3660acb4f7">
      <Text>The girls walk by, the guys swivel back, then catch up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="88692725-609a-4441-907c-86a79b7698b4">
      <Text>Scott</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cc60cfa9-8bf3-42f2-8588-a4b413746bf8">
      <Text>Ladies!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="164c5e1f-5822-4806-afc0-281d66230774">
      <Text>They stop, then turn around.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f8a04c8f-5afc-4b70-8f46-ffdb3d02d2a4">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d98701f5-b27e-4ae5-9cd0-567fcd686b64">
      <Text>What’s up?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8d9f4b3e-0335-4edc-9d23-bac965421fe0">
      <Text>SCOTT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0f32b41d-6dd8-47d7-92cd-e84a34ea84ba">
      <Text>A friend of mine spotted you two and said we should say hi, so hello!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c4d42738-da2b-4489-978c-4d6756570da2">
      <Text>He sticks out a hand; Wendy shakes it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3b4705fc-bbd8-4a38-ad87-c42f44f3c311">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6cda8c88-6ad4-4298-94a2-0d193c28e620">
      <Text>Hello!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5829fb13-46f9-4dda-818e-2a952ed073af">
      <Text>He goes for Rowan’s; she ignores the gesture.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d5aac1ca-2cf3-437c-b4cb-4a31bb80b2f0">
      <Text>Scott</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cf6a8f2f-f23b-4aac-b0cb-7796a8d615c0">
      <Text>Okay, well, where are you two off to tonight?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dd7cc0b9-008a-463b-80f8-c91d37bdfc92">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e16225b2-3a8c-4275-b777-04bb9eeb785c">
      <Text>We were gonna get food since we’ve been driving all day.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6aa56cbd-99da-4f4e-a2b4-9b402bf50231">
      <Text>Scott</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4ee060ba-e841-4710-8e45-211ab491bc61">
      <Text>Really? Where’d you guys drive from?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ae7eb4eb-1faa-44cb-abb4-4d63cba91652">
      <Text>WendY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c82b66ed-eb59-48cb-9154-fe065337b3f3">
      <Text>The state over; we’re trying to make it to the East Coast.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fae0ef4d-9801-49ca-9166-f95b971d4eb6">
      <Text>Scott crosses his arms and shifts his weight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e0e269f8-3212-4a0e-b0c2-ae1a289d1b4a">
      <Text>SCOTT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f8b7ff30-c49f-4f5d-9fe0-767124f46b78">
      <Text>That’s cool! Do you guys live a state over, or is this some cross</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>country thing?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cfe0d714-41be-471c-a34c-2e16e32104cf">
      <Text>Rowan grabs Wendy’s arm and starts pulling her away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e7362005-1398-4fc5-974c-a98be376d870">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f8a4e893-cb37-4a99-bf80-b36a7f610592">
      <Text>No disrespect, but we’re both really hungry and would like to eat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="66c8061d-59f9-40a8-aebb-159a9202e41a">
      <Text>Chester</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0dcc45b5-b6b9-4648-b6b9-17a9495f509f">
      <Text>Hold on now, ladies. No need to rush; we’ll handle the food for you two tonight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dee9dce0-f5e2-469a-8bf5-7c19904b4898">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="712fc352-3fa4-4ab3-ae97-f82797572da2">
      <Text>Thanks, but no thanks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="11ebfe16-63ef-441c-ba0f-8a0a5c2bf34f">
      <Text>Chester’s pupils and his leg veins flare orange, and he glides in front of them before they can reach the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b957b55f-07d1-4097-b9e6-bdf1f7578087">
      <Text>CHESTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="88eb53eb-2f11-4922-a7fd-a7316913c2c1">
      <Text>That wasn’t a proposition. We run this town; you two aren’t going anywhere without us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="64e31d2e-9a37-4a5e-8e1f-73c32be272cb">
      <Text>Wendy equips her guitar. Rowan’s eyes &amp; veins turn pastel red.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0437e172-d6c1-4cf2-bc65-458c46273d80">
      <Text>Chester</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b6207bfc-8464-468d-8544-550c22b7f15b">
      <Text>Oh, gonna serenade me?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a2bd8b8f-5948-4304-92c1-61938f92f0df">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4e55664a-db9b-4f6b-8b1e-3b0cb512b9c9">
      <Text>Sure.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="10973ce6-ac26-4b47-962f-b444e58269cf">
      <Text>Scott walks next to Chester.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e6ffd6e6-9fe8-4b03-9059-03fd7a766ff2">
      <Text>Scott</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cf251c5d-7346-4db9-a1f1-9c5e276eca48">
      <Text>Look, I like you, and I want you. Now we can do this the easy way or the hard way. The choice is yours.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2c13e5ac-9812-47a1-aeba-1350a71e6a22">
      <Text>Wendy strums, the wisps emerging around her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9f20b1f0-5089-4134-9c60-9f3171f9a5bc">
      <Text>Chester throws a spin kick aimed at Rowan’s head. Wendy strums again, and the wisps form a shield beside Rowan’s head. The wisps disperse. Rowan looks at Wendy, who looks and smirks at her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ce3a6762-1ee0-417f-bdab-9231cef2c675">
      <Text>Scott’s arm veins and pupils turn green, and he throws a punch at Wendy, blocked with a strum and a shield of wisps.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0e9356e1-2814-415a-9436-155ccf519486">
      <Text>Rowan strikes Chester in the leg; following is a swarm of wisps in the same spot.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5999f1cb-833e-499b-90cd-e64f6deb02af">
      <Text>Scott swings for Rowan as Chester reels from the pain.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="40a8afd3-f2a1-4d53-8630-8e599c4d434a">
      <Text>Rowan ducks, but Chester’s leg sweeps and she falls, hitting the ground as the wisps barely save her head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0a55076e-93c3-47c8-82ea-7ba02402f8fe">
      <Text>Wendy’s color shifts to Sky Blue.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c32ad089-ed46-438c-a408-1f8b0c96ae2c">
      <Text>Scott swings at Wendy, and she wraps wisps around his leg and lifts him into the air. Rowan uses him as a punching bag while Chester tries to kick more, but he gets blocked and counter—punched by another swarm of wisps.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ae594171-fc24-443f-8de3-a7a4fecce00d">
      <Text>Rowan roundhouse kicks Scott’s head off, and the wisps punch through Chester’s chest. Both collapse to the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b76b0ead-84ed-4f7e-9b16-e71db9d29785">
      <Text>Rowan’s color shifts to Brick Red.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="503b6c37-3b1d-4a42-8b56-352dc0eb656e">
      <Text>Wendy restores the guitar to her back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="40d31ff5-a8e4-4131-857c-aa2b5af5cfc4">
      <Text>She puts her hand up for a high—five; Rowan pokes the hand, then walks out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="55723878-9c74-4e61-9ece-d88b37319eeb">
      <Text>Wendy huffs as she follows her out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c6a73b70-b021-448e-82df-7d97ef294599">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="d4d787be-420e-4edc-9fac-ce43ccd2bd19">
      <Text>(to self)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b39773bc-c917-465a-97cf-25c0d34166bc">
      <Text>Could have at least said thanks or something.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="8607b83e-b0f3-4151-8fef-d5f1417f085c">
      <Text>EPISODE 6</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="abd7b5a7-dfde-42b9-80eb-822fb825a496">
      <Text>TITLE CARD:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="cfc4680d-d7f5-4ef7-8d87-431cbf56c9b6">
      <Text>Swamp Song VI (Name: Steel Blue/Numeral: Ember Red)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="e28ca120-d2db-4c9d-a931-8193f82c9233">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="20" Type="Scene Heading" id="14eb3d11-6467-40c8-8f40-9238249f65e0">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 3/8" Page="27" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="285239d8-6cb1-4b4d-9ddf-9a600a8c2c9a"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="19764c1d-6d1b-43f0-afdb-421355cbf341"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BARTENDER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="e6176a9b-d98e-4ea3-9bbf-1b3094d54369"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ABIGAIL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="2ce702a3-06da-4f14-ad5f-553ab6938cdb"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ASTOR">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="3a9e11ae-4803-494d-b108-8b54ec686f71"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Tavern </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> morning</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2e83d3d7-ddab-4845-9bd6-8f1f0b2ea74f">
      <Text>R&amp;W walk inside. Wendy yawns and stretches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="97215158-82b7-4d5d-8421-52703633fba4">
      <Text>She pulls out a chair and sits at the table; Rowan walks over to the bar top.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="72243680-0b32-413d-83f1-c5e323233893">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a7c8ee73-2156-444a-b7d0-b050550f862e">
      <Text>Two regular whatever you guys have for food around here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="42313b35-c4ef-4484-a68d-d05f5445a5d8">
      <Text>She slams cash on the counter and turns away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="42313b35-c4ef-4484-a68d-d05f5445a5d8">
      <Text>The bartender stares at the cash for a beat, then swipes it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="42313b35-c4ef-4484-a68d-d05f5445a5d8">
      <Text>She walks over to the table and sits across from Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1515506b-f3d3-4629-82b6-18c7d646c58d">
      <Text>Wendy rests her head on her hand and stares at Rowan for a few beats.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="83952c8c-4559-42e8-9b0a-85f1e109e121">
      <Text>Rowan stares out the window, light accentuating her features.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f1fd2a7c-d7bc-4f1e-bbf8-4c1cb153f805">
      <Text>Wendy’s color shifts to Steel Blue.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="768d3dd1-ed69-4ce9-b2f0-428288ddbe07">
      <Text>The bartender sets a plate of food in front of each of them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="49d985c4-3620-4100-9958-34c68ec4a07c">
      <Text>Rowan turns to the plate, then notices Wendy staring; she chuckles and starts eating.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f4a5dd1d-464d-467f-9d9e-ae4d6348b735">
      <Text>Wendy’s face turns pouty.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="00ac8f82-3a88-445b-9e42-b9e8988e2792">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="33d20146-c010-466d-a20f-afdf78c38dba">
      <Text>Not even a good morning?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="14a5452a-dbf1-4d08-a597-8bdf41a0fc77">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c8c47283-f7ca-4906-ab36-a8d0d5ba443b">
      <Text>Was it one for you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4d29dd23-7cb4-46d6-91f2-9267277a1a83">
      <Text>A beat and a half.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0e08442c-3e32-4482-9dc7-2014484709c1">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="373f5680-8e79-4cd5-ae69-f75412e3a817">
      <Text>(Muttering)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="48ab529b-2191-4248-b3f6-bbd306b44b55">
      <Text>Yes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="488281d7-0a38-472c-a201-07e389a97647">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6ac8d43b-f325-4590-835f-ed286a869db1">
      <Text>Good.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="36c23658-9169-48a9-946b-2ab2ddfedbf3">
      <Text>Rowan continues eating; Wendy eventually does.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="698ea844-00e9-41ee-8674-ea53a469bb45">
      <Text>ASTOR &amp; ABIGAIL walk inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="82ffef45-2c4b-45e4-b0fa-0b24a94a0c2f">
      <Text>Bartender</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="85de1ec6-9750-4005-ac67-7dd53fe1e597">
      <Text>Welcome back, ladies! What can I get for</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="685b9830-881b-4c59-9052-98c227286eb4">
      <Text>AbiGAIL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cfa14cc5-2ca5-4bc1-9fe4-e6a1cd22a428">
      <Text>Shut it!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bc786f8e-8ba1-4316-a348-ba54336c9b12">
      <Text>Abigail glares.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d06e463b-3dc0-4fb3-8ef7-fbe9a23b3139">
      <Text>Astor looks around and spots R&amp;W eating; A&amp;A sit down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="888dec48-d3be-4637-82cd-c1997b0ea9ec">
      <Text>Abigail reverses the chair and rests on its back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7d0363dd-4d2e-45e4-bd7c-2e33ab746733">
      <Text>Astor sits, crosses her legs and taps her foot in the air.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c899bc58-1198-4f88-8bd3-80246f460b28">
      <Text>R&amp;W continue eating.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bb0ef179-c59a-4308-a6d7-3613f06513ec">
      <Text>Astor</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="13e9d3cc-a6cb-48ef-ac66-e9c616feb8c5">
      <Text>It’s rude not to say hello.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ea81656f-2fe6-4b26-b373-c66aa8e21edf">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="66992764-3662-4296-8b95-e60df1d0a683">
      <Text>It’s rude to sit uninvited at someone’s table.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fb142164-3b45-4c1a-b7b7-eb3dec4b8459">
      <Text>They shoot each other a look.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="34b17996-f76a-4fd0-a270-664d9d7819d3">
      <Text>Astor</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4427ab91-66e2-425c-ac0e-a53d1f0d97ea">
      <Text>I didn’t know we had to invite ourselves to sit at our own place.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="159c74d5-ad32-43ae-a4f2-793ffe4f6c42">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dfa2d023-95f8-4222-8d27-5073d9fd9db0">
      <Text>Can’t be guilty for what you don’t know!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="89169692-985c-415b-aa48-47f18164cbca">
      <Text>Astor gasps. Rowan chuckles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="68431584-42e4-4e73-b5b0-f545b8a8ee15">
      <Text>ASTOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c1fc0cdc-ca45-4ec2-8fe7-825ba6da605a">
      <Text>I was told you two were passing through, and we wanted to make your acquaintance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8ea7d7f3-df5d-476c-97be-fe57ef1bf03c">
      <Text>She adjusts in her seat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e963df96-0d3d-4034-b838-4c7e0582d1ef">
      <Text>Astor</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ee8935e9-0c07-4c48-b946-e4a6c49aaf9f">
      <Text>Two strong women roll into town; I couldn’t help but want to see what all the buzz was about.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2d879793-8080-4602-9e30-50a036da7a22">
      <Text>Wendy adjusts in her seat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="48296d3d-14a4-457a-b89e-9b56a42dc718">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f4f68cc8-b6a1-4cd1-b3c5-1a5741bfaf14">
      <Text>I may have overestimated your status, given that you think us celebrities.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6dcb136f-692f-4939-ada1-b33c4d51d04b">
      <Text>ASTOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8bbea9dc-7fd8-4f53-967e-f51484e3f800">
      <Text>I have an idea: how about you meet us outside later? Whenever you’re done with the grub.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="25a025b6-4443-4299-a264-59cbcd0335f0">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="62909611-7fc7-4fa4-ba6d-f264c8e85d61">
      <Text>An honor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="150e780c-824c-4872-9f20-e4e53c8b7c87">
      <Text>Wendy makes a face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8241e647-e43b-4184-b1b1-8955c0f8e5d7">
      <Text>A&amp;A stand up and leave.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9be411bc-b359-4ce0-b202-8e72b18d4716">
      <Text>Rowan takes a bite of food; Wendy looks to her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d50be110-4bbb-4306-b888-cb6a59556ac2">
      <Text>WEndy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ffbddb5a-211c-4fa3-ae1e-8931124092f5">
      <Text>I hate cunts.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="9affd9e5-4fbe-4ab8-b4df-fce073cfb07e">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="21" Type="Scene Heading" id="c0a1e2ca-f156-49b8-808a-8d1dd7332091">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="29" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ASTOR">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="01788f0c-b2a4-4044-99f5-c9ab7757b93d"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="5727ff0c-4160-4ab8-839d-a3d51bb1d066"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="6bbb65cb-06d2-4836-841c-bd8b2c871fd8"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ABIGAIL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="646b88b4-f055-4374-a69e-dc8a1d509680"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. MeDIUM TOWN </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f60ded4b-1e95-4e08-ab68-290a430d5447">
      <Text>R&amp;W saunter out from the tavern; Abigail and Astor are standing in the town center.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5d875478-f817-42e3-9550-b2a3c82dde06">
      <Text>ASTOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c9dec160-b65c-46a9-ab86-c59c890c4f4b">
      <Text>Took your time, didn’t you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fda10f94-06fd-466d-9edf-ccb2c643d3bc">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c3c0474e-fb12-4b04-8145-39ee2828a2b5">
      <Text>Fashionably late!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2f7321e5-8c8f-4257-b669-21fa78af970c">
      <Text>She makes a face at Astor. A&amp;A approach them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bc7f6b17-b69a-4726-a564-4eb46255edcc">
      <Text>R&amp;W look at each other; Wendy gently strums a melody on her guitar, and the wisps emerge from the guitar and swirl around Rowan’s fists.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b4b286f1-c1ff-40f7-b1c6-8a2adc617139">
      <Text>A&amp;A stop right in front of both of them; Astor smirks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c734a8fe-93c9-49cf-8f62-83cd5fc16152">
      <Text>ASTOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b80dc2d2-4c3c-42ff-8add-19a347392aaa">
      <Text>How cute.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8056e955-f481-42b0-bf4c-dfa77c4ed9e8">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="df1edec3-cc65-48b0-bf0f-844ff32a5a80">
      <Text>It’ll be a lot cuter when you’re face down in the dirt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ffc3d98-ce0c-4963-b4c9-03dc2b7100bf">
      <Text>Astor places a hand on her chest and bends forward slightly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6d973a33-33fb-4945-a512-93a39da1b3d7">
      <Text>ASTOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a20b8f30-940f-4c86-a0e9-faa1a4d04da6">
      <Text>Oh, and she barks too?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="726f7c97-ec5b-45c2-8263-9478110d533a">
      <Text>Rowan tries to swing, and Wendy strums hard; the fist stops before it even flies. A pink stream of energy snags both Wendy's wrist and Rowan's fist.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f7cc3219-03f2-48db-aa05-91254d1c0e70">
      <Text>Astor smirks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a32f7bd9-c71f-4270-a62c-872637ae89c9">
      <Text>ABIGAIL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f7e7b4ae-7cd3-4646-b18a-34015c41853b">
      <Text>I hope you bite as hard as you bark.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b94ccc96-d397-42a4-bbae-dc1645abffe4">
      <Text>Rowan scoffs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b93ea36b-1900-4447-9932-5fdf8eed967a">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8286653c-3709-4c90-bee7-0c314f5d1401">
      <Text>Don't say that too loud; your girlfriend might get jealous.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="92a06fe0-8df4-4097-b13c-2de688f31f2f">
      <Text>Astor scoffs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fc4a7c8e-820c-48cc-8916-970b601ea58c">
      <Text>ASTOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5690fa59-123d-4e6a-894c-b3197ebb76c4">
      <Text>What reason would I have to be jealous?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="423ff213-7acf-4704-b8c9-eb124c9ccd38">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="32630feb-7ab4-437d-a6d2-63af5b11e563">
      <Text>For starters, when was the last time she looked at you like this?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b61a9ded-ae93-46b6-ab6a-57dff2eaad65">
      <Text>Astor's face turns red. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="92fe4cc7-3f07-49e3-983b-e064360a5460">
      <Text>ASTOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5470d14e-23ef-4b43-ab1e-170f438aa53c">
      <Text>How about we take this outside of town? I have a reputation to uphold.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7cb67e64-bd99-4858-8b5b-224b7993f85d">
      <Text>A&amp;A walk outside of town; Astor holds Abigail’s hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="3a8031a2-df12-496c-8fa9-4d3669c98ce1">
      <Text>Cut to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="22" Type="Scene Heading" id="36a96ffe-a812-41f5-a6a4-de4b4c502e0e">
      <SceneProperties Length="3 6/8" Page="30" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ASTOR">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="7c385c97-6c57-4dee-bd4d-1a08626fd434"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="abb4c0ac-4d72-4db9-8253-adf9e700e13d"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="7b013e8a-d61c-4873-9502-9633732ff6f3"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ABIGAIL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="6ddd2966-64cc-4030-8e6b-4bd83b9e0ce0"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. WasTELAND </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b61a9ded-ae93-46b6-ab6a-57dff2eaad65">
      <Text>A&amp;A stop and turn around. R&amp;W are already in a stance, close; Rowan’s veins and eyes are brick red.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="43b88be2-11d4-41ac-a951-2f7f495def7d">
      <Text>AsTOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="034569b7-59ea-41c9-994e-328c14d791ac">
      <Text>Oh, come now; you can’t be that eager to get your hands on me!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="642c088c-f08d-4e68-b8e9-4de4449cbb02">
      <Text>Two long pink streams emerge from her back, rapidly wrapping around Rowan’s wrists. She starts using them to have Rowan punch herself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="63914f5f-9797-4343-aeb6-0b9db86fc48b">
      <Text>Wendy quickly plays a melody that simultaneously wraps wisps around the tentacles as they also create a shield for Rowan against her own fist as she begins deflecting blows with her other hand from Abigail.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="91e75aa0-e7ca-4f9f-bc75-191229874de0">
      <Text>Two more tentacles emerge and wrap Abigail's fists, whose arms and legs are brown, assisting her swings, eventually slipping past Rowan's one—handed defense and starting to land hits into Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0f73706d-1005-45d4-9d46-f51ae6188143">
      <Text>Another pink tentacle grows from Astor's back and begins whipping at Wendy, who gets struck repeatedly by them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="89699a90-137e-4877-9232-739e1f93242b">
      <Text>Rowan sees Wendy getting attacked.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e5f6d256-c1ba-4a25-bee0-ef9b7fff6d88">
      <Text>Her color shifts to ember red.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c74aaf28-4156-4c29-a60c-3cd9565801e4">
      <Text>Rowan rips her fist away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="acc220df-4305-44a2-8c49-2a521e62ea86">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="930ae4c3-c761-406f-b639-938fc514b27c">
      <Text>Wendy, fists, now!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2a52d187-9e8c-4ac0-8654-f6873e4ce211">
      <Text>Wendy complicates her melody; the wisps move around her fists as she brawls with Astor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="318443b4-a659-4702-88b3-5a66af4c42af">
      <Text>As they trade blows, Wendy switches her melody.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="afed1d75-4e7a-46a2-aa9e-0d13923e844b">
      <Text>The wisps embed themselves into Wendy's skin, turning into bright ethereal blue glowing sigils.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9a42a591-907a-45d1-b05d-1fa03f39b9e7">
      <Text>Larger wisps emerge; Rowan sees them in her periphery and is a little shocked. Abigail uses this chance to land a strike, sending Rowan back flying.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d8d4b9b7-a0a7-4cbb-8b39-8c8ab6bea3fa">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="248265e9-b8c8-48ae-8b76-42eb675153d5">
      <Text>Lock in, Rowan; I have my aces!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e799d367-58da-454e-a782-8e850c446257">
      <Text>Rowan shakes her head as the large wisps begin attacking Astor; she uses her tentacles to defend herself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2d0cf662-148a-4f9c-9f10-4e040ad926e9">
      <Text>Abigail springs on top of Rowan, wailing on her as the wisp tries to block.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2d0cf662-148a-4f9c-9f10-4e040ad926e9">
      <Text>Rowan sends a wisp—wrapped fist into Abigail's kidney; Abigail winces.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="208513b5-1269-472f-b5de-3340188aad07">
      <Text>Rowan bucks Abigail off and quickly stands up, readying her stance again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0de177a1-9136-4deb-ac7c-ae230388ac80">
      <Text>Abigail springs up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8138f60b-0976-401c-bb86-603ac8aaca05">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e68f263b-d57c-4b38-82d5-1637bd6613d3">
      <Text>What, not used to the bottom giving out some power?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="66fffc57-fbb0-4fad-a421-e78b10f05fc0">
      <Text>Astor grunts.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2dde6e8c-a98b-4b9e-b185-82606de3c402">
      <Text>A pink tentacle whips towards Rowan. She catches it and holds.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cca6f2d1-7a33-4c66-a80f-88dbdc0dc9fa">
      <Text>Wendy switches keys, and the wisps on the tentacle bind to the ones on Rowan's hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="081a1260-e8c7-4348-9c65-99c1744f6bd9">
      <Text>Rowan grips harder and yanks, detaching the tentacle from Astor</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>without breaking eye contact with Abigail.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d2257702-f91b-41e2-b0f0-e2ddb5a92de8">
      <Text>ABIGAIL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="03e6e133-0a9a-4221-9a4f-8896b0c39a0f">
      <Text>Shut up, bitch!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bdb7838a-c006-4244-a3da-e00e37e1d5e3">
      <Text>She charges, but a few large wisps fly to her feet, forcing her to trip over them. Rowan catches her before she hits the ground in a "the war is over" pose. Rowan notices Astor looking and takes Abigail’s chin in hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="111dbe5b-a825-4bd8-ae3d-6d70d9da3475">
      <Text>Abigail blushes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3103452a-1263-410f-9e1c-88158a49fb35">
      <Text>ASTOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d7eb82d6-15a4-41fa-8376-5bfa4a424ad6">
      <Text>Abi quit fucking flirting and start fighting!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ef739484-2719-4f88-b310-b3e3268c4194">
      <Text>Abigail tightens her face and tries a swing. Rowan stops it with a grab. The other fist flies, blocked as she wraps her arm around it and binds it between her bicep and forearm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="20d0edf7-6cf8-48d0-b5d3-e4aab295dbb3">
      <Text>Abigail stares, frustrated but also slightly aroused by the maneuver.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a990f06b-2d74-49c3-877a-73324749e33e">
      <Text>Astor’s rage increases. Manifesting as a mass of tentacles sprouting from her and the two on Abigail releasing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ac33f695-4944-4d14-aedf-f8cccc62519c">
      <Text>Rowan air—kisses Abigail and winks before dropping her and turning towards Astor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="36b2d409-5067-4f22-b0a0-8e3caca48e7f">
      <Text>Astor turns to Rowan; all tentacles unleash a flurry of whip strikes, some defending against Wendy’s wisps.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5c3e98dc-4ae4-49aa-9818-8c9bfc6c739f">
      <Text>Astor</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ab14b1c7-225b-4984-a4c7-dcbd8777ca1b">
      <Text>Before I kill you, you’re going to understand what it really means to be with someone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7c1ef0ab-dd92-44ad-baea-29189df13d8a">
      <Text>Rowan takes a stance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0285896b-f8e3-4c13-8de1-05031536a967">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="84e668bb-0846-46ed-8325-5e5340d3c3c1">
      <Text>I’d love for you to show me, since Abigail apparently hasn’t.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c3bee0a7-9088-479d-87d2-c15d0297bd16">
      <Text>Astor growls, then screams. The tentacles are now completely focused on Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3dc3b51e-8c52-4d29-bc6d-af610b5ec9e2">
      <Text>Wendy watches Rowan slowly become overpowered and thinks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f9c849f8-8727-45a1-842e-5a8d5eac9d99">
      <Text>She switches her playing style to Flamenco, and several wisps form four embedded sigil rings around Rowan’s bare torso, two on each side.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5f3697f8-c9a3-496c-b5f6-b676b1da4d7f">
      <Text>Rowan feels them, surprised.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4b9a5edc-4364-435a-abf8-781dbee4a9a3">
      <Text>She continues defending herself from the tentacles. Slowly, from the sigils, sprout arms from the sigil circles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="914c86ea-faa2-4b6a-8d36-d62313b56b1e">
      <Text>One strikes a tentacle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="19b274de-03ea-4217-9925-3d05e0e9a5cb">
      <Text>Rowan’s arms begin blocking each tentacle one by one as Wendy continues.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4f2e478f-789e-4036-a226-fe1bcadc1219">
      <Text>Abigail rushes in from behind; Wendy’s playing complicates, adding another pair of arms that grow next to the others from the rear to protect Rowan from Abigail.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8b4a23a9-495b-4205-bec7-fab03681b5bd">
      <Text>Rowan works her way up to Astor, and, with her real fists, grabs her hands and bends until she’s kneeling on the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2dbbe492-8bdb-428c-8859-84db09618eed">
      <Text>The other fists have moved to hold Abigail in place, holding her in the air as Rowan bends over.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1c71a41e-fbca-4adb-9b3f-86465b0b6e19">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="03437a31-d026-405d-9164-9aac878c3e5d">
      <Text>I think I figured it out. Even with all these tentacles, she still feels nothing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2c7a40f6-e8b8-4060-8e17-57c7b0cf467d">
      <Text>Astor spits in Rowan’s face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f5622190-626c-467d-8e91-0b136f3cce34">
      <Text>Rowan shoves hard, breaking Astor’s arms at the elbow. She screams as she falls to the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6d8e10b4-0ab7-4152-ae59-aa2125576e20">
      <Text>AbiGAIL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="71c3c7e5-1355-44e1-b52d-33b95cf15043">
      <Text>Babe!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f937a4b8-49bd-4f14-8148-7605b85058d2">
      <Text>Rowan falls onto Astor, relentlessly beating her. Abigail is now parallel with the ground and watches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="20304e19-9596-4e23-96db-7c4c14006746">
      <Text>Abigail begins to cry.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8ad4f163-1eec-4283-9432-a76cd4ec89fe">
      <Text>Rowan beats Astor until her face is barely recognizable, then stands up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="02a3539a-6bb3-41a3-b7a6-fd12d946f189">
      <Text>The arms swing Abigail to face Rowan. Rowan checks out Abigail.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="88bac956-babc-457e-9fb1-d931335ab7c6">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="305fc899-266d-4d31-8c77-a362611cd299">
      <Text>A shame, you were </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">kinda</Text>
      <Text> cute too.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="95376900-e276-4aa3-a871-2beab76ad0e0">
      <Text>Wendy looks away, blushing, covering her face with her hat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c6b764bf-1d2f-41ce-88d2-afce6de7ad12">
      <Text>Rowan beats Abigail. The arms release her over Astor’s body, and they lie together in a bloody, pulpy heap.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2bbda9a4-6de4-4297-8bd9-9ae122d1d213">
      <Text>Rowan sees Wendy looking away and walks over.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="71160266-b522-4d22-ad15-91a734bedcf9">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6163a2df-05a3-499f-a2ca-467af6dcf5de">
      <Text>Sorry you had to see that.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0b7fea72-14ae-403a-a9a6-c837f0ce7d67">
      <Text>She guides her back to the buggy. They get in. Rowan starts it, then drives away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f113fe7d-bd1c-4712-832c-be9faa699657">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0fc4f957-d33d-4820-9675-6979449c6104">
      <Text>Did you mean it when you said she was cute?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3cbecdf6-50d4-4bed-8f53-abbd66e69336">
      <Text>Rowan laughs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c6ff1db1-e479-47fa-8e27-65dd6bc14028">
      <Text>Wendy huffs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="4584a61a-d128-4318-903c-dca7c2668983">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="23" Type="Scene Heading" id="8b946691-a4a7-4ad2-9447-848a9ca182b8">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="34" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="COURIER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="9b5603da-60d8-4d99-80e4-721db2f80183"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MIHAI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="bf2a3ed1-5360-49f0-a532-a7f852449f23"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Niculescu Castle </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> Night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3eae650d-f2a9-479b-b23c-205fe140adaf">
      <Text>A courier approaches Mihai Niculescu.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="683e06cb-a881-4e4b-9086-2e08e4c1014b">
      <Text>Courier</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5d9f60df-8eb3-41a9-8682-5804f133402b">
      <Text>The girls have been taken down, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">M’lord</Text>
      <Text>: Abigail &amp; Astor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="124046be-4fe6-4a66-979d-f7452d1002b1">
      <Text>Mihai thinks, then grins.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="14ca3928-44fc-4265-8774-1af3507cd7cd">
      <Text>Mihai</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d6f61f04-60b2-4eb7-922b-1af8f0700eda">
      <Text>Amazing! Contact the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Omanears</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="ef70d645-f625-470c-8425-17120277c281">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="f91c330f-e95d-448d-9f15-ae4b6d67addb">
      <Text>EPISODE 7</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="2e836e48-486b-4374-bc7f-48e6fa9a0020">
      <Text>TITLE CARD:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="6d585402-d2a3-4a68-8903-a61121299cb7">
      <Text>Little Friend </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VII</Text>
      <Text> (Name: Crimson/Numerals: Cobalt Blue)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="2c5931a6-3192-4c86-80dc-77285128e051">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="24" Type="Scene Heading" id="deca67a8-5386-4804-af45-c9bbe1484876">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="35" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Wasteland </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> Later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="28feea73-2045-4300-ab9f-a22834648820">
      <Text>They speed past a store; Wendy notices a red</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>and</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>blue blur in the windows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8e25a664-633e-47f1-8348-c1de74d40f82">
      <Text>The buggy continues. Then stops, turns around, and pulls up in front.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9d611b17-7aba-4125-b08c-717226eccaed">
      <Text>Wendy puts a finger on her lip as she stares at the different swimsuits.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="25" Type="Scene Heading" id="1eaaf214-8ce7-4adf-a681-20b603c9c87b">
      <SceneProperties Length="5 5/8" Page="35" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="fefdebd2-5b21-42f3-a218-2cb692b95b22"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WISP">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="03258676-3260-4654-8fa5-1950c4a58c1d"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="68578a07-16a6-42b1-9c7b-958810449c28"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. Desert Highway </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> EVENING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="84d9c3bc-19e3-4e7a-80f6-486c5251db23">
      <Text>R&amp;W stop the buggy near a large boulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8ee0d930-a16b-4291-ae90-fe9ded1715c4">
      <Text>Rowan pulls supplies from the back and starts setting up camp.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8ee0d930-a16b-4291-ae90-fe9ded1715c4">
      <Text>Wendy slips behind the boulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6477eb5b-2ee2-4b00-ac9d-f833d676c3b9">
      <Text>Wendy whistles; a wisp manifests as she pulls the bikini out from her bag.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="531d3942-114c-4af3-bac2-fc1f720905b6">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="be276cbd-efd3-446d-a402-cabfecd9680e">
      <Text>(Whistling)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ebbd4060-56ba-445e-8f92-c0f4ac6d3f25">
      <Text>Do you think she'll like this?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b5c15007-282a-4baf-9d5b-4cc7370f6605">
      <Text>She undresses.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b19e2691-2904-4848-b1f2-9e74e40fd6f9">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="870d0ede-afe0-4fcf-9bb6-ef8ad038f296">
      <Text>(Morse code pulse)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eea6a084-8748-4457-a1f8-1f18a91315ab">
      <Text>I don't think so.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f0fa932b-d8b5-496c-a9ee-fe7b8bfa6777">
      <Text>She tsk</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>tsks and rolls her eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8bd221c1-2522-4314-874b-f77481930661">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e9b0c095-1866-4da3-9384-a2a9b7ba4e32">
      <Text>Whatever.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="05542478-badc-4817-b32c-40d11cf876be">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="81572a61-a788-4465-b254-d876d25dd359">
      <Text>It's just my opinion.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1f5ad8e7-a55a-4a1c-9752-a9a7d7b6a5be">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f257453b-5cb5-4292-89cb-e635fc01aa97">
      <Text>You can't have an opinion.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2561eaf3-4c8c-416d-bf84-7918fb472a1f">
      <Text>She straps up the top.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a2603274-940d-4630-a803-cc0facbd8916">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b808b303-c728-45c2-8db2-ffc598a44a4c">
      <Text>Then why'd you ask?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="07e8e1e7-ed00-4fc4-b74a-1c7fb8a979ac">
      <Text>Wendy pauses mid—tie.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9e97c7d0-fea4-4717-b0e1-3fadffeac3aa">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cf210d56-cf94-40fc-97b4-4cb676eb4c8e">
      <Text>Shut up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b9075524-7825-405a-8c3c-c44970d98dba">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1fdf561b-497d-4200-bf2f-f7d4d7002ee5">
      <Text>Ha, ha, ha. Why do you care what she thinks anyway?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="289d53a2-77d7-4f86-b361-5aafadf8c831">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="20a1ac85-a024-42a6-83fd-79669558c349">
      <Text>Because. She's nice, protective, and</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="69ae4534-87f1-4ae9-aeda-b4b060116495">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b6e9d413-6337-4277-84f9-140b83753206">
      <Text>So, you like her?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="14a7f310-e636-4bf0-98e8-a2ea09d47329">
      <Text>She thinks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4ceeb8b5-cd24-4873-a616-6a421277b509">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0debe8fa-e4e2-421f-af78-301e87f7a937">
      <Text>Maybe, I don't know!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1b4b9836-04da-4de7-be4d-eb9cee65491a">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f90104d7-03af-4f08-85e6-6b1435c1793d">
      <Text>So what if you like her?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c5b60b54-757f-46c5-8ec9-d1a52d80ad0b">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="df660143-54db-4960-8416-884c0cbb336a">
      <Text>Rowan tosses another bag out from the buggy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="df660143-54db-4960-8416-884c0cbb336a">
      <Text>Wendy peeks around the corner of the boulder, watching, smirking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="df660143-54db-4960-8416-884c0cbb336a">
      <Text>The wisp moves beside her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9a514325-30cf-46a5-b355-a06af91cab81">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bbce7134-1b73-4f78-a578-e788b240f4e8">
      <Text>Yeah, you totally have a crush.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b3341016-482c-4d6c-80d6-798545edf2c5">
      <Text>Wendy quickly pulls back behind the rock, grabbing the bottoms and pulling them on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="74bad1be-bbe1-468e-93ff-a1d33cdaf302">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="98e8587b-89fa-4fc8-823f-cd31e279d148">
      <Text>Silence, before I dismiss you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1a30c67e-5fd4-4b93-99b2-c6188df66cf6">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c5a6526e-5d16-4cd3-a87c-c3b6199986ce">
      <Text>Hmph, suit yourself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f02a8ffe-ec32-40f3-be35-ed381e69fb87">
      <Text>She ties the bottoms.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3fecc615-d600-400f-8f70-81e32a0c661a">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a3d99de2-4c20-456d-ad7a-3e1a74c36412">
      <Text>How does it look?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="11fd5f12-1377-4f5a-a799-d4848ffdb382">
      <Text>She shows herself off to the wisp.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f9ceb3a6-e9a4-45e5-a7fe-8e032a1517f4">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a6b1c1ae-68c6-4009-aacb-10ef01cf4a87">
      <Text>I can't see.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="320a0e66-d5d7-41f1-8b89-74238aaa05fa">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e43cb0b4-9b4a-4767-836c-36b42f9f6abc">
      <Text>Oh, right.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c49b0e85-7208-43fa-b7e2-7a9e2be2f458">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9ec32711-db6f-45d2-8e92-f9d1654e3270">
      <Text>Just have confidence in yourself!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="52d026a1-3f6e-446f-89c2-cc2336791815">
      <Text>Wendy thinks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f9209a10-a87e-4fa1-afb2-609eed335a0f">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bf7a5644-3bd3-41e8-9f9a-004087df33ca">
      <Text>Look, let me help.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ad14e51-c4fa-430b-83a2-6310bdc5887e">
      <Text>The wisp floats down a side flap and embeds itself as a sigil. Wendy examines the sigil.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0c02b6e7-a8a5-4ca9-a66d-579cbce28608">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bd7366bf-a33c-4180-b2fc-350bbb4cbc0a">
      <Text>Now you'll have a piece of you, a part of you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5e628220-09c2-4408-b275-63432df2ac14">
      <Text>Wendy exhales.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5218df1f-17f8-46a2-9bfc-9860cf9669c9">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8210cc49-fee2-4f0a-bedd-4a388254ce41">
      <Text>Rowan!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6aff27b3-80d4-4c5f-a73a-7999655d3fc1">
      <Text>She emerges from behind the boulder; Rowan looks over.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f2cbbfc0-9085-45fd-a94f-297c308975ea">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cb1becbb-78d7-417a-b833-453fe7e0b8a0">
      <Text>I was</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b8614571-90a2-44e6-a30b-7ae6dfba36ad">
      <Text>She stares for a moment.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d2e6e330-a151-4854-8b94-24639e2ac26e">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f0bcdc4f-30b4-42f7-9d50-1e27212f3e26">
      <Text>How does it look?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5d139060-c94e-4a08-a411-5ad3bf1b565a">
      <Text>Wendy shows Rowan the bikini.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="26f40c28-091b-4bba-b1a3-07fb05934064">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7709eacd-5dc0-4439-b783-a45de1dc6119">
      <Text>Well?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dd1e4d2c-6737-4594-a698-901575890a13">
      <Text>Rowan snaps out of her gaze.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1bc72f59-c725-4c4d-96a6-40fc5d4404d4">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6b541944-73e6-4683-bbca-35efaf6e7470">
      <Text>Oh, yeah, it's good...you look good.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5c50eb1f-8da1-49d1-95ac-411d3db30243">
      <Text>Wendy deflates.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4e0e17bf-d7e3-4ebd-bf41-9717a27ac7f9">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="730cfe2e-d7f7-41a7-af8b-1ebd85b2f22d">
      <Text>Ugh, I knew it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a06c2c92-3728-4e95-9bf4-76c9ccc4d874">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e6674ed5-f8c5-4eba-9932-b39358a0a2db">
      <Text>Wait, what?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="85860bf4-f57b-432e-812d-ff1534f53fc1">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="52117d95-2039-4f72-bbe5-0c753a7f4cf4">
      <Text>It doesn't look good!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="304affcd-6d28-4e0b-b6a3-acc9d0d4d264">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="294eb1c1-7e8e-49d6-819d-af7c54884357">
      <Text>What? No, it does look good!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6fd7ebbe-7ed9-47b4-b84c-9b53c674c0f6">
      <Text>Wendy crosses her arms.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3c3c451f-9f1e-4b58-8410-014b20415322">
      <Text>Rowan, nervous, walks up to Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d605fe60-ed35-4bc7-965d-7cc3811dce4d">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2b5c2bd8-82f6-4c37-91fc-b7ec621bef91">
      <Text>Look, like, no, you look good.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8e78525b-2ef8-401c-849c-3853cd80feeb">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e6baeb9a-0362-406a-bbe2-87fe70830743">
      <Text>Hmph.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a4437c2b-a47a-45ce-b195-bbf0b17aa1c4">
      <Text>She lowers her head so her hat covers her face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ca475c75-4f55-4060-8b02-ba34884f66d9">
      <Text>Rowan puts her hands on Wendy’s shoulders; Wendy looks up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1380181f-d237-4208-81fe-3a8b6bd15641">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="96e7b6e3-d977-4875-8b4c-f10211848113">
      <Text>I promise.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b97bcfad-2041-4348-9ddb-9b5e11ff272f">
      <Text>Wendy covers her face with the hat again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b97bcfad-2041-4348-9ddb-9b5e11ff272f">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="067e916e-4c21-4466-98b4-534eae7d9e0d">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="1546ef7b-ca72-4c35-87ae-d8192d69326e">
      <Text>(Face covered)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7642c714-7d32-434e-a23b-0192862f08ee">
      <Text>Okay. Now go put yours on!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9f079163-d505-409b-a102-8bbdc113ba04">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5e37e1a4-7dcd-4d03-aa48-6822f005e517">
      <Text>Huh?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4d99429d-4f8d-4a2d-97b0-322f75c991d5">
      <Text>Wendy looks up at Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="48bac37b-1dca-4dcb-9000-729c457f58a2">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="14f92714-4e39-431f-afb7-300656943676">
      <Text>(Stern face, puppy eyes)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="16206f19-f841-431f-88ff-b63a91b9b8fb">
      <Text>Go put on the one I bought you!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="38ed7ced-4a11-4a60-b015-7284748ac834">
      <Text>Rowan quickly exhales, retrieves her bikini from a bag, then unties her shirt and takes it off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="56ff4a32-aabf-4399-830d-5c47c77c2911">
      <Text>Wendy covers her face with the hat, blushing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0e00096b-3872-4ba2-a37f-71c2972b97ba">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b3152283-bcba-454d-9d33-bf1367bf34a2">
      <Text>What are you doing!?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c3d8f486-cf4f-43c5-a627-24ee55b7b365">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="93974737-67a3-4d4a-b97c-9de557045c1e">
      <Text>What? You said put it on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f29bcb39-ab83-44a7-a34a-9482bd787ef3">
      <Text>Wendy points back to the boulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ea7f42e1-e314-40f1-879a-b0b6683e4630">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="38810de5-8e88-4d2e-bf20-aae2a4d8b903">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7571b2ff-b1a6-4750-b8d4-2324d1f4d73d">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9c1eb673-3491-4a42-8ad4-a34eae8d1dff">
      <Text>Please change where I can’t see you. It's weird to strip in front of a girl you don't know!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="82660893-0518-4bcd-aa3c-e26ddd0d831a">
      <Text>Wendy's face flushes deeper red.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="56aced60-8327-4e51-9038-4389fbe9ece7">
      <Text>Rowan huffs, then slings the bikini on her bare shoulders and walks around the corner.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1b0a1d09-c094-4e1c-8ea2-1163050b4a9b">
      <Text>Wendy uncovers her face slowly, looks around, walks back over to the buggy, leans against it and looks down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c499df3d-2299-4e1b-9eda-0f7149eac2de">
      <Text>She kicks a small stone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a16c525f-281b-4f81-8b4d-3f76b2c29d98">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e475e5be-391f-446f-9993-8c605e7e5e15">
      <Text>Totally have a crush on her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d1793e82-748e-42a7-b9fd-1e54f73eee16">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="b199108c-8fd8-4bb6-ad87-c5f5218cdf5e">
      <Text>(Yelling)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="34d3cfca-238f-4861-b97c-2050502d3c24">
      <Text>Quiet!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1d01d8b8-27c5-49ee-b42c-d679534d62d4">
      <Text>She quickly covers her mouth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1a0348ab-fdd2-4eea-9892-f17ef44dfe8e">
      <Text>Rowan pops her head from around the rock.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="29d6d1ec-a235-4211-8b12-c0cf2bb830b1">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="51a2f4e7-3aa7-41aa-8d6f-5ef45492d483">
      <Text>Something wrong?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ba738a8b-8a8d-487d-8765-431816228834">
      <Text>Wendy doesn’t move.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1556c5ff-35df-4c18-b9eb-b5880cbf9851">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5cd767c0-8005-4c14-be80-4b52b3f90fae">
      <Text>No!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="12a445eb-858f-4456-9fb2-95123dfb210c">
      <Text>Rowan's head disappears back behind the rock.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="44fbccd6-5576-4f6e-872f-84365da603a4">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b7648215-2a86-48b3-801d-1103ede98735">
      <Text>Ha </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ha</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ha</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f289b343-2013-4350-854e-1d7ac321bd55">
      <Text>Wendy's face is now beet red.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e95a992b-efe9-4c09-92eb-a61f62eeb767">
      <Text>Rowan examines the top.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fc4f570a-3624-4569-b912-1b199c2c6256">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4f50e404-2727-4b8b-8631-e7780e41b4c4">
      <Text>At least it matches my color.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7d966ee2-7b63-4dc7-9ca6-6623c05c1b06">
      <Text>She puts it on and ties it, checking for any discomfort.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="feab8415-fe59-492a-85a7-9f8d5f4316f6">
      <Text>She kneels, unties her boots and sets them off to the side.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ac7df106-15fb-4e1b-9e29-e8a577b672c7">
      <Text>She stands up and leans back against the boulder, staring off into the distance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="08677832-f953-4b5d-823d-470fd153dcc5">
      <Text>A long beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="08677832-f953-4b5d-823d-470fd153dcc5">
      <Text>She exhales slowly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ef09c083-4452-45f7-a156-7cf6cbd80a76">
      <Text>She takes off her shorts, folds them and places them atop the boots.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b5b19bba-9f94-4774-b94d-47b7b4f1f739">
      <Text>She slides the bottoms on and checks how they feel.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8a6ddd01-655f-4677-bdbf-48e43f63e696">
      <Text>She walks out from behind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8fe0660a-f558-48eb-a821-a69876c0b8a4">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="56bc86c7-aea3-42f6-89cc-35363db5caf2">
      <Text>Alright, are you happy?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="977f15e5-5677-4344-8daa-a5dbe7851b10">
      <Text>Wendy looks up at Rowan and stares, awestruck.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="83097a69-650b-464a-990b-dcfa1414ff46">
      <Text>Wendy’s color shifts to Cobalt Blue.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2330c5c7-8ddf-4a27-b232-dd375704f241">
      <Text>The silence stretches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dbcf78e4-938e-4ed4-8951-a82607c77387">
      <Text>Rowan examines herself again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4cc4310a-967c-47a5-9949-35a02f3fc557">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f572718e-fdbb-48b3-8454-5a6db90daae6">
      <Text>I </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">kinda</Text>
      <Text> like it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eda894ea-f4f9-4ae7-a60f-db5656f2e850">
      <Text>Wendy grins and runs up to Rowan, placing her hands on Rowan's arms.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f734ef23-c4db-4abf-9d05-925f6052e032">
      <Text>She freezes for a split second before looking into her eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="88b63330-d922-403a-99fc-028d9638b89c">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f83ebeab-6067-4db1-b280-1556d02df088">
      <Text>Really?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="320088d7-38b1-4c8d-8000-233814d45dff">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c288f454-bd90-40d4-a703-baefafbab18e">
      <Text>Yeah, if there was a lake or </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">summin</Text>
      <Text> around I'd use this.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="928c8956-770d-4146-9e02-eba13777c835">
      <Text>Wendy smiles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="adeef5d8-ecb0-4a8c-b749-3fba364b2cad">
      <Text>She hugs Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5645fca2-57f1-425f-8535-2d868a3696b3">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="97b754dc-4679-4ae9-88b1-f989d57f6a64">
      <Text>I'm glad you like it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f3496ca8-5828-495a-a8ca-312153e00453">
      <Text>A half a beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bbe4d004-5119-4127-85fb-9a2145cdd484">
      <Text>Rowan awkwardly hugs Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="b8d2af07-e749-43a9-995f-560f3864844a">
      <Text>FADE TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="26" Type="Scene Heading" id="fa8aee00-458b-444b-821b-d07dda61d170">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="41" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. WASTELAND </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> LATER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c527c643-897c-4775-a4c8-bb10c8e5632a">
      <Text>A fire crackles in the quiet desert. Rowan is staring at it. Wendy is asleep next to her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c527c643-897c-4775-a4c8-bb10c8e5632a">
      <Text>The guitar sits nearby, casting a soft blue hue against the yellow flame.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d0f02a1b-75e7-4965-8cb6-430f2b5b8954">
      <Text>Rowan looks over to Wendy, then glances down at their hands next to each other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fba68ee5-0fbe-498f-9b43-35f0a94b6c61">
      <Text>Rowan’s color shifts to Crimson.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="b4060fb2-eb18-49df-873b-ff1b74ba5053">
      <Text>FADE TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="d4c00e7a-9558-442c-81e7-5d498705091f">
      <Text>Episode 8</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="dc9f2efd-0117-463c-b57c-637440323430">
      <Text>TITLE CARD:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="f0249637-a3c6-439d-8fbc-1d1cc61902c8">
      <Text>Spiders </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VIII</Text>
      <Text> (Name: Deep Crimson/Numerals: Deep Blue)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="e4ee2efe-d908-4a62-ae02-35b450dc7e8e">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="27" Type="Scene Heading" id="131565e7-4a35-4cb6-af78-fed208856daf">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="42" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Desert highway </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a281e949-496f-4c27-84a1-3852b96ba324">
      <Text>R&amp;W speed down the highway. “Highway Closed Ahead” signs appear; Rowan takes the next exit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="28" Type="Scene Heading" id="32018832-5e1b-43c2-b7d9-baa988a640ad">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 6/8" Page="42" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="52b64dd4-7e85-4fc2-9a59-1c23065673b2"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="ef62a1be-0ba5-480b-97f2-ea26fcfaa4d2"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="54eb0fab-54c5-40e9-8053-75859a297366"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WOMAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="586e9a0b-c1a8-40d6-8155-db33f370e2c0"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIERIST">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="fd8c04a5-37e3-437e-8660-9a73cbedef95"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NEYELA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="b2beb230-a3a7-4c59-bc76-8d0026880b7b"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Small Town </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> ContINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="21ef3b3f-d738-46d0-a03e-e3cea2cfc2a3">
      <Text>They pull into the town.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="276bd091-25d8-4494-83d1-c4590b8c796f">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6717466b-7373-402d-96bc-19f2523a4dfa">
      <Text>You want a drink?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d69a541b-160a-4523-9e33-02182bde6636">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1839de81-7016-481e-8243-eda8a3fed726">
      <Text>Sure, do you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="382b8391-8399-4b99-9daa-74225bb31e9d">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="51b8bae0-7c1f-487b-81c0-47e2584285e5">
      <Text>Yeah, let’s find somewhere.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fe08db08-409c-4d24-b33b-45b06241be07">
      <Text>Rowan drives around looking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="280e39a8-d342-4eb6-bf21-5101e3408404">
      <Text>Man</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b028f632-230f-4e91-bb1f-e3f9fc3e8b69">
      <Text>Hey!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="493dd92f-5f30-46a7-99c4-cbaa71e5547e">
      <Text>Rowan turns around and sees a man approaching the buggy at a stop.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="41f38b69-3786-4d32-a324-f644b7b95455">
      <Text>Man</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6e7ba6a1-3ad3-45de-a0b1-d7f37a625a37">
      <Text>What brings you guys around here?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="11467ce1-0106-47c3-ac5a-811632e6aaec">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="25202c56-4431-40f3-b337-69f935d52e61">
      <Text>We really don’t need anything, but thank you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7086d745-8054-4907-a9d1-4e0b9d22d450">
      <Text>A woman appears on the other side of the buggy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e1bd2c76-c8da-4b8f-8f11-c27638301bb0">
      <Text>Woman</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="34b087da-3a31-407e-8a84-c1e8baab80aa">
      <Text>Nonsense! We hardly get visitors anymore; you two must be famished!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="938cda7c-b7b5-411d-8f86-277f02fe954c">
      <Text>Man</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="34edb24c-e676-42e4-b015-9e1b2ad61c88">
      <Text>Where are my manners? My name is </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="825d7a52-8570-4438-926a-fd8a069d11ca">
      <Text>He reaches out for a shake.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2a558316-f6e9-4f59-8cd2-bd26d6b058f2">
      <Text>WOMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="05a62b96-3413-44fa-8605-bd8ee44982d0">
      <Text>And I’m </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1fedb48d-99a5-47c0-b2fa-81427a1af615">
      <Text>Rowan stares at the hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ab8cd261-269a-4d6d-9450-fe0848553c21">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="27c98c63-ad35-4f00-89cd-1f7027ff58da">
      <Text>What do you want?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="26c89e77-e252-4142-aa60-91c055d1798f">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a687dc5c-f2ea-480d-afd1-425d4d91a659">
      <Text>Seriously, we wanna give you some grub.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c22bd244-f9f9-4eb2-b042-cca46065674e">
      <Text>Rowan blows a raspberry and looks to Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="25b5bc8b-a1ad-4ef8-a476-04f3417d627e">
      <Text>She bows to Wendy; Wendy tips her hat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0989db99-c57e-422a-b35a-e9ea2ec68cde">
      <Text>Rowan looks back to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7cd6acd4-9321-4c1f-a8e8-9c4e25a57abd">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bfc09ca4-834b-4d41-afb2-d53507172707">
      <Text>Alright, where are we going?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="391e68de-429b-4612-8c43-a686f696de82">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="462ba21b-e0ff-4893-85e1-875002be63a4">
      <Text>Just up the road, take a left and head down the dirt path. It’ll be a McMansion</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>y Mansion, hard to miss. The housemaids will handle your stuff from there.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8d0e4994-b69d-42cf-9fb6-717f3d8cc429">
      <Text>Rowan flips her hair and pulls away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8d0e4994-b69d-42cf-9fb6-717f3d8cc429">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text> waves to Wendy; Wendy finger—waves back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="75e3d3f1-3452-4e9a-8f14-0f24420175ba">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="13cdfabe-6b84-4593-8226-09722edf5ed0">
      <Text>Interesting, aren’t they?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7701983a-6e76-4fa1-b5c8-bcbc212d61dd">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9465abdd-0fcb-4a93-ac26-8485dbc5cce9">
      <Text>Guess that’s why Mihai wants them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="97dc125b-5a78-4dd8-9f0e-a06af7dac1dc">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="96677c46-07f6-4d84-88e8-e86973309448">
      <Text>Unless we want them first.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8c165348-9aea-48ba-845c-15e789b34f4a">
      <Text>They chuckle, take each other’s hands, then kiss.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b30f0e19-0002-49c2-9579-04eec12d010a">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bc828478-1fcd-4f16-8be7-65883733ef66">
      <Text>Mon chou.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e58651cf-2e7c-4503-8fd7-f8b61cdf4a90">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NEYELA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="881433ae-2069-4676-b153-cf86142d317f">
      <Text>Mi amor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a38c8571-495b-4859-8a3b-ede7aa310390">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> gestures ahead; </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text> takes the lead back to the mansion.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="29" Type="Scene Heading" id="af1722f5-d2de-4186-ba1f-605dd5a6b819">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="44" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BUTLER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="f8dc242f-26e4-4f42-b12e-51e2c0fa6f3c"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Omanear</Text>
      <Text> Mansion </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> Shortly after</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="90cceadb-5dda-4b2c-893d-f7baf47d9e6a">
      <Text>Rowan drives, stern but concerned.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="90cceadb-5dda-4b2c-893d-f7baf47d9e6a">
      <Text>Wendy notices and puts a hand on her thigh.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b0c8a6df-18ab-4b50-8244-b54257950428">
      <Text>Rowan looks over, and Wendy smiles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="891fdf25-93c6-4a43-b1ae-1c7c61e6ea0e">
      <Text>Rowan nods slightly and looks back at the road.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="891fdf25-93c6-4a43-b1ae-1c7c61e6ea0e">
      <Text>She slows down before a small militia of maids and butlers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="afe42f79-d852-487f-a9c1-d60724836efa">
      <Text>She stops and cuts the engine. The maids take the bags from the rear; the butlers open the buggy doors and gesture out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1d39e192-4879-46a2-b61d-7e5c96edf767">
      <Text>Rowan hesitates; Wendy squeezes her thigh once; Rowan looks down, then over. Wendy half—smiles, nods her head, then steps out. Rowan follows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a1fc3eb8-b6a5-4679-ac6e-91b7a4aa28f3">
      <Text>Butler</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="42e88c34-00f9-4f93-8358-d04a8637eb35">
      <Text>Welcome to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Omanear</Text>
      <Text> Manor, ladies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fae8db48-8902-4795-88a0-ab3f266b46e9">
      <Text>They look around.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aacc6b24-ef55-4918-832c-1582ec57e1b4">
      <Text>ButLER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a80839df-b4ad-4c42-b9ed-74be5423fe35">
      <Text>Please come inside with us.</Text>
      <Text> The buggy will be taken to the garage properly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b63b56d9-b314-40a2-b58d-1598c7224ba7">
      <Text>R&amp;W walk in together, Wendy front and Rowan behind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="30" Type="Scene Heading" id="632eacb2-1b1d-4c1e-a4c2-01225a3174bc">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="44" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Omanear</Text>
      <Text> mansion </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> continUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ea3603a5-3348-44f2-8fc9-3daacd5107ee">
      <Text>Their butlers guide them away from each other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ea3603a5-3348-44f2-8fc9-3daacd5107ee">
      <Text>Rowan looks to Wendy; she tips her hat and winks. Rowan inhales.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6e86e3a2-4149-4b65-9b62-1eaf5d6a08c0">
      <Text>ROWAN’S BUTLER takes her up a flight of stairs and opens a door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="31" Type="Scene Heading" id="d62b604e-db0c-4fdc-bf3b-bc73cbe490bf">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="44" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN’S BUTLER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="afb2cfd1-0e9d-4b9d-826e-65026443382a"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ESTELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="54fccfb3-59db-4dc4-9eca-f050c20604d4"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="946657cf-67e3-4458-a3f3-6a8743a584ae"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Rowan’s Room </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> ContinUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6e86e3a2-4149-4b65-9b62-1eaf5d6a08c0">
      <Text>Meticulously decorated with ornate tapestries, plush pillows, an overly</Text>
      <Text> fluffy comforter</Text>
      <Text> and a maid standing by.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="47c11407-7a84-4880-9e6e-f135807b3d21">
      <Text>The butler gestures her inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7caf7626-b103-446c-a666-9601bb960810">
      <Text>Rowan walks inside, looking around. She walks up to the tapestry and examines its fractal patterns.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1e3445cf-5442-4fc7-9706-ad13e5896d1f">
      <Text>She picks up a pillow, squeezes it gently and looks at herself in the mirror of the vanity, the tapestry in the background.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ef21f5a4-5e95-40c4-a7aa-7c75c4ed71fb">
      <Text>Rowan’s Butler</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e7fe6f60-1ef2-4de9-89c6-5c03b97f5233">
      <Text>We hope you like it. If you need anything, Estella will be your personal assistant.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e7c559c1-4c59-4c48-9e30-66fef05d3c84">
      <Text>He bows and takes a step out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="339db065-4485-4660-a82c-85f03e3747fe">
      <Text>RowaN’S BUTLER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bd934035-13d8-4761-b1f9-2e9f0f302906">
      <Text>Enjoy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0018fb50-8a34-4219-aae6-90d43929a5f4">
      <Text>He smiles and closes the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="264f7dd4-e16e-4f94-9a54-152f31a7f431">
      <Text>Estella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bf45d7c7-53e2-43d0-9985-1355b1e9dcc7">
      <Text>Hello! The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Omanears</Text>
      <Text> told me a little bit about you. Come, take a seat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="87649227-49e5-486a-b7c9-0d44a0079d84">
      <Text>She pats the bed; Rowan doesn’t budge.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="141e1f13-2c1c-47f3-b135-1b859f2af3a5">
      <Text>EsteLLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e911de4a-3008-4c5b-b387-8ef80d5acbbc">
      <Text>It’s okay, the bed won’t fall in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6f4b86c8-d60d-451e-ae25-bd8ac31a752a">
      <Text>Rowan reluctantly sits.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="90d1f456-4eef-430e-b505-68198daf6ff3">
      <Text>Estella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f766c040-ee7a-42bd-91bd-e61481dc0489">
      <Text>Is there anything I can get for you? Water, soda, coffee, alcohol?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="daf812a4-1a39-4248-9ac7-4cb8132fae59">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="14bafd13-21e3-4573-a588-f86f836fb8d0">
      <Text>No.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8442ec25-34b3-49f7-823b-211ad850f44b">
      <Text>Estella smiles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e82839ec-2987-4ed3-a053-7e9637bafa3b">
      <Text>ESTELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c346eddc-f2ce-4546-819c-f5fcb5bed947">
      <Text>Well, if you need anything, I’ll be</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="93494502-605b-4b3b-8c40-87c01ef68a7b">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="747779aa-fc6d-400a-878b-e9aa9d2ec763">
      <Text>Where’s the bathroom? I want to take a shower.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fe947e05-5088-4432-b2ae-0608dd0f7864">
      <Text>Estella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4c11ddb4-ba64-4000-9244-4cd559642e14">
      <Text>Follow me!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1c09f583-8569-478e-a4fd-5fde0cea2614">
      <Text>Estella walks out of the room and gestures. Rowan follows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="32" Type="Scene Heading" id="c44cf12d-60f3-4e2b-a93b-20ff03ced2fc">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="46" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="1599697b-4bfd-4ee4-89e4-2185e1e43aad"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BUTLER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="38e0e9b4-1705-4b3a-9880-c88a47eeea3c"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WISP">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="bac88cdd-20c4-4b47-8f77-fbe7d66d8b34"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Wendy’s room </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> before</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c0a43190-6ce1-4196-a495-3f72fedefab4">
      <Text>Mahogany flooring, elegant brick walls, a bed on a bamboo frame.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cff310ef-6568-44e1-b77e-4703babdb622">
      <Text>Wendy steps in, running her hand along the wall, then sits on the bed, taking off her hat and setting it down next to her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d1c96c67-1a6e-4955-9fb7-62e04f0489ef">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e2769f49-62ad-42df-a638-734a32380339">
      <Text>Beautiful.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5da2d7b4-7963-4bc6-99ed-9e0fa91f76eb">
      <Text>Butler</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1c47f668-7711-4d51-8f73-376e4b2ae9bf">
      <Text>Each room its own pride.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d3e35208-1cbe-439c-a3cf-0715e3342f0c">
      <Text>He bows and exits.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d20d12fc-3115-4e2d-aeb5-4939d5cd3d9b">
      <Text>She lies back, staring at the wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="19c572c2-045f-4f39-aead-92578b6ea145">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="33" Type="Scene Heading" id="dbdabd56-e457-4ba4-8aba-2d017a13e53c">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="46" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Shower </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> simultaneous</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="96472cdb-8265-4e8d-a36e-43b30fda689e">
      <Text>Rowan starts the shower.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="96472cdb-8265-4e8d-a36e-43b30fda689e">
      <Text>She takes off her shirt and hangs it on the towel bar, then tries to take off her pants. She sits down, unties the boots, takes them off, sets them beside the vanity, pulls off her shorts, and hangs them next to her shirt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6f3a89d5-eba7-4523-a8cc-a6c32711bd33">
      <Text>She stands up and looks at herself in the mirror.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6f3a89d5-eba7-4523-a8cc-a6c32711bd33">
      <Text>She inspects herself for any new scars or bruises, checking where she had them before.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9e4ba978-55e6-4f8f-b5a3-1edad80039f0">
      <Text>She stares at herself in the mirror.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9e4ba978-55e6-4f8f-b5a3-1edad80039f0">
      <Text>She bends over and rests her head on her hand and looks at herself in the eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="216e2fa5-edc6-4076-943b-5a70542c0fec">
      <Text>The steam slowly covers her face, then she stands up and steps into the shower.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="214787db-b43a-44fd-868e-efbe4745080f">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="34" Type="Scene Heading" id="f463508c-771e-4064-9587-ae561bca7469">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="46" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ESTELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="4c9ef91a-9ecc-49b2-9d36-570875ecaf8c"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="4faa787b-7b32-447a-a1ee-075c31ab4975"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Omanear</Text>
      <Text> MANSION </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="78b74dd4-0f6b-4a4e-863c-c4f7c10aa17f">
      <Text>Rowan steps out of the bathroom, towel wrapped around her waist.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bbce3866-4409-4208-99a0-1269dcf74b82">
      <Text>Estella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="91e96dcb-4a7b-4488-bef3-820644470a48">
      <Text>Ma’am, wouldn’t you like to cover up a little better?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="402aef7d-7616-4a4f-b14c-cbfc54395633">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="72d8bb49-c18b-4f4b-a5af-e60dbfbddfd8">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="33fd56f6-885f-4fb0-9d7e-7757a4d81984">
      <Text>Estella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="968d5aed-8c8c-444c-9d5e-1258b4c1c47d">
      <Text>Your chest is exposed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e18a15c6-48c8-4179-93d7-0022b0ac3f63">
      <Text>Rowan walks away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6109a237-0dad-4dce-94a1-e46f973e9c24">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9e5dfe4f-0ad0-4e9b-94fc-17bc06e02ea3">
      <Text>So what?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1b2dec46-1826-4cd4-8ef0-bb4feb30e053">
      <Text>Estella stares, then follows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="35" Type="Scene Heading" id="c107efd6-d5c1-4384-9634-e22b8ddfadef">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="47" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Rowan'S ROOm </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> ContINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="53ced202-782e-41a0-bdd2-7e4b7bef3c36">
      <Text>Rowan steps into the closet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="36" Type="Scene Heading" id="92d37203-faa6-4599-8c03-dfcbb845fe46">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="47" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Closet </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> continUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="406f7a03-1b8d-4474-b30b-ecfca3ddb22e">
      <Text>Neatly folded shorts, several pairs of combat boots, folded underwear and hanging short</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>sleeve button</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>up shirts.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1e03dff9-ebd8-46e3-b9e1-745b2ef95b74">
      <Text>She drops her towel, starts getting dressed, grabs a pair of socks, squeezes them lightly, puts them on, then the boots.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="37" Type="Scene Heading" id="b6d4f919-701d-48af-9431-52c2a0410b29">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="47" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="8494eec1-eee9-4bdc-8792-fbf1c3d8b3f7"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY’S BUTLER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="496e10bc-15da-4081-985b-8399932a6d7b"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Wendy’s room </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="27cbc649-1c2e-4ffc-b7c8-4d12679b5668">
      <Text>Wendy wakes from her nap, sits up and stretches with a yawn—a knock at her door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dcf8e74a-92dc-44b2-bfd8-ff60e4759410">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="62676c7c-ccc4-4f21-9922-3c6c1d45ada8">
      <Text>Come in!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c1adcaa3-d9d0-4bc6-a8f5-a5ab7928ca7a">
      <Text>Her butler enters with a plate of Tripe and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">drisheen</Text>
      <Text> and places it on the table beside her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a8b9d815-ec0b-4c78-96b3-09a1183e7b2e">
      <Text>Wendy’s Butler</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="06355e94-f1cb-49b3-96fe-5bc78242a32c">
      <Text>Your dinner, ma’am.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0909aeae-8ae7-405c-9e49-408a0d9429ac">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fef259c9-48e4-4ceb-ab37-afd8d2b85fd2">
      <Text>Are we not eating with the others, or in a dining room?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="56e27bac-b282-4c7a-8d9a-ad195885000d">
      <Text>WENDY’S BUTLER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0015a552-3a6c-49ce-a7bc-02580af63f67">
      <Text>There’s a lot to take in with the home; they were hoping that giving you something comfortable in a room you’re already familiar with would be better.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="37a9d000-b421-430b-97e4-ba866fd72001">
      <Text>He smiles; Wendy examines him, then turns to the plate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e6c7b1a4-b8a1-4a72-b899-8f783b0226b1">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="80f938d6-3780-4ce1-a142-2ddc87a67130">
      <Text>Well, I appreciate them doing that.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7cd7852a-c69a-4e84-bb1f-0157364f1e4a">
      <Text>He bows, then leaves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7cd7852a-c69a-4e84-bb1f-0157364f1e4a">
      <Text>Wendy takes a bite; she melts into it and takes another, savoring it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="38" Type="Scene Heading" id="841cfb3e-8972-4d01-8e11-035c2d652ebc">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="48" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ESTELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="97506e1e-3369-4b0c-93b0-20ca9ee95408"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. ROWAN’S ROOM </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> simulTANEOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="060d9f15-2e7d-47ab-8393-385457e7f441">
      <Text>Rowan stares at the tapestry.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="21b11af3-0d38-4e57-996b-41dcf5c564cc">
      <Text>Estella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3b192482-7f80-4852-bd93-41a6800af448">
      <Text>Your dinner must be ready by now; I’ll fetch it for you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="33b58fc3-7976-4350-82f8-c9e3f1e7ee01">
      <Text>Rowan gives a thumbs—up. Estella leaves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eb1e98ff-2f72-4f05-8b4f-895b010acd2e">
      <Text>A few beats pass; Rowan exhales.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d2c34fb3-522d-40c6-b966-bde288f7bd99">
      <Text>Estella returns with a plate of Loco </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Moco</Text>
      <Text> and sets it on the table next to her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="69ea5509-4cfe-4f6e-bab5-0f2ade6cb40e">
      <Text>She bows, then steps aside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2b210b82-f843-46c9-9ce6-5ae18cf6636f">
      <Text>Rowan stares at the dish.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2b210b82-f843-46c9-9ce6-5ae18cf6636f">
      <Text>She picks it up, takes the spoon in her hand, tastes it, then widens her eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="39" Type="Scene Heading" id="6b41fd36-9fac-462d-a261-d53e3a00f625">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="48" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Ball park </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> evening</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="435b7cd5-1f24-456a-bc08-d52c5e0955dd">
      <Text>Young Rowan steps up to the plate, taps the bat on the plate, and readies to swing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="435b7cd5-1f24-456a-bc08-d52c5e0955dd">
      <Text>Her friend, a guy wearing a Dodgers cap and standing on the pitcher’s mound, leans in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="435b7cd5-1f24-456a-bc08-d52c5e0955dd">
      <Text>Another friend with a catcher’s mitt and a backward Dodgers cap gives a hand signal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="435b7cd5-1f24-456a-bc08-d52c5e0955dd">
      <Text>The pitcher shakes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="435b7cd5-1f24-456a-bc08-d52c5e0955dd">
      <Text>Another hand signal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="435b7cd5-1f24-456a-bc08-d52c5e0955dd">
      <Text>A shake.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="435b7cd5-1f24-456a-bc08-d52c5e0955dd">
      <Text>Another.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="435b7cd5-1f24-456a-bc08-d52c5e0955dd">
      <Text>A nod.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="435b7cd5-1f24-456a-bc08-d52c5e0955dd">
      <Text>He rights himself and prepares to throw.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="435b7cd5-1f24-456a-bc08-d52c5e0955dd">
      <Text>Rowan exhales.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="435b7cd5-1f24-456a-bc08-d52c5e0955dd">
      <Text>The boy throws the pitch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="435b7cd5-1f24-456a-bc08-d52c5e0955dd">
      <Text>Rowan swings; the ball cracks against the bat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="af13e3bc-ecda-4292-97ce-478cbe4ebe72">
      <Text>The ball goes high and away; another friend runs back toward the fence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4eb6ce8c-940e-487f-96e4-a3a3eb180f34">
      <Text>Rowan speeds around first base.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dd3bb6f6-cbdc-43e0-840c-2817ac449e80">
      <Text>The ball falls on the other side of the fence, just out of reach of the mitt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="23e2da39-6fc4-43e5-8172-c81480e55b18">
      <Text>Rowan smiles as she rounds second base.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="40" Type="Scene Heading" id="51736a18-1f2a-45f2-9fa7-245060191b0a">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="49" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN’S MOM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="de84b5ff-c942-4884-bb55-1fb502b83b70"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Rowan’s CHILDHOOD HOME </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> simULTANEOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7a4a6e51-b0f6-470d-a6a8-cc0ac92b2b6f">
      <Text>Rowan’s mom walks outside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="57db122f-4f00-4354-9100-9c95b9fd1168">
      <Text>Rowan’s Mom</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ee0ab57d-7029-4d7c-93c9-e0fd8315d37e">
      <Text>Rowan, time for dinner!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="41" Type="Scene Heading" id="49c23b65-d54f-4375-9630-507f70aab87b">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="49" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="YOUNG ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="8d7595f9-2925-40f4-a264-10ed9e3e69f0"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Ball Park </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> simULTANEOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b9345d59-206a-4a69-bccf-34351a5c3d17">
      <Text>Rowan rounds third and pivots to the house when she hears her mom.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b24936d9-1e26-4922-86d9-d578eb9a3cfb">
      <Text>Young Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="698bc396-bb61-4513-931f-3a61cbfa8ecf">
      <Text>Sorry, guys, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gotta</Text>
      <Text> go!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d79a8550-97b6-4a27-aa8c-fa2fd5f04a57">
      <Text>She runs off; her friends all wave.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="42" Type="Scene Heading" id="900edb7d-0e42-47e1-8e58-57b0120afe5c">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="49" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN’S MOM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="908e449e-bf5f-4c98-9479-ea78a725033d"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="f5d2ad9d-0265-41e4-9e47-e8e0bd27eaea"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Rowan’s childHOOD HOME </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="75885315-a8d4-438b-a795-b00f02bf7ce4">
      <Text>Rowan sits at the table</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> eager.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b883cad-9d0f-44fb-8710-1407c19add94">
      <Text>Her mom serves a plate of Loco </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Moco</Text>
      <Text>, takes her by the head, and pulls her in for a forehead kiss.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ca4c1e3e-79cc-4eb1-8368-cd9bda631c25">
      <Text>Rowan’s mom</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b3951779-7aeb-4eaf-817b-ebbf020af064">
      <Text>Did you win?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f86836dd-53ac-4981-9252-b2edcba4ecad">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="939854b3-5a01-4c29-b397-ed0725098d6c">
      <Text>I didn’t win since you had me come home</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5ff0203f-e0e2-4f58-ba45-77c7b8a4b255">
      <Text>ROWAN’S MOM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3ef60ce1-d6d8-4e66-8ae1-ac31a03b8ef2">
      <Text>Well, you wanted to eat, didn’t you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="71e3b0cd-c8f6-4ebc-bde7-3c1c665a5fcd">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2d878b60-cab4-4c0d-a10c-f5f7cdbc7cde">
      <Text>Duh, but I was going to say that I got a home run!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f2eca547-fd98-4d27-b316-b67c87400c84">
      <Text>ROWAN’s Mom</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a26da471-b0e1-43f4-b234-c700aa85b835">
      <Text>That’s amazing, sweetheart!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9012dd26-4641-46ef-8fdd-8c639709d02a">
      <Text>Rowan smiles again as she takes a bite of her food.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="43" Type="Scene Heading" id="2c6da3bd-0c00-445e-83a9-f33d513592b2">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="50" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Rowan'S ROOM </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> continUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="300e1e20-9492-4381-bbce-e974f1d57820">
      <Text>Rowan puts the spoon down and stares at the food. Blank—faced.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2798bf0d-efa2-42b7-8fcb-6312d8e498dd">
      <Text>She puts the food down and lies down, staring at the ceiling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="44" Type="Scene Heading" id="360a6bc3-1177-48e1-acf4-2b9d04d58cc3">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="50" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. WENDY’S ROOM </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> siMULTANEOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7d630671-4dfa-4da7-8f7a-8db0dc8b52f3">
      <Text>Wendy puts her cleaned plate down, moves to the end of the bed and picks up her guitar.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="02d2b788-296e-4e50-9edb-7b8caf590978">
      <Text>She plays an emotional song</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Note" id="eb235bf2-09a0-4f85-b0d0-96310d91c267">
      <Text>Placeholder song: Crimson Day </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> Avenged Sevenfold</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="45" Type="Scene Heading" id="44cf0cae-7d3a-4daf-9708-c50a4c75ac9d">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="50" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. rowan'S ROOM </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> simULTANEOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2058a102-2ddd-4752-8067-541db0e7b2b0">
      <Text>Rowan exhales deeply as she sits up, picks up the plate of food again, and eats slowly. Her face turns somber, and a tear falls right onto the food.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="720e18b9-900c-4b87-a274-f39bddbde5b1">
      <Text>She sniffles and wipes another away, sets the bowl down again, and covers her face with her hands, crying softly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="dfa39e59-c70f-4dcc-87ad-ba1764f69c80">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="46" Type="Scene Heading" id="8d3f6965-653d-44a9-b896-0d5a061bd859">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="50" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Wendy’s room </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b6bad6e2-445b-4331-8c9a-b3ad4d55c512">
      <Text>A soft knock at the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7dbeede3-d6c0-4d41-8102-d19e30decfaa">
      <Text>Wendy sleeps</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> another knock.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="23424dbc-3fb8-414e-9853-02b23d56b8b7">
      <Text>The person tries the doorknob; it opens, revealing Rowan peeking inside, looking around the room and spotting Wendy asleep.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="894c53f9-d259-42b5-8c50-f98b628b3338">
      <Text>Rowan smiles softly, then slowly closes the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="8c1a8324-cc41-4f9f-a0c9-6f5068535f4a">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="47" Type="Scene Heading" id="255cddca-77b0-424e-8f66-9c465ff05526">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="51" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="4ea3404b-8b06-4432-9597-2f989701754f"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ESTELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="4b9026c1-2426-4556-b0c4-f2b59789175b"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">OmaNEAR</Text>
      <Text> MANSION </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> morning</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2916f678-e423-4bde-b724-f77ce42e6f59">
      <Text>Rowan sleeps.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f88d16c1-aee7-45ab-a858-a4689363f54d">
      <Text>Estella knocks on the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7061b814-eee2-4bae-aee7-cf6d3c5362c3">
      <Text>Rowan immediately wakes up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="23374444-b79d-44cf-8748-018384592054">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6904514a-52c4-4e0d-b53f-62d9c57805d3">
      <Text>Who’s there?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c6713e68-9f98-4713-94d4-f331c9a0159e">
      <Text>EsteLLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d2879d31-33a5-4593-828a-fe0070b3b1eb">
      <Text>It’s Estella.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dae2d952-8106-4db7-8eee-5da930e44be3">
      <Text>Rowan sighs, mouth closed. She gets up, still undressed, and opens the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="945bdd09-3929-40a6-8be6-648b61539898">
      <Text>Estella glances down, surprised, then back up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fff64c4b-1561-41b7-8d01-78310884815e">
      <Text>EsTELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c17c3bf4-b071-4269-bb41-1c5162c73f4d">
      <Text>Good morning!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b303f447-3bdd-4fdb-b9a9-e6977279b7e2">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="175d82a5-78e6-4816-ad01-9bec45ed45bc">
      <Text>What’s up?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6b280d87-9113-4f33-83cd-64db62af8c37">
      <Text>Estella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a5a980c6-73a6-4bfe-ab44-d4d2493bab3e">
      <Text>Breakfast is ready if you’d like to come down and join the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Omanears</Text>
      <Text> and your friend.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9fd837f4-0795-4e2c-a9d2-fba528bff204">
      <Text>Rowan thinks for a moment, then closes the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="03eceb0c-b67c-43c2-bc43-900d1a4eb3a9">
      <Text>EstELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="745687cb-0c23-43bc-8647-32911eaa6722">
      <Text>Take your time!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="342651bd-62c8-4ea1-a5c1-374e675fab23">
      <Text>She walks away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="48" Type="Scene Heading" id="23bda809-cb3e-4a34-a9ff-3f0f67aef8ff">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="51" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY’S BUTLER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="5e04c471-418c-4f3f-a73c-caaab6be85cf"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="46f0dfd8-442a-4c11-a19d-7f210e265545"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Wendy'S ROOM </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> simULTANEOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e6f8f8f4-d382-4e46-ad6b-370ce758b1ca">
      <Text>Wendy sleeps.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="caec9d44-41be-4931-a8d4-357d4c31faee">
      <Text>Wendy’s butler knocks softly, then opens the door gently.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="de882d59-8a54-4df5-bde5-2756c98f784a">
      <Text>Noticing Wendy asleep, he walks over and gently shakes Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f5c46c6f-e487-4abe-a4f7-59bb6f58db66">
      <Text>Wendy stirs awake and is startled by her butler.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dcef4d59-145f-4e7d-a87b-4f73993394b0">
      <Text>WendY’S BUTLER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="28c77074-da1e-419b-95a7-bbac6d23f949">
      <Text>Apologies, but breakfast is ready; your friend and the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Omanears</Text>
      <Text> are waiting for you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a6b5ba74-6673-487e-a7ac-1d793e9e5548">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="795e90d3-5f51-4e19-81f3-b78923b1a0ba">
      <Text>Thank you, I’ll be down soon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a2086349-b73f-427d-a5b9-1fb34b670ed8">
      <Text>The butler bows and leaves, leaving the door open.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="49" Type="Scene Heading" id="7b90a50d-3863-4b2e-bf33-a8815ba3db22">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="52" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="6915c198-2fc6-426c-a4b8-367ba1dc69e0"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="b15f05ae-e346-4ab3-9767-16d85e4e657d"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">OmanEAR</Text>
      <Text> MANSION </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="129cab99-b0f8-4b13-85f9-370836bfb1f8">
      <Text>R&amp;W walk down opposite staircases and meet at the bottom.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d0edd1a6-cdf3-4dac-ae53-a5bf0d5835b9">
      <Text>Wendy walks up to Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7a282b4f-6810-417e-a21a-9fc3ec6ee77a">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b94f84cc-3b72-493a-a334-2dc2cd545de9">
      <Text>Good morning, Rowan!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9d6ed8f5-365f-4d12-bf94-348fa2f42d27">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7b91611b-454c-46e1-80db-040c10d42be5">
      <Text>Good morning, Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a29c8e32-f29d-42a2-9bf6-a6241cadbaf1">
      <Text>They begin walking to the dining room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="75426ed1-c6d8-4bb1-b99b-c3de08b5980f">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6a1511f4-e228-4179-a822-4c9f5df85740">
      <Text>How’d you sleep?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0f8db4cf-3081-4519-b8d8-504e608880bb">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="39607eac-b437-4e8a-a6f6-57356afa1821">
      <Text>Fine, you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e573fc30-eb9c-4914-a098-fae4df0e8488">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e0059797-6f3e-47e3-9e3e-10433a659fa6">
      <Text>Like a baby, my bed was so comfortable!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0fa2e7ff-74dc-43c6-bfe5-2db5b161a2f5">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="155c03f8-06b1-4ca8-a404-64218f06bb59">
      <Text>That’s good.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a3439af0-8c7c-4289-8837-5bded16e1070">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cd0c73f6-71d9-4af2-9e48-798d014c1d67">
      <Text>What’s your room look like?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="08bf3819-1fae-4bd3-b5cb-6fa2892402f4">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8762bbe0-4f67-4614-8103-28b4606f47ce">
      <Text>I’ll show you today.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="82e44c55-aab5-412a-b2fd-0901b5d65cd4">
      <Text>Wendy smiles; Rowan takes Wendy in for a side hug— Wendy’s shocked.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="50" Type="Scene Heading" id="04502361-1e6c-40e3-925e-c2eff2258b5b">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 1/8" Page="52" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NEYELA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="72180ee2-2c0c-4bbd-8adb-31fd57fc0492"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIERIST">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="141dc861-aff2-480d-80e8-d2a72a9f8de2"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="2a7b9c23-de3d-4ba4-955c-761e7f92c1c4"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="38440da6-1743-497b-9060-c7eb335435ce"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Dining room </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> continUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="db384da2-20a2-439e-b4ed-9170e78d54ca">
      <Text>They arrive in the dining room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="be75cec8-679b-4c90-a9b4-a4532887cc5a">
      <Text>A long table seats 15+ people and is adorned with a family crest in the center and intricate filigree woodwork; it holds plates of exotic food.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0c2c5c60-4462-46a1-97d3-c78b3eaf0c1c">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text> &amp; </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> sit together at the head of the table, speaking inaudibly; they turn to R&amp;W.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b6784207-290d-4ff7-8fe8-2bb9c2c961ca">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cea92c26-428d-4e7a-b960-cedf7d6e6778">
      <Text>Good morning, thank you for joining us! Take a seat, Wendy; I have a spot for you right here!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5623cc90-c70b-4ece-ba63-0c1c0f824522">
      <Text>A butler pulls out the seat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6afc3b9e-86c4-4dd2-b464-e228db490d40">
      <Text>Wendy looks up at Rowan, smiles, completes the hug, then walks over to the seat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="da6cb405-896b-4a5a-a435-5dd9a307e0dc">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> gestures to the seat next to him as a butler pulls it out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="313a0293-6510-4536-9b31-e9763d564151">
      <Text>Rowan walks over, and they both sit down at the same time as butlers push them in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4ececb8d-ea30-435d-ae9f-fc714cf7f3e1">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TierIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0b9d09e4-8be6-4014-b1a8-8f5ba70d8a27">
      <Text>How did you gals like the room?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ddd79649-3837-43c8-9b5a-da6af9603910">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="092d73f8-92aa-491e-a0ec-00a8d11b2399">
      <Text>My room is beautiful.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="31414b17-1de4-497b-b127-7399e0fac6af">
      <Text>RowAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d422fd9f-1131-4e75-a820-11d212d3693d">
      <Text>It’s nice.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c14cd220-b350-4db6-929e-09a073d1366e">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="da4ff251-b568-407d-9aaf-06d8cb3b1983">
      <Text>Please take some food for yourselves! Let the butlers know what you want, and they’ll prepare a plate for you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1604c6fd-2dbd-4a64-a4eb-c0507297eb1c">
      <Text>Wendy asks and points at dishes for food; Rowan points and gestures for the plate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="990b98ae-4053-44ae-98ef-d6de8adaecef">
      <Text>Wendy’s butler prepares her plate. Rowan’s butler brings over the two dishes; Rowan sniffs them both, points to one of them, then points to another set of dishes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ae5847e3-311d-4c64-9914-f5f275bba1eb">
      <Text>The butler nods, serves a portion of the accepted dish, then presents two new ones. She smells both, nods to both, and the butler prepares portions. He gestures towards the other dishes; Rowan raises a hand. He places Rowan’s plate in front of her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="13b9cdbf-80db-422f-b03c-52ac63ccf565">
      <Text>She requests a pair of chopsticks; Wendy takes a fork and knife, then eats.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e59cc441-6066-4ae9-b25b-2a8083ba1d8e">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2711ca7b-ca85-47eb-9f5a-fdbb08d23ab4">
      <Text>How is it?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e5f1497f-17a5-42e5-941e-49fea1996f0b">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="9739b09f-e98b-4d73-b11f-11108e884816">
      <Text>(Mouth full)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6ae63207-ac4f-4851-b5d5-0239d763e572">
      <Text>It’s really good!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="066fac02-4ebe-42e6-bc29-8fe57ae0b2d9">
      <Text>The butler returns with the chopsticks. Rowan takes a bite.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0d3d5fde-d000-42f1-8400-ef0d71e2cba2">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1c0670ea-d33b-4e2b-be08-45cbac5bee4d">
      <Text>I agree.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0d90e9e6-4bdb-4378-9e95-862c2fba9652">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TierIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="99cda315-2986-4085-8bfd-b5750ecd5041">
      <Text>Trained before the fallout by the best of the best. They’ve been with us for decades.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4314c7f8-4e1b-4385-ae6d-8883f4bc754b">
      <Text>The four of them eat for a few beats.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="78c3ae03-0937-475e-bcec-85d0012547a0">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="89d11c16-9cc3-4f07-9107-31b3587d75a1">
      <Text>(to butler)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2c4f75b5-b24b-429b-bcb4-5c2a219dea92">
      <Text>Can I have a roll with butter?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2d759944-e147-4745-a515-d0075c52fef8">
      <Text>The butler nods and serves her one.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="78a0272b-7d3c-4755-a78b-e350686f25af">
      <Text>Rowan takes a bread roll and is about to split it herself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="232a4d4b-548e-4150-9644-1166a9b3f3a4">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> places a soft hand on Rowan’s forearm. Rowan turns to him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0bd4df49-ef8b-4c26-80a5-cfc1bd71bc1c">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TierIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca0262d1-9821-4686-bfec-876523cdc262">
      <Text>Please, let the butlers handle that for you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="00c4740e-3e86-4380-89b9-18ad8d92ce2b">
      <Text>A butler takes the roll, cuts it in half and points to jams, jellies, and butter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a31e800b-546b-47aa-a9a6-bac73bf40f4e">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6d75a86d-bdad-4d51-a8ef-ba98dfca36cc">
      <Text>Strawberry.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="84eb156f-3ed1-4985-9086-ef76c868a30c">
      <Text>The butler prepares the roll and places the halves on her plate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="67913e06-00d1-478e-b47b-21d72a7d71a2">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d00f6908-f4a1-4d97-8dc9-4b5100488fa2">
      <Text>Wendy, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text> would like to take you out to our garden for some tea and a chat. Rowan, you’ll be with me for something a little more active.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ec973423-7e4f-4444-8627-6cc9fab75b75">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6f818f1b-2495-4ca6-83ec-f16e81158609">
      <Text>Sounds lovely!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f23e2f2c-3987-40b8-9efe-a645f2e520d0">
      <Text>She looks to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text>, who nods and smiles back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d844f4e2-c402-4b51-8133-97e22c27588b">
      <Text>Rowan nods and continues to eat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="51" Type="Scene Heading" id="78b00788-3609-4a35-a842-c6f73edb7059">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="55" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIERIST">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="c1fcd4fd-d7ca-41b5-8c47-5deb00e6abbe"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="49317bf0-2da0-4857-bf91-99e04bfa67de"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Omanear</Text>
      <Text> mansion </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9cf6abc9-8f05-4161-b8a4-6b91f610c1de">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text> and Wendy head for the garden, waving to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> and Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0723c945-818e-4da4-a51d-66a46c0ebe1e">
      <Text>Once gone, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> looks at Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6780dbdb-c1fa-4286-aeee-076c3776081d">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9a63b552-ed12-4da5-b458-b941d81315ec">
      <Text>I’m sure you haven’t had a proper workout in a while, huh?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="54238b0b-ad74-4b01-adae-78e0a0f7948f">
      <Text>RoWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2f604ee1-58e6-462a-a4ec-2cd1d745d7bf">
      <Text>You could say that.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b04b9e83-2bda-4d7d-9561-2ef5daeabc15">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="86df2824-5d21-4cf3-b9f0-fc21a69a256a">
      <Text>Perfect, come with me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6293b907-1b6d-4f86-b316-eab557dae19f">
      <Text>He leads; Rowan hesitates but follows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="52" Type="Scene Heading" id="cc59f07b-a735-4cec-a7cc-8187bf0873ca">
      <SceneProperties Length="5" Page="55" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIERIST">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="ec35cafe-599c-4e0c-930a-6a2ad03d9de8"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="7421b962-fd2e-4dbc-9037-f5184d073b19"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Gym </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c8b67c4a-0a1d-44ae-8bc0-0d84b5756e68">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> opens the door and lets Rowan in first.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="024eea6e-f278-4ac2-9956-253e6c381231">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TierIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4e5d0e34-05f7-4ef9-b0e0-1666a8de1403">
      <Text>As state</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>of</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>the</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>art as you can get for the times.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d0d632b9-0e29-4007-8665-b9a603cfcd9d">
      <Text>Rowan looks around.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6c368a18-e5d4-4dff-bb56-cb92d47ae339">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TierIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="de879822-3576-4f2c-83cd-65c4a0eae49c">
      <Text>Would you like to change into something more comfortable?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b83e5030-2802-43d6-983d-e3f3a4c5afe7">
      <Text>RowaN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f92e887b-34da-485a-8454-ff4bec91b8c3">
      <Text>No thanks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f32c4ef1-0371-45b1-8e19-1bb24994080f">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c03c834c-9654-41eb-87c6-51700423054f">
      <Text>One moment then.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4cdf596a-033e-4fab-811a-132b7f139736">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> leaves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4cdf596a-033e-4fab-811a-132b7f139736">
      <Text>Rowan explores the lifting equipment: a bench press bench, a squat rack, a deadlift frame, and two treadmills.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="41268969-265a-4223-8a46-0b9bc29613f9">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> returns, in gym shorts and a tank top.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9fd7a843-67c3-4565-b59b-60ca28d08033">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3d864457-aa74-4d61-b88b-da57227b5138">
      <Text>Proposition. We see who can outlift who. No powers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d011190e-9194-406a-89db-5f4a6c885ae2">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1ac00f1f-d0c2-46ff-8c72-e806a2bc201b">
      <Text>What does the winner get?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="771807b0-d214-4965-92b9-c5800da0475a">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f7214782-f07d-4ce1-abd6-8f13549112fe">
      <Text>Haven’t thought of that yet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6805c9a0-530b-4672-aff1-520b2da842eb">
      <Text>Rowan huffs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8ef4d8cf-e0f0-4948-a9a7-4548736b3007">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> sticks out his hand for a shake.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="36cdbc0f-78e2-455c-9a6a-6b9b91db0c46">
      <Text>Rowan takes it, moves it to a dap up position, and yanks him in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2b5249cb-4d36-439c-bca9-0785d83e332d">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1eeb637c-5119-42e4-bd4c-44e393ac48dc">
      <Text>Try to keep up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a63b0b2c-dba3-4b9d-96d6-e88024947b3a">
      <Text>Rowan walks over to the bench and slaps on two plates on each side.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e53a3db5-eb1f-4eb1-b9a5-bc70ddba733d">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="17d7c273-521b-4c95-b6ba-9694e3cd99fb">
      <Text>Need a spot?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="21dffc1b-0e2e-46a7-9f49-c6d9a6158a08">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="902f591c-1eb5-4de7-a70d-c2dd7e8b05ab">
      <Text>Not for a warm—up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f994da7b-5a69-47aa-983b-e6a76d500311">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TierIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5bd6dc8c-0843-492a-b54e-25d8cbd44566">
      <Text>Oh, yeah, of course.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f32d02bf-abe6-4699-9266-8d2ca91cdee8">
      <Text>Rowan lies back on the bench and reps out a set. She stands up and gestures to the bench.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4378f863-42a6-4a84-a469-a21687bfd932">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> smirks and reps out the same amount.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Shot" id="26b61c49-3761-4d58-aebd-e56db62c970b">
      <Text>Montage: Rowan and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">tierist</Text>
      <Text> get a total body workout</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d7224383-4a2e-4cef-9148-f1ad5b904dbf">
      <Text>Rowan is visibly gassed; </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> is too. He sets up overhead rows and barely completes his set.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="34e54767-69ca-4a86-b38c-36b33486e106">
      <Text>Rowan sits down and starts repping, failing on the last one.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d484b2f8-c389-46bf-9637-bb1f7bfa2484">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> claps.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1a31526b-c7dd-4b75-a363-e051a92c2b76">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TierIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e154d71f-2723-47f0-8ab9-ddaf8a0191e4">
      <Text>Much better than I anticipated. I can only imagine what you’re like at full power.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="02ab3c55-e4c1-440c-af7a-a78bc9711d40">
      <Text>RoWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37027362-5d88-4ac2-8559-21ab7736239f">
      <Text>Apparently still behind you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3e6f982d-c6a3-4f1d-9451-acd82ec8e863">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> laughs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f69bad77-5aff-44d5-9869-766a47095749">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8304c8be-c37a-4c95-b172-51bb3094af5e">
      <Text>Maybe, but who knows. Limits are a funny thing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="29ebec8a-e5f5-498e-85f8-2ab4245e2789">
      <Text>Rowan turns around and sits against the chest</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>rest; </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> sits down on the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="36ecf3b8-a57c-4c43-bcad-a3ae1871d619">
      <Text>RowAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4adff0e1-46ba-4915-b7e3-fb78cf8677b0">
      <Text>So, you thought of a prize?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4c7e9f33-8a3b-4483-b3e6-f1e84ee58e42">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TierIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2713059c-f633-4b3c-a515-d3a24afeb01e">
      <Text>Nope, just figured the competition was enough.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f2215e84-90a4-42f0-b016-5f5bf2e7544a">
      <Text>Rowan chuckles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="268d19c9-bd8f-48a6-b35f-0a4736127ee4">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8b7c3820-e69b-49ae-8e66-9e1939210f0d">
      <Text>That’s </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">kinda</Text>
      <Text> lame.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="31778a26-c03a-4441-86cb-aff1575de0eb">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2a0c576e-1a27-46b8-b020-c71f40f70b09">
      <Text>Alright, fine. How about you tell me what you think of your friend Wendy?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d23c1dd0-1d53-4777-8e35-6b8b11900b56">
      <Text>Rowan raises an eyebrow at </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4ed48651-ea55-4ec9-994e-c7eaa9187c34">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="132a89a1-74f8-44b4-8720-dca1e3349165">
      <Text>Might as well skip the pleasantries and get right to the meat, right?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6f5ea60a-4d7a-4cb9-8a3d-c4bf68806888">
      <Text>Rowan exhales.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="09d3d008-f332-4ba7-9332-9bcd84fe782e">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2fd8080e-f85f-4359-a768-1877cd5df8b4">
      <Text>I guess.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ef5eb339-c118-40e2-9bc0-a71aa6a4da32">
      <Text>She stands up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="737231bc-9ec5-458c-b47a-cac0e53ef41e">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="13f73a9c-7367-497b-b75f-89140a4e09d4">
      <Text>Walk with me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e4d59fdc-2103-4d78-b67d-279873208338">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> stands and follows her onto the treadmills, and they start walking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e1b5c6bf-1207-4199-a16f-ba62df4a7930">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9af8dd7a-65cb-4c0a-8f2b-45d320a96a14">
      <Text>I want full frontal honesty.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3887698a-c309-4801-8c62-cd13bf56d71d">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="47a64f89-b54b-4234-b393-f9538ec3ef60">
      <Text>Fine. There was this time where I was hooking up with this dude. Nothing serious, all casual. It was friends</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>with</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>benefits through and through. But he eventually wanted more, which is fair; I’m not gonna blame the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">twink</Text>
      <Text> for falling for me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2bc2adeb-6c8b-4da1-9968-94f5fe89c7f6">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TierIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c26bcc86-c5bc-4a03-9c09-3c1e1b19c9e4">
      <Text>This doesn’t seem to have to do with Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="45173a32-1df5-4f1c-802e-8c58f206dc79">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4ea8ff55-169b-436b-86e5-44c69cdd333a">
      <Text>I’ll get there. I had to cut things off cause he just kept asking for more. He wanted dates, dressing up, all this shit I don’t vibe with.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cf45b55d-4d4b-45ba-a0d2-0e47d3a4308b">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="13b2620f-3a78-4c08-9607-ed33c9b1de72">
      <Text>Good for you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3790d032-c19c-4fc3-afdb-8888b12bdafa">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a2336cfc-7b85-4efb-88e0-3a12ecb046c7">
      <Text>Thanks, anyway. I was already on the verge of saying ‘fuck it, this dating shit and hookup culture aren’t doing it for me.’</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="36ecafa0-0a4c-46f6-b4d5-36191830c73c">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="78ae1619-8349-439c-b71e-0fdc5cbedfae">
      <Text>What, were you gonna go celibate?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="89442024-ffbf-4d88-9471-b5eaa4126201">
      <Text>RoWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="60240292-7c71-484b-b562-41ac820a352a">
      <Text>Pfft, no. I’d just decided that I didn’t want whatever most of these dudes were trying to get at. I was pretty alone in general, no friends, no family, just a lot of working out and fighting. So I go years without anything, and then Wendy shows up and, I don’t know. We were both inside this bar, and there were some douches; we ended up killing them, but as I’m about to leave, she uses her shit to pull me back, and I’ve been with her since. But, to answer your question more directly, there’s something nice about hanging out with her. It doesn’t feel like I have to be any way. Like, obviously we’re friends, but I don’t feel like I have to be a ‘normal’ friend. I don’t have to explain much for her to understand what’s going on. The first fucking day we met, she made me drive her around in a buggy and then talked for six hours.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f611fcea-168c-4902-aa51-0dc9b4f04cfb">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1aaeab17-f758-4b98-b24d-9dc5950b8a16">
      <Text>Damn. That must have been brutal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3ee0aa69-2228-4650-b0ce-c269c96bd222">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2d8d3a4b-f81b-4c2f-ba8b-a3df171bb5d6">
      <Text>Not at all actually. I liked it. That was when I knew she was at least tolerable.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f74fe53e-6777-4289-a5d0-974b6a895f8d">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="78d6a130-d3d1-4ad6-890e-fada5615977a">
      <Text>Why’s that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="40baf4de-e415-42a7-8e19-ce69be133a2c">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d14cd103-5d28-45ea-9e48-e443b0a4d534">
      <Text>Well, she wasn’t trying to get me to pour myself over the same way she was. It was, I don’t know, this mutual understanding that she’d just be doing a lot of the talking; and she seemed okay with it too. Does that answer your question?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f2f76f81-52b0-4a7f-8cf6-50e49ae91769">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="609ba856-e5c8-407c-9957-a0ceb72d8d57">
      <Text>I guess it’d have to, huh?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c02fedd1-11e1-4627-beab-0298a67f416e">
      <Text>They both laugh.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2b2d8099-1379-43e9-9c0c-d11cf740f861">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d8daf7ed-7421-4dcf-8004-41c715c6d49b">
      <Text>Yeah, she’s cute, plays good music, and gets me. I guess that’s a more concise way to put it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3468a149-18ab-499b-ad2b-49bf26bc8658">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9f855078-896b-4071-b233-e7f100a601e6">
      <Text>As straightforward as it needs to be, doesn’t it?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2cd1df71-49a1-4711-a1c1-3d9233a4ecb7">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e5693528-bc2b-4c9a-bc39-2ed01a4327da">
      <Text>What about you and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="50e52881-73d3-44cc-8227-5e634d4c383b">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bbafc438-3a34-4086-b279-cd9c1a13499c">
      <Text>Oh, well, at first I didn’t like her like that. I knew her cause she was in the same club as me, and I was friends with her boyfriend at the time. I, quite literally, was the reason why they even met outside of the club for the first time, even after months of them having dated.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7c2929cf-6ce2-4cb9-9f56-12a969ca951a">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4e32fa97-f43e-4b66-afeb-a5fd1fa6d278">
      <Text>Crazy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1a0abd0c-ab51-461b-b4e3-57102c2169f4">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="623bcde7-558a-4354-ad42-3d7b9d49d50c">
      <Text>Exactly! There was even this time when we sat in the car together, driving around, and we told each other, to each other’s faces, why we wouldn’t date each other. We had been friends for about a year by then. Fast forward about six months, and she asks me to hang out; I head over. We’re playing poker; I remember this time when she mentioned at a party at her place that she wanted to play strip poker, but no one was comfortable doing it. Except me, but I digress. So I asked her then if she wanted to play; she said yes. We came up with these ‘punishments’: if I had to strip fully, she could touch my dick; if she stripped fully, I got to touch her boobs. But I ended up winning, and while I was holding them, I just went in for a kiss. The rest is history; we were both eighteen, and that was at least forty years ago.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ec1ec931-bd68-4435-a385-77a766d9477f">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9961e2af-abd2-4e9b-a8e0-61735278525c">
      <Text>Interesting.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="53" Type="Scene Heading" id="9c4e3bd0-cc25-4a2e-be14-bc42bff25884">
      <SceneProperties Length="4 4/8" Page="60" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="60dbf019-b379-43bd-b4be-88c574db8c76"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NEYELA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="fd36de02-545b-468f-b6b7-d2bf39b43286"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. garden </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> before</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e3296790-4db5-40b5-b8a0-dd2c115a87ae">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text> and Wendy sit in the garden; a maid delivers trays of tea, cups, and saucers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="545ea222-8150-4154-b4ce-15ab16a3b84d">
      <Text>She pours a cup for both; the tea is a deep blue before she adds lemon juice, shifting it to magenta.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6fe2dbcb-5b6f-4355-b35b-5a58a4f6b568">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="873c59c3-36ff-4ff5-bbfa-8dc83995a335">
      <Text>Oh, that’s cool!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d4901b09-3f9c-4880-8276-d17f9b39f72a">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NeyelA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2e108072-e548-4695-9061-4aaa065536ea">
      <Text>It’s called Butterfly Pea Flower tea. I have it every time I come to the garden.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2c6fc797-7e20-4734-9daf-e3bceceab130">
      <Text>Wendy takes a small sip.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4d2343a9-82d1-4f12-b0f4-36d23bbea55d">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0e2c9168-d219-4fb4-927c-7c18e033aff3">
      <Text>Wow, it’s really good too.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d94db650-b029-484e-abf5-8e4af3cb0dc5">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text> smiles and looks out over the garden.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="47ee41f3-9488-4171-92d5-fbe684389f39">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NEYELA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="543c5636-d3fc-4d0f-9735-5a042b21642e">
      <Text>I’m glad you like it! </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> rarely joins me out here. Usually he’s too busy working.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="24ce9639-eac3-4360-8979-0dd5f92e7751">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="62e6a6c9-98a2-4cbf-941c-aa61ce34506c">
      <Text>What does he do for work?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a986ab78-5adf-4888-a851-354583a60def">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NEYELA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b158b20e-4eb6-4939-8cde-8c7d864645ef">
      <Text>For the past god</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>knows</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>how</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>long, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist’s</Text>
      <Text> been an insurance salesman. It took him a long time, but he eventually convinced the most powerful person in the country to buy his company’s life insurance. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> got an immediate promotion from it too.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e15787a6-dfce-456e-8131-412a114bf804">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="53127104-48a7-410f-8882-d745ace9bba3">
      <Text>Who’s that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1463f039-7730-4060-9874-04752009a687">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NEYELA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="335de997-dce3-4365-90d1-850473698503">
      <Text>A man named Mihai Niculescu. This guy is so rich that he bought an entire castle over in Connecticut!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0db96873-8e2f-4127-92bb-9f6b9d0a873a">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e9fe3a52-17e4-45be-a142-bf3362fd11c7">
      <Text>Wow!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1aeb5fc3-e14c-4f3a-b386-57098c7cac99">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NeyeLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0de018fc-e3f2-481c-b4ec-0568cab6a315">
      <Text>Yeah, that guy’s policy alone pays for this estate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e50b5d7d-83f6-4235-8e18-4a1af0a92912">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5fe18d05-99d3-4299-a6f3-02ca4aeb849a">
      <Text>Good for you guys.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7e430b38-0c38-419f-ab0f-8a2a14539fe9">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NEYELA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="435e0abe-7b7f-4296-a186-f0352c5d2e28">
      <Text>What about you? What do you and Rowan do?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="56a55475-7384-457a-8f2b-18df5a491056">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="db061d0b-1912-43a0-8518-ded204747fc8">
      <Text>Well, neither of us do anything that makes money. I play music, and she’s basically hired muscle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e730a343-e9d3-4880-849f-8dcc801dc1a2">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text> laughs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="03bf6639-70dd-4c29-9528-d2ac4a3550af">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NEYELA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="992a1f88-6cb7-4c23-8e87-43de93ab4418">
      <Text>Modern—day hippies, huh?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="98a184c8-fed8-4238-a4e8-abf2e2dddfbf">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c324b925-985b-42d3-b800-b6a0f8bb671f">
      <Text>You could say that. I came from a town where my talents paid for it all. I was given a home, the people loved me, so I never needed to worry about money.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9719c61d-1bd5-4e12-b511-100325b05653">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NEYELA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="15b5fe20-154d-4cee-8fed-50feb3e2a7f6">
      <Text>What made you want to move then?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="292341f1-75c1-48b9-8261-f1a9a24d0031">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7ef82f10-ec26-4eac-843f-a6e1c49958d6">
      <Text>I don’t really know; I couldn’t tell you. Boredom probably. At least that’s what I tell myself. I don’t know; I just really felt stuck there. Like, don’t get me wrong. I loved my home, the people, the town, but it just didn’t feel like enough. No one in the town piqued my interest romantically without obviously wanting to be with me for some ulterior motive.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cee9a1bf-dbe8-49ec-bb07-a9a621f7a57a">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c540d1db-9218-4416-8c16-7142470007a6">
      <Text>How’d you meet Rowan then?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dce38d67-1cde-4d06-aab5-37e258ed3884">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f04431f7-4c62-4212-a744-52d82011487b">
      <Text>How’d you know her name is Rowan?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="543d6966-4df5-4722-ae6b-74f5b425aa83">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NEYELA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="01882ffd-ad2a-4e98-98a1-0ce3231f1845">
      <Text>Heard you say it this morning.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="19731c6d-d4c4-456b-93ae-1669add100e2">
      <Text>WenDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="077f0057-8db3-4661-be9f-012a2662a750">
      <Text>Oh, sound carries, doesn’t it?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d60dbbfa-61fd-4319-8116-37244237031a">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text> nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="929851a6-bcb0-469e-9649-aa1717ae061b">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="373e6d83-bb6c-4672-95a1-fc27e0bc41e6">
      <Text>Well, I went to this town nearby. This was after that morning I had to take care of a bunch of guys wanting to fuck with the town, so I had left the town and gotten to this one. I was hungry and thirsty after walking literal miles and several hours, so I walked into this bar and got a drink, and she’s sitting right next to me. But then, a group of guys, the same group from the ones that bothered my town before, walk in. There’s like fifteen of them at least or something, so they come and sit down at a bunch of tables, and three sit between Rowan and me. Cause she was already there, and I didn’t want to sit that close to her, even though she looked </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">kinda</Text>
      <Text> cool, so I wanted to sit close enough to say something at some point. But </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">anywhosers</Text>
      <Text>, these three guys sit between one of them and us, and one of them turns to me and starts trying to flirt with me!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="56686840-aae0-4883-b954-a70425b10f56">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NeyeLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c4eb7bd9-f312-4f33-8fc6-392287a9d690">
      <Text>And he was a part of the same gang you took care of that morning?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b3250aad-ee21-4161-9182-003132bc19d2">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2509234a-be5a-416a-927f-f034918981f6">
      <Text>Yeah! His whole angle was basically ‘get with me or die.’ So I was like ‘neither’ and just got up and left. Then he follows me outside. I honestly thought he was gonna try and grab me or something, but I guess he’s more decent in hindsight than I gave him credit for. So I’m walking away, and he gives me ‘one more chance.’ I decline; he tries to whistle, no one comes, so I kill him, go back to the bar and see that Rowan had already killed everyone else. I was like, ‘holy fuck, that’s really hot.’ So I try to be all cool and shit, pick up my bag, and I turn to her and say, ‘Ready?’ Like she’s my friend and we’re gonna head out together. I don’t know why I thought that was a good idea, but whatever. Anyway, she finishes her drink and gets up and walks out, and I’m like, ‘shit, is she actually gonna come with me or something? No way that worked,’ in my head, of course. So we both walk outside, and I walk to a buggy one of these douches left, and I turn, foolishly thinking she was gonna be there. She’s actually walking the other direction, and I’m like, ‘Where you going?’ She says, ‘Home.’ I’m not having it, cause I think I’m the shit for getting her to get up in the first place. So I take out my guitar and start playing it, and she tries to resist the siren’s call, but I’m a siren; you can’t resist that. So, I convince her to get in the car with me and drive.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9bfba17a-45c8-47b1-861c-e8c1709ee98f">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NEYELA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="42338af8-03fc-4609-993f-16dc49fe38a6">
      <Text>Wow, impressive.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7bbfe39b-e6df-40bc-a0c5-ef8588e193dc">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b30b1708-ab25-4377-b822-3c0454723165">
      <Text>Yeah, honestly, I don’t know how I did it, but I’m glad I did, because she was exactly who I wanted to run into. Oh my god, wait, I forgot! I said this cheesy ass line, ‘you’re my new interesting,’ or something like that. I can’t remember exactly, but I know it was something like that. Cause I was looking for something interesting, and I was like meta</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>contextually hoping she’d understand that’s why I said that. But literally anyway that’s the story.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0a32ee5e-a829-4fa9-8236-8d3fcf492936">
      <Text>A half a beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2f1cf0b4-be8b-4beb-9572-9b76acc88b1f">
      <Text>WendY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f9a2d8e8-40b9-4df4-984d-cd309ce8e85f">
      <Text>Sorry for rambling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bb1b848d-25dd-4e0f-95df-45d590a75332">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NEYELA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b7611257-35a4-4a6d-abbd-d5489ce7aa1a">
      <Text>No! Never apologize for being yourself. Even if it means you rant or ramble a bunch, it means you clearly care about whatever it is you’re talking about, and that’s why you can go into such specific detail about it too.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f640967b-d645-42cd-b9ed-1cf9821a2ec9">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="906ee7c4-42b1-48f1-b6c9-c5620b627253">
      <Text>I could’ve gone into more, to be honest, but I didn’t want to talk your head off all day.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c62d1c39-f1a0-49d3-a209-1b3e879243f9">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text> places a hand on Wendy’s hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="21d052e6-6612-4604-bfeb-bc588c109dad">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NEYELA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4205b2f0-c664-4556-879b-a3cd7f2c7b2c">
      <Text>It’s okay if you did. It’s refreshing not to have to be the one who talks all the time.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d83ccd0e-713a-4cc3-bfe9-4ace70bbb56f">
      <Text>Wendy’s stunned, but then smiles and takes a long sip of her tea.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7a677c35-d669-4869-8ea7-e276c99b2700">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="436eaa3e-52a4-4237-93c6-f9d029a4b1bf">
      <Text>Thanks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="be6727b9-6344-4218-b897-fb397405b0a7">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NEYELA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1a73e0fd-a550-495a-a4d5-3385ee0f2c9f">
      <Text>Of course!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7c32353e-b407-475c-93f0-309dab1ea58a">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text> removes the hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="54" Type="Scene Heading" id="f3526612-3da5-40b6-9e93-e4998c8db620">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="65" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="0408a54d-b2e7-46eb-aab0-ab79348c8f9d"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="898926ad-d86d-42c1-9ad0-4c5709acfbc2"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Omanear</Text>
      <Text> mansion </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c9482682-fa5e-4879-bedc-9463f759c64c">
      <Text>Rowan steps out of her room, fully dressed, and walks over to Wendy’s room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6670bcdc-4a3a-4212-8f0c-f3699de8569c">
      <Text>She examines the items in the house, stopping before a portrait of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text> &amp; </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text>. She stops and stares.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1a2da81c-5aa1-4fa5-b9ae-1b86f71800d0">
      <Text>Wendy (o.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2a96bb7a-1405-4947-be7f-0fe04e45c510">
      <Text>Hey!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b11a0ad-df7d-42ca-be5d-fd736282aded">
      <Text>Rowan turns, waves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7832f80c-cbf3-47b0-a82f-f52804794c62">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1bfc50fb-2974-431a-b450-d441916150de">
      <Text>Hey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b11a0ad-df7d-42ca-be5d-fd736282aded">
      <Text>Wendy walks up to her and looks at the painting.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="de8778d3-b92a-4877-b145-40142941b93e">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ada1d4ef-02db-4500-81c1-0238e1fba1a7">
      <Text>How was your little hang out with </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e02f0bd4-ba47-4851-a303-9b177025e861">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="36a64a61-c8ee-4123-9962-91c338a82040">
      <Text>It was alright. Just worked out for the most part. What about you and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="52478ede-2228-4edf-969a-085858a30a4e">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1dbd8df2-b648-46f0-8436-15ee1350e6e9">
      <Text>Her garden was beautiful, and we had some tea.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dc16a542-2504-45b2-8c58-83e779dd79a6">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="19004bf1-0b95-43ab-8b11-0397ae9cd9b5">
      <Text>What did you guys talk about?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9092eb7e-aa1c-42fc-81c0-76087aac0d13">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="21ab76a3-a7d8-4fe9-ba3c-c34d46b32482">
      <Text>Just random stuff, nothing important.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bf5b8776-d346-40f4-a216-c9d0a92ee21c">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1c268240-eced-46e1-8167-42a908189181">
      <Text>Yeah, same.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="494098ad-71a8-4b24-af6f-1f7b8d4d7786">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8703c226-adc8-4609-84a6-6070cd052cb6">
      <Text>Rowan looks at Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dcbea20a-9b0c-48c8-97bd-ab2eb33e9dcf">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="59004cc7-4a1d-4ce7-9916-a3ac295f32dc">
      <Text>Hey, can I see your room?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4d1c2a29-adce-4f25-81f5-7af5aaa8074c">
      <Text>WeNDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4b9634a0-daca-4259-9415-af0114b00f29">
      <Text>Of course! Only if you let me see yours too.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b4c86c52-0dfd-4fbc-ae97-4c6043a12ecd">
      <Text>Rowan nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1dd26552-ce1b-4046-8f28-0f0bf13c44d8">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9263abde-aa7f-4b58-aab1-c870ad439918">
      <Text>Duh.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="19e8046a-4ca6-4411-8d55-c58c64c2ab6b">
      <Text>Wendy smiles and takes Rowan by the arm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="55" Type="Scene Heading" id="d85c6f5d-76fd-4339-86b1-c2410334bb5b">
      <SceneProperties Length="3 6/8" Page="66" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="d384ddaa-d2ce-4486-a32d-a110aec47d28"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="b94bb1c5-deac-42ae-8904-6b2a0dab57ed"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY’S BUTLER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="8b50d9dd-0a92-4821-bb10-cd59eef87e35"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Wendy'S ROOM </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> conTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e0e52b54-d27e-4aed-b453-bbf8a31e48a0">
      <Text>Wendy opens the door and drags Rowan inside, then Wendy closes it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f85d74f6-cc54-4b7d-b766-c80f04a73b09">
      <Text>WenDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0a731720-34b6-419d-9960-e7132f95ff0a">
      <Text>Isn’t it perfect?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a2aab134-4e17-4794-b581-f080167cdebd">
      <Text>Rowan looks around.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="10ad6f66-91ab-4563-bd8d-f31695a2529d">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="97e1b049-c294-47e7-96f9-dbec942a2c38">
      <Text>It’s pretty simple.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2aa6b10a-6243-4269-b415-f0c2c0d81496">
      <Text>Wendy sits on the bed, taking off her hat and putting it behind her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cb0ccb17-e2d8-4664-bf42-70ac72cb8ebd">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d14120e2-f733-4515-b2f6-1322b404074a">
      <Text>Perfection doesn’t have to be complex, you know.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e7a33759-d06b-4149-af07-f0d1c430dd4c">
      <Text>They make eye contact; Wendy pats the spot next to her on the bed. Rowan walks over and sits down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a83d9f1e-e49f-42aa-858e-b33f35e4c330">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2e5cf5df-ca99-49c6-a8c8-4a4cdd4966f2">
      <Text>What does your room look like?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fb405d07-7455-4f29-bd11-af89c1c4c8fd">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c890a984-0ab7-4b59-9893-ed7aea2be009">
      <Text>A lot more ornate than this, you’ll see.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9e907924-132b-4c2c-afc0-b51f94db63bc">
      <Text>Wendy moves to sit crisscross behind Rowan, gently scratching her back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="973651f5-74df-4290-b7b0-ab7b93b7d79a">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9fafb362-5342-4a8e-bc72-029441c79b46">
      <Text>Which do you like more?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c5e0d3b3-b6ce-4278-8243-e0b2c6bb4818">
      <Text>Rowan thinks for a moment, eyes closed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e112407e-bc73-47de-bc2b-8b0549f687cb">
      <Text>A few beats of scratching pass.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0409fc00-6628-4c78-a8ca-c3b10bd049ad">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c93ba0bd-21ba-40ce-91aa-f62511c02870">
      <Text>To be honest...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e7197b65-fc26-4f80-a5aa-7171bdc13e82">
      <Text>Wendy rests her head on Rowan’s shoulder, scratching her lower back now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="75a92833-6968-44fa-9124-6d5798f5b708">
      <Text>A few beats of lower back scratching.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="31fa44b0-ca5b-4497-98d3-22fcd90aafa3">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e42d9380-de53-4494-aa5d-d37f4e675fb9">
      <Text>I like this one more.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="aa80a85f-3e13-4b5f-840b-b76655b900fc">
      <Text>Wendy smiles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3b8f0dc4-0cc0-42f1-847e-a3e0f34f84e0">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1021537c-a857-437d-9637-b3c8b4631e51">
      <Text>Good.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="051490fe-8e41-4478-a0fe-6bc2c99002ac">
      <Text>She wraps her arms around Rowan’s torso.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ddea3fa6-ce64-4c66-882a-762368ab68f5">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b9e99e64-21bd-49c3-8388-75de15165eac">
      <Text>It reminds me of you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="506daa23-f22e-4b03-aee5-53edcddd2a3b">
      <Text>Rowan turns her head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e85f5c85-9022-48d8-85fb-bff940ee1311">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e6d30093-4d1c-4dbb-984e-8466b8e5607a">
      <Text>Really now? How’s that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="165e6667-e846-443e-99f8-f259e890aef0">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4a9c2b27-f114-422c-b93f-2b653f20faa0">
      <Text>How much detail do you want?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c3aa7174-8388-4db9-8135-640b702f9184">
      <Text>Rowan rests her head on Wendy’s.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ffd9a330-2280-4dc7-9d24-bf98d6fdf0fe">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="deb52702-8719-405e-991e-f68035fc039e">
      <Text>All of it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a1828ee6-c25f-4781-a1a6-427fec321fca">
      <Text>Wendy smiles, kissing Rowan’s neck before resting it again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3b411404-d2e1-46a2-98eb-25cba5583511">
      <Text>Rowan is caught off guard by the kiss.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="13fd0d1f-b796-4218-8e88-814de18b6a54">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0b3d9af5-7250-48a3-bca1-eeea8237a8d4">
      <Text>Too much?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0b036276-af99-4469-ae98-2c0cb27d4359">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7495532a-98e6-48f1-8ad6-1bdc4d355409">
      <Text>No, wasn’t expecting it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d2c47569-e36f-437d-950e-603bac2cfd29">
      <Text>She rests her head on Wendy’s again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6efbbd8a-d1bd-4751-91b5-e501db269151">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="07fdcf28-7154-4298-92f3-37633d60689a">
      <Text>Had to get you back for the hug you gave me this morning.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="427da56d-7453-455c-91a9-323566ef2439">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a7bd689c-501a-44a7-8356-995ce361c214">
      <Text>Did it make you uncomfortable?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ed885695-fc03-44a8-8d26-56905b94e095">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bab27ff2-87cd-42d1-a504-317e23831a26">
      <Text>No, wasn’t expecting it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e1feb50b-12c9-484e-9550-8e06978f2ac8">
      <Text>Rowan chuckles once.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7f22a43f-422b-469c-830f-a96e070b751b">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6d0e08a4-0b0d-4f81-800e-d83a5e18aa2e">
      <Text>Good. Now please tell me what you’re thinking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2d673828-2fd7-444e-831a-e54950ea6406">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e366c39a-d22d-49ef-92d1-7e1c691b1c83">
      <Text>About the room or about you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1359244e-f503-4a98-99d0-eebbb72e6619">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="02159371-6582-4a6f-971b-25b08ce72f7b">
      <Text>Is there a difference?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4967024f-79fd-4986-9ec0-cd49bb684cd6">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="69718f90-ef1a-4728-afa2-6571be87f95a">
      <Text>Well...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4248987d-3468-41d7-a217-42fc15ef9364">
      <Text>Wendy blushes and turns away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5196a398-9322-4bfd-9cff-0be9136a764d">
      <Text>Rowan takes Wendy’s chin and steers it back to eye contact.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0fc3c7c3-3dd7-4b7c-9b74-49dbe32ee27a">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e6676ea8-f1b4-4a05-9e3e-aa7e6bdca436">
      <Text>No hat to hide under this time.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9bc58676-23a0-4269-9e86-376f794633e8">
      <Text>Wendy blushes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cd1506cb-9133-4c75-9fca-ed661e3f7897">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="99bee0a9-8b40-43e7-8c8a-d5658c6a718d">
      <Text>Whatever.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2612bdf4-32d6-4ada-ab6a-12578eb1e69e">
      <Text>Rowan pulls her in for a forehead kiss.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0cdfd49f-bcf3-40cf-a0ca-fc190b873248">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0cd10af4-520c-4c47-82d3-b97a9141ddc2">
      <Text>Talk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e4da9214-b7da-451c-80ea-ac7c57e0eeab">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="613b7f20-7750-4121-811c-bc9baa5cb91c">
      <Text>Well, the walls remind me of your arms; they’re both textured, strong, and could hold up a house.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b76d6fe2-da4b-4775-b4d3-165772fa6e54">
      <Text>Rowan chuckles; Wendy rests on the other shoulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="28c7e879-6f9a-423b-a4f0-b7aa77475bae">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2c446067-0b71-464f-af27-1772c9433488">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f56cbc31-1321-42a8-89a1-482c270c4e14">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f8bec014-1a26-457d-9a56-d9156dc64347">
      <Text>Nothing...continue.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="00ea5d6c-566a-48cf-837d-9d87be24a00a">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="47cac365-433a-4958-b4a1-f2ec8ac54568">
      <Text>The floors feel like I’m walking on something that’ll never give way, like how your thighs look like Atlas should take some notes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ecb4ac3-3261-433d-89e0-c986ca0580c5">
      <Text>Rowan laughs out loud; Wendy grins.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cd4bce91-f616-45cd-a022-5594f718ea5e">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="999c3573-3f0c-4d1a-8143-9797be971022">
      <Text>Then what about the bed?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1d2930c7-52ea-4431-8cb0-e7e40b10bbd3">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0d1f0cd5-36db-4748-9963-71fc93df872b">
      <Text>Well, the bed is the most interesting part.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8f840305-1f74-44f6-8534-346176958592">
      <Text>She unlatches from Rowan and turns her around.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8f840305-1f74-44f6-8534-346176958592">
      <Text>Rowan tucks her legs underneath her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a6d52956-4dbc-422b-b9ae-f53670e91b22">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5c07775d-7ed2-42d3-bdc7-61ded69127cd">
      <Text>Why’s that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bff7b30c-aa89-49b0-8ba2-2294bb7b1cc5">
      <Text>Wendy takes Rowan’s hands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d64820a3-01b4-45a5-affa-76ded19bee8b">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7be06f3d-18ed-40b0-9e07-9be8dbdd9c10">
      <Text>Because you wouldn’t expect bamboo, a wild, untamable, fast—growing grass, to feel so soft once you spend a night with it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b17c393-ee75-4fac-9747-614894c411ad">
      <Text>Rowan smirks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5317d31c-1aae-4843-8674-2c12fc92b072">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca83880f-1c52-44ef-8ea1-3d4e0ae88139">
      <Text>Fuck you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c777395c-12a3-4783-8f55-dd0396882bf4">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0efe4ddb-123c-4c22-b9dd-6b6d93921133">
      <Text>You wish.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2e69d4b3-768f-40cb-a843-c7d51c9b819a">
      <Text>Rowan rolls her eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5bb3c2da-11bc-4532-b1c3-5c1579582c83">
      <Text>Rowan’s color shifts to Deep Crimson; Wendy’s to Deep Blue.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2e988ddd-b807-4d1c-b024-358728f86ffe">
      <Text>A knock on the door. Wendy looks past Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1b70e019-6583-4517-8ae5-7edb53b6a1ef">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="72b84fdd-3cdc-415a-9b42-ea352949250e">
      <Text>Yes?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d14195e6-cbae-47e2-a741-aa91ca7866e6">
      <Text>WendY’S BUTLER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2c54492e-e965-43a8-b5bf-50e1589aac39">
      <Text>Just wanted to let you know dinner is ready!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8ccfd4ec-98fb-427d-9a56-39255a82705e">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4c274ab8-36c2-4fec-a950-9fba188937e9">
      <Text>Thank you, I’ll be down in a moment.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="72fcb4ee-f530-4cc6-a549-aedd1dcbb7c2">
      <Text>Footsteps fade.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c4030f69-9986-4c29-833d-e652c0a27efa">
      <Text>R&amp;W make deep eye contact.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="56" Type="Scene Heading" id="57a80897-9aab-4db6-9928-6ee5d078aca3">
      <SceneProperties Length="6 2/8" Page="69" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIERIST">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="f944df11-9634-4b0d-9789-d56bab53dd89"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="ff7627c4-0e85-483c-a577-e751794c5bab"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NEYELA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="c51cfb74-9e2d-4b0e-8b06-4c364b7449c4"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="14bbbfd3-bb5b-4870-a918-4eaab2634c19"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Dining room </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="acf6741d-eeb7-4733-8423-892b16bf528b">
      <Text>R&amp;W arrive together and sit down in their same seats. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7cfa33be-b1fc-4ff0-8d30-ee804e377fe0">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f7f1b85c-f704-433e-a54d-b007423f2d45">
      <Text>I hope you guys had fun today.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ebeb22d5-61aa-47f4-b3f0-d7d077d3134a">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="39b645e9-ec20-4f2c-91f8-c64c13d69450">
      <Text>It was nice; the garden is beautiful!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f492a929-66d4-4238-8c32-e29af0fd6207">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">neYELA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="530ca545-d9be-4b51-86af-d74f7d4e6ab6">
      <Text>It took a lot of time to cultivate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8d98c0de-0bf0-4be0-830b-f93b7e3a7446">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e176a382-fe45-45cf-83e2-5cce9b91a0b8">
      <Text>You should be proud of it!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4e1b1e1e-928e-4c6c-86ec-2bbfe0587646">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NEYELA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b7eada91-712b-427c-84ef-902c6518902a">
      <Text>Thank you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4734b4b1-c172-43c9-b883-9366ab1e98fe">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a6fe6720-7c28-4d79-8591-391216868530">
      <Text>After tonight, we will have to be off, though.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aca7c507-f213-4924-a194-daa5adf214df">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TieRIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7ef0181f-48e1-4bb4-b091-3e914fc2d1d3">
      <Text>Oh, why’s that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6637a13c-68fe-468b-a418-f1a8b6753cc9">
      <Text>WeNDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ed7cc18c-c60c-4ebc-b913-e94e1bd52017">
      <Text>We don’t want to intrude on the hospitality.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c88d8939-7660-468d-b9de-c81edfd3eebb">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="50d71616-965d-40ba-92e9-32596d43c8e7">
      <Text>Pfft, don’t worry about it! You two are free to stay here as long as you’d like.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d289755e-3cfb-4031-8fd7-e8646b006408">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="718093e7-363f-4a95-94e2-d5974040cf32">
      <Text>Thank you, but we really don’t want to bother you guys like that.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eee278cf-359e-41cf-bb29-3aa841e8747f">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8c03a3a5-6d1e-43f6-86e6-d84e670d4662">
      <Text>Suit yourself, though I think someone here might be getting quite comfortable.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f9d86912-fa6a-4f44-b93c-50f98b1c375c">
      <Text>Wendy shoots Rowan a look; Rowan subtly shrugs her shoulders.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e01f19c0-f7b5-4809-8f31-8a461fc87e59">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9e2697bc-8fcd-4bc2-b05c-64b180504cb6">
      <Text>What’s that supposed to mean?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ff70f219-22cf-416c-8d36-8c31faefedc3">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="035d55c8-0545-4887-96e9-21e67e346dfa">
      <Text>Well, after today, I think Rowan here might be wanting to get back at me for what happened earlier?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="45f94b64-1c4c-419f-978c-fdc07d68cdf2">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="72bec9a2-89c8-41df-8d8a-4461d59510dc">
      <Text>What happened earlier?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6c5ee3e6-ed06-4a6b-bd5d-307f9d211872">
      <Text>RoWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca0f8ea0-527c-40c8-8835-e8dc75d159eb">
      <Text>Our workout got competitive, that’s all.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="53f9570b-5bea-4e08-acc7-7afedd4ccf66">
      <Text>Wendy huffs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cd5e957c-f724-4d88-87fd-c33ea45c89c0">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TierIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5ac463f4-0e3c-4a21-a4fa-5eaa1dab697e">
      <Text>You seemed pretty keen on continuing your talks with </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text> too. Don’t you like the fact that she’s able to actually respond to what you have to say?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="63b411f6-66ee-4faf-a3f9-0860cccf170a">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="378cfb79-05df-48aa-9e65-7dd32990a119">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9efd0bba-8abd-4689-b4ce-0f6310caa6a2">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="410b4104-2196-4da0-8315-b98baa01fed2">
      <Text>Well, Rowan seems pretty stoic and</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="79b666e5-5297-4873-9c67-3ba1ac262fad">
      <Text>Wendy stands up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="73a6b264-0aaf-4556-b9b1-c246f80a3e1f">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a88edd22-ba74-4da8-9ae5-c45d230df5ac">
      <Text>What about it?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3baf2a4b-d84a-4ee4-8241-16c7426f85a2">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="abbe87b6-9644-408b-be61-4eb8f3afeb14">
      <Text>Calm down, I’m not trying to ruffle any feathers. I’m just commenting on what we saw today.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3fc4f537-c909-47f7-a2c3-15c7e9f0bf93">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="92a74dff-6d48-4949-b0bc-ffcff19e297b">
      <Text>What did you see?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dc4f252d-2c61-4e80-b95a-6c0da3836217">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c21d6b2c-0a67-450f-a82e-cd088e1c1e0f">
      <Text>I saw two people who I thought were together.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ebea9fa7-80dc-45e5-ac0e-af63ee2d9bc2">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c7c569b1-5f03-49c5-98c2-4e78eeed7380">
      <Text>What does that even mean?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7e703c55-e423-4da9-bf20-aae0710caa29">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b72dd634-9b8e-4f79-b5c8-51f25d8a17cf">
      <Text>Clearly two friends that</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="de795bc8-ecbd-4437-87dc-bc3a3770adce">
      <Text>Wendy whistles, wisps appear around her, and several fly away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dd7ec48a-b682-45cf-8ea4-973245a0cecd">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="61dc0761-bfdd-43fb-b0af-133731088646">
      <Text>Say that again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b1d3afa-d8ab-4a5a-9f77-98aab45232a8">
      <Text>The wisps return with her guitar.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b7f56204-322b-4d87-bd15-0f51e0fc2029">
      <Text>Rowan stares at Wendy</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> aroused.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6035114e-dc83-4c62-8518-7a9676f5eaba">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f587982c-2037-42ec-89ba-c9c694d6f9a1">
      <Text>Clearly...two...friends.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2d90068b-4483-43de-a013-094ac2c5ab87">
      <Text>Wendy strums; a flurry of wisps barrage him, his hands glow teal, and he stares, deftly blocking the wisps.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="61ca85e5-1f2a-472c-b66c-eb3f7608bd85">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela’s</Text>
      <Text> eyes turn jade, and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist’s</Text>
      <Text> body becomes covered in hard jade light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a8b0710c-3edc-4f7a-81da-5dadee10fe20">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4938cca7-bcc2-42d9-9b87-792d5467355b">
      <Text>You two don’t know fucking shit about us! One afternoon of conversation and you think you know us? You know what? I’m not even gonna say anymore, I’m gonna kill you!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6f742e4b-da0a-4340-9e4e-6d7cb0666f7a">
      <Text>Rowan stands, smirks, and leaps over to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text>, her eyes &amp; veins already deep crimson, with wisps wrapped around them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4ce57e20-0951-44c4-a124-f447f2d707e1">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> laughs as he continues to take the beatings, cuts and bruises forming all over his body.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="51f18d9b-bae7-4fd1-8d41-a52d4db0877f">
      <Text>The chair collapses, and Rowan continues.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6424d85c-5d1d-4b63-b9ff-7ae9d3acf423">
      <Text>Rowan stands up and walks over to Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="078efd97-315a-4fb2-bd84-ed72586f7849">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9c1e8e85-d0ec-4bdc-aed3-abd517f75f59">
      <Text>Let’s go.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="937ec6d0-f2cd-4907-99c6-189681bb6699">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> stands up, looking undamaged.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b0f781d6-1851-42ba-87d4-1761ec644ca8">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c5f9d291-4544-4d15-97ae-57283b9a3199">
      <Text>What the fuck!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3a457eeb-6293-40f6-aefd-085c3eae5296">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6fcf8ef4-79e1-4f5c-a69d-1e2c13b70e28">
      <Text>You guys have your powers; we have ours.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b9850f2e-659f-4df9-bb78-8fbea8d94406">
      <Text>Rowan turns.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c3517057-ce3a-4f5e-9e4b-c685e91e3cd9">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="171a5471-0879-49a4-a35f-1a2b92d06447">
      <Text>And what are they?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6a79f45e-1d73-44de-a4c8-097d8672f981">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NeyELA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0379d913-be3e-435b-b720-39c25b1c42d3">
      <Text>I heal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="25421acd-8d86-43b3-af52-8663262b87dc">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TierIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c1d52cab-8b4a-4140-ae33-35687822712c">
      <Text>I shield.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9ef40fa7-e738-4ecd-b072-6ef0fdc1eff6">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> takes a stance; Rowan does too. Wendy starts to play Flamenco, and the wisp</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>arms form on Rowan’s torso.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="27c9f137-5afb-4389-83ad-5b74b231ac5c">
      <Text>Rowan charges toward </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text>, grabs him and busts him through a wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="19580b39-60ee-4f28-b5dc-eac531adc352">
      <Text>She tosses him against another wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7ee279f2-5272-473c-b87d-1c93b8b0593f">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4fcde812-98c8-4a66-9ecf-6e8cd557bc0e">
      <Text>Heal and shield that bitch!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c597509d-76d7-46a4-ae0f-4a8eec276633">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> emerges from the wall again, unfazed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d3120ac8-a808-486b-ad16-3997fbea86dc">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d60a9316-24f8-459b-a0e5-3b7ff8467717">
      <Text>I can do this all day.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e77a1db8-dbe3-4ac5-b6e3-3e47d55a98d8">
      <Text>Rowan charges and throws him up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e77a1db8-dbe3-4ac5-b6e3-3e47d55a98d8">
      <Text>He crashes through the ceiling into Rowan’s room above. When he falls back down, Rowan punches him with three fists through another wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c09f0ee9-57b1-470b-8462-61b3280d92aa">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d3e5a8a8-a747-43b1-b028-2744c8924689">
      <Text>If you can’t die, then I’ll bury you alive!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a48751a5-1786-44bd-95b0-d6e396aa760a">
      <Text>Wendy tries to get the wisps through </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist’s</Text>
      <Text> shield wrapped around </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0a63a180-44ee-46a6-b36f-49825ef0bdcd">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NeyelA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bda40256-9734-4a75-a48f-cfad9fc541fb">
      <Text>By the way, if you manage to survive this, Mihai wants to see you two.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7d7bbb26-3675-4cd0-97d7-5edaa840e93d">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b6877922-7e0e-4d65-98e2-2af3c95a9d74">
      <Text>Why’s that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3f392328-1dbe-4a3d-8589-337a890fbe7f">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NEYELA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5148af3b-9eab-411e-9f37-89ab36458004">
      <Text>A powerful man wants powerful friends.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ae150926-15a5-4e09-a3a1-d5214293e001">
      <Text>Wendy’s face grows stern; she changes her tune, and the wisps embed as sigils around her body, making the others larger.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="affe81ea-ab68-4377-a516-9f61e02cc95d">
      <Text>The ones on Rowan merge into oversized ethereal arms.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4460e608-d814-4c7e-b300-665fd0a1c8b7">
      <Text>Rowan charges </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> through another wall, carrying him while beating him as the first floor is demolished.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b61780e5-8dde-46e1-9a7e-4e506bfc8c8c">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text> walks up to Wendy and places a hand on her shoulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="741fd872-0318-4894-94f3-7ee690a06011">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NeyelA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6f91dc80-5e38-4c3a-9e85-d2887f7b0d19">
      <Text>You shouldn’t be with her; she’s never going to open up to you the way you hope she will one day.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d20f6d78-8c11-4103-9892-c3b10c5e73b6">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ed32a30e-e8b8-4120-9e4d-ef658e91c152">
      <Text>Shut up!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="806c055e-79a3-4345-80bd-5a346f73967d">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NEYELA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c78caddc-5afc-4fd7-87a1-f8a9c71c84c7">
      <Text>She’s just going to continue to use you, just like that town did. You’re her ‘hired muscle.’ Someone to keep around so she doesn’t feel alone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c220e9cd-975b-4cf7-a1e0-d0d95355988c">
      <Text>Wendy’s playing gets faster. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text> grabs Wendy’s hand, then covers Wendy’s mouth, blowing her back with a teal pulse. Wendy crashes through the wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="142b1f34-4cfa-4ef8-8715-17a60a613f60">
      <Text>Rowan hears it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="87da8d65-6c07-4a71-bbb7-2be639667055">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d99445ce-f484-4ea9-b351-a696e32e0d7e">
      <Text>Wendy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="aa0b9347-8c7f-4578-a7fd-adfe8ce6796f">
      <Text>She rushes back to the dining room and sees Wendy struggling to get back up. The arms and gauntlets fade as </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> grabs her from behind, restricting her movement.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="aa0b9347-8c7f-4578-a7fd-adfe8ce6796f">
      <Text>Teal energy wraps around her wrists like handcuffs, and she’s brought to her knees. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text> uses the jade energy to grab onto Wendy’s face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="aa0b9347-8c7f-4578-a7fd-adfe8ce6796f">
      <Text>The jade brightens and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> forces Rowan to watch Wendy go unconscious.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d6135c36-823a-402b-9f4b-b68ebd65d7fc">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> leans down to Rowan’s ear.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="07e0c987-e069-4987-917a-0ce93fa90022">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TierIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="c5f491a4-ef43-428e-b977-2d36191718f0">
      <Text>(Whispering)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="efaccf8c-b48c-43c0-91f2-f1412cc6c694">
      <Text>If only you could have gotten that last rep out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="48437ce0-73ef-4196-bc47-2593d784f1a7">
      <Text>Rowan’s skin turns translucent pale; deep crimson smoke flows from her eyes. She breaks the cuffs and stands up, slowly pushing back against </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist’s</Text>
      <Text> hand, turning around and grabbing it, breaking it instantly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="23542582-77f2-4ab5-b7cf-e1f5a50d6a79">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> screams in pain.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="44ab07cb-237e-4621-96e5-a73bcb4d4d63">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="af794b43-325e-469e-bde8-4a0b75fdc615">
      <Text>Looks like you were right about limits.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="270f5082-a0d4-4c53-8dc1-b7fdec5b9e7a">
      <Text>She turns to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text> and leaps towards her across the dining room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3afcfddc-6f1c-4a88-a76a-cb1e9ac6f7e5">
      <Text>They both crash through the wall; the house groans.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="149cd9f9-de06-4d34-a6be-1228e891c4c3">
      <Text>Rowan picks up </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text> and throws her through another wall. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> runs into the room with a gun, pointing it at Rowan’s head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d7dc3d43-f3b1-4649-a8d9-cdda60fd645e">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIERIST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d188cb5b-4753-4a30-a876-7ff6804fff15">
      <Text>You may be stronger, but still not stronger than a bullet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="865b806c-960f-4c0d-b4d8-195ea9a27146">
      <Text>Rowan stands still, unfazed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d5908eca-1c06-47bd-b17d-30150c4502ff">
      <Text>Wisps wrap around </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist’s</Text>
      <Text> arm, pulling it up as he pulls the trigger. The gunshot pierces Wendy’s bed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="27bfddd2-982d-40f0-9adb-44ce564ecbd4">
      <Text>The wisps return to Rowan. She takes </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> and tosses him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="27bfddd2-982d-40f0-9adb-44ce564ecbd4">
      <Text>Wisps wrap around Rowan’s legs, and she leaps, crashing through the floor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="27bfddd2-982d-40f0-9adb-44ce564ecbd4">
      <Text>She grabs </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> in midair. They land on the bed, breaking it in half. She charges him through the brick wall into the bathroom.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9761915c-147b-4b6c-9e3f-93c78e20c530">
      <Text>Rowan grabs him by the face and smashes him into the ground until it gives way, and they fall back into the dining room. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f1ddb12b-c6e4-45cd-b4fe-26c66ffa8cdd">
      <Text>She throws him through the last walls standing, and he tumbles into the gym.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e98c0411-02eb-4e87-840d-dba27e45cb63">
      <Text>Rowan walks inside, grabs a lifting machine and throws it at him; it launches him against the wall and shatters the mirror.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="258c4605-eb71-4521-8271-1ad238b65096">
      <Text>She grabs multiple sets of dumbbells and beats him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="258c4605-eb71-4521-8271-1ad238b65096">
      <Text>Wendy steps into the room, her music at its most intense.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9474fd17-0d16-4bce-86ab-67924052553d">
      <Text>She breaks the dumbbells on him and picks him up, leaping and busting him through another wall. The ceiling collapses in on the gym, and Wendy quickly shields herself with the wisps.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4d100ff4-89f7-4a80-bc3b-db277637f0d1">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text> tries to attack Wendy, but she turns and uses the wisps to quickly punch through her as the teal shield dissipates.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b10c148c-b2d7-49f6-baee-f58eb1c4f228">
      <Text>Neyela heals rapidly as the wisps punch through in a cacophonous barrage.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b10c148c-b2d7-49f6-baee-f58eb1c4f228">
      <Text>Wisps begin punching through the ceiling, working quickly to collapse the floor onto </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eee56634-b8e6-45ba-8156-fccce8179340">
      <Text>Rowan takes </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tierist</Text>
      <Text> and rips his arm off, beating him with it and pushing him through the roof, then down into Rowan’s room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eee56634-b8e6-45ba-8156-fccce8179340">
      <Text>She lifts her bed and beats him with it until he’s unrecognizable; they crash through the floor and see Wendy beating </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Neyela</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="823fb6e7-cc70-4dc4-ad9e-c188b168eead">
      <Text>Rowan lifts Neyela and rips her in half at the waist. Wendy is revealed behind her, and they work together to take down the rest of the mansion quickly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2f7e06a6-1e07-4bd1-a00f-b87def2ee651">
      <Text>As it collapses around them, everything goes still before Rowan leaps from the rubble with an arm around Wendy, crashing through the garage.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2f7e06a6-1e07-4bd1-a00f-b87def2ee651">
      <Text>Rowan starts the car and drives off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="c59b336a-bc54-4c73-a39b-3382731badc9">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="57" Type="Scene Heading" id="3e18130c-b331-438b-89ed-8e3f5c0e1781">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="76" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="7f12a5b1-6402-412e-a55a-e3e34dcebac3">
      <Text>EPISODE 9</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="0f53034f-3378-42b3-9497-34e924322044">
      <Text>TITLE CARD:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="e5833ab0-f29c-4c1c-9cdf-7374f7d81935">
      <Text>The Art of Subconscious Illusion </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">IX</Text>
      <Text> (Name: Black letters with glowing Pastel Blue outline/Numerals: Deep Crimson)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="d82f609c-9711-4b51-9e48-281e33adac43">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="58" Type="Scene Heading" id="9947629b-ecaa-4769-9112-a5927e588cc0">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="77" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WISP">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="327dc4b8-bd20-44ca-89da-2690d6fd5a8f"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="26d6d11c-4a94-4e4c-8402-31a2692c46b4"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT./EXT. BUGGY </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> AfteRNOON</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="df9fc56b-2b1e-45b3-9c01-51a0823d5970">
      <Text>Rowan drives while Wendy plays her guitar. A wisp hovers between them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1ebd59a8-0b2e-487a-b6f6-de0990838148">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="dfbf9eec-b00b-435d-87ae-a53d8ac67559">
      <Text>(Pulsing Morse Code)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b66f9f03-4fff-4917-9e19-3a5ab3dfdab1">
      <Text>What's got you looking like that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="79b6fe86-89c0-426f-8557-074842b99d7e">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="e7862546-040b-49f5-8a7d-0796ee5bae18">
      <Text>(Whistling)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fb742050-1649-465a-ac03-3760da2fe3ac">
      <Text>Nothing, I'm just passing time till we're out of this ridge.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="925fd040-2ae7-44b8-bf28-82cefff3855d">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="08fa80e8-4801-46ac-8e1d-ec1163859afc">
      <Text>I'm literally you; don't lie to yourself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3e4a3c19-c278-4d4c-8a64-51f5079af33d">
      <Text>The buggy’s drone fills the silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1f0d0162-7e71-4b6e-9213-d837eb07e142">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8e3a012d-3d8e-41c2-b1f4-ff5e2be1252d">
      <Text>Shut up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="35c8de55-2f3f-4367-83a8-6cd801a896d9">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="127ebea7-a144-485a-aa79-a7e0dfb1d1ea">
      <Text>Start talking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="22a9d2c6-3293-496b-ba49-9652567e9484">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3642437f-a9fe-4fe2-a39f-465a411b6cca">
      <Text>It's just that I'm worried about Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3e11cf26-5b49-4a79-9a26-8ead9597af6c">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="de5835ec-501e-439a-bfb5-232b052ab609">
      <Text>Eh, she's a strong girl. One fight isn't going to kill her. You could've seen better days yourself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8203515d-5142-4b32-bf49-b255c525fc1e">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="59f93d9e-0a67-4a84-ab0d-705c340493ab">
      <Text>Oh hush, that's not what I meant.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9e355f4d-be8f-47bf-9de5-f922766405e7">
      <Text>The wisp "stares" for a long beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="996986a2-c962-4e44-bf27-0baac7d29db0">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3b769ff7-1050-453b-bcf6-c1f043ed3580">
      <Text>Oh, this again. Look. Why don't you talk to me about it?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fb870262-a29a-44fb-99ad-9dac67ccf139">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="23f282df-6c35-4e26-a696-b49e52e9b17d">
      <Text>Because do you know how embarrassing that would be? "Hey Rowan, I know you're this big, sexy, muscular girl, but, like, do you like me?" I'm not doing that!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6266977d-8c3b-4a33-961b-e1e954a180de">
      <Text>WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9222b979-e3ad-4d9b-b911-a30bbb033bed">
      <Text>If you won't, then I will.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f635e960-b401-4611-bb13-4a11262cdbb0">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5d796672-0729-41a6-8447-00630ff7a362">
      <Text>No!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4f0183c7-037b-407e-8e49-d52d80a1826b">
      <Text>The wisp plunges into Rowan's mind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="f1773203-b6dc-47fb-a591-d39d26f13edb">
      <Text>RIPPLE CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="59" Type="Scene Heading" id="fcd1abe1-65b3-4c58-8bca-bfbf364ecf72">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 6/8" Page="78" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="YOUNG GIRL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="10cc9f22-05ad-4331-a577-f364bf2cf479"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY'S DAD">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="613fc736-2d95-436c-bc18-c2dd54eb67c8"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="6484df13-ad7f-4f12-b18a-7ff1114d75b7"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="YOUNG ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="ecb99ae7-620f-4cdf-b133-213873ac1818"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TOWN GUARD">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="7286058a-2086-4926-9756-718b2a635a82"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. WENDY'S CHILDHOOD HOME </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> FLASHBACK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d7306e07-3f9b-45c5-82c8-573548cbb5fc">
      <Text>Wendy's dad bursts through the door, slams it shut and locks it. He turns around and hustles to pick up Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="585579ec-fc6e-4a53-b50d-bb4d748c4ebd">
      <Text>Loud banging on the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="edf2d16b-c18c-4d3f-80fe-c09d0cb1962e">
      <Text>YOUNG GIRL (O.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="f13d13e0-5584-40d2-bfcd-6fb27217585d">
      <Text>(Guttural)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="69d6b2f6-4550-4fdb-87c6-1f704b10f434">
      <Text>Open the fucking door, shithead, mommy's looking for her big strong daddy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e091418f-93b5-4226-9c70-566f48278703">
      <Text>The shriek of a woman and the sound of breaking bones and crushed organs ring through the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e46fcf24-1195-4cc6-aec2-006823a49555">
      <Text>WENDY'S DAD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6c826a8a-4478-491c-9a09-5f28e5953df8">
      <Text>Sweetie, get Daddy's gun. It's underneath the bed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b17a1dc1-d4a6-491d-bd52-5233fddb1582">
      <Text>Loud banging on the door rattles the room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9c49ff84-74ea-4a2b-82e5-fec36fb51890">
      <Text>Wendy returns with an M1 Garand, weeping.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b0392a31-3c1b-48ff-8a7c-64868b829b58">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="edc51856-88a5-44ed-a492-2f38d7876f69">
      <Text>(Whispering)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9883f35a-cb9a-4feb-9e3b-ff07bb672b40">
      <Text>What's going on, daddy?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="74d7b71c-853c-4313-89be-194ca0c57ff8">
      <Text>Wendy's dad gestures for her to bring it to him; she presents it with extreme care.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="574eb388-403b-4e6e-93ce-8f3ab6ec2107">
      <Text>Wendy's dad checks the chamber; three bullets.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8160908c-16b0-4fce-b5fc-d742c6c0ae95">
      <Text>WENDY'S DAD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="558ef3ce-6554-4d47-acef-1fba8e44df3e">
      <Text>Nothing, sweetheart.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="772627ea-cc49-460f-b2a0-f1fe5234ec02">
      <Text>He pulls her head in, kissing her forehead. He smiles at her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a4c776b2-9108-4d46-b220-e47344baee82">
      <Text>Silence. Footsteps fade. The silhouette of a young girl appears through a window on the other side of the room, next to the bed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="364b9a25-b77b-4fe8-a0e8-aeaeb65dc376">
      <Text>The girl sniffs hard and loud.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fec0e774-94d4-4578-a3ac-1e768fb8e827">
      <Text>She turns to the window.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5861789a-e3bb-4f64-abaf-c666bf584a6d">
      <Text>YOUNG GIRL (O.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b532f68d-d290-480c-b3d4-9d2ff6a5a077">
      <Text>Found you!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e2d1bd94-8500-40dd-aa68-695f55266950">
      <Text>Young Rowan, pale translucent skin, talons for nails on her hands and feet, wild spiky white hair, crimson eyes and veins, bursts through the window above Wendy. She lands right in front of Wendy; her long, sharp tongue slithers out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a2a8defc-00a7-4535-9f3e-935897c5ba8d">
      <Text>WENDY'S DAD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9bc64834-13af-4055-af5a-79d71f4efa3c">
      <Text>Wendy, duck!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5712cbb8-2d77-4eed-ad01-4ee1b289d216">
      <Text>He aims for Rowan's head and fires. Rowan phases to the side as he pulls.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8c2f494a-cd7c-4889-acec-bf1aad454729">
      <Text>He retrains his aim on Rowan and fires, another swift dodge, closer this time.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dba4dd16-010d-4a11-bf8f-aaf1a876bcaf">
      <Text>A final shot; the iconic Garand clink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5fce4213-3109-43a6-a261-799dbdae0d65">
      <Text>A beat of realization.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fc841b33-d87a-425a-956e-476181f88f10">
      <Text>YOUNG ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a34e3f9d-df7c-4a72-a9d0-753ba80d1a46">
      <Text>Finally!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8302e1a4-475e-4e36-8e6e-876f2f416aba">
      <Text>Rowan bounds over Wendy's crouched body and lands right on top of Wendy's Dad and starts scratching and ripping him apart. Wendy watches in horror.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cb526ec3-65e1-4873-a9a2-d081f721dbad">
      <Text>YOUNG ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dfd61522-83ca-4436-abe9-b0d31c5188aa">
      <Text>Next time, don't be so mean to such a lonely girl, bitch!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e0b93aac-8cb1-44a7-8d2f-405c5fafaf50">
      <Text>Rowan snaps his neck. Wendy begins crying uncontrollably.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c388b224-6842-4106-9c6c-d1144f4179d9">
      <Text>Rowan snaps her head around.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="14fe6fc1-21d6-480a-bfd8-34f9c75a60fc">
      <Text>She crawls towards Wendy, and primes a swing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1d81664e-fe0d-4527-bdbd-901e9d76d3a1">
      <Text>TOWN GUARD (O.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fa0579ac-5427-4062-ac89-1c34a4f4be02">
      <Text>Where are you, little brat!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="56ae276a-757f-4f7d-8231-f52c0792c30b">
      <Text>Rowan hesitates, then leaps through the broken window. Gunshots reverberate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d6495e09-4158-420e-a6b0-b2eca0047cbe">
      <Text>Wendy scrambles over her father's corpse, hugging it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="4bc2edb7-5e63-4e7d-a337-a3c6d6c11c5a">
      <Text>MATCH CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="60" Type="Scene Heading" id="184e3088-1af3-44d1-b6d0-0ef56cc73a7e">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="80" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT./EXT. BUGGY </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="beb569c1-39cd-478c-b819-271e75ba9b63">
      <Text>The wisp, now a black paisley with pastel blue patterns, emerges from Rowan's head and fades.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="061f30ec-2df7-433f-b561-af2264f10f80">
      <Text>The sigil within the acoustic hole of Wendy’s guitar fades to black with a pastel blue glow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b977af66-b27e-4f9d-a1c6-2becbd1ff679">
      <Text>Wendy’s face drops as the music stops and she stares out into the ridge with a blank face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="61" Type="Transition" id="9b97e57e-743a-400b-8eae-eaf2da711252">
      <Text>FADE TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="7daf2b26-1752-44d6-a2c3-72972d84f3b7">
      <Text>EPISODE 10</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="0d756a8b-2bff-42ac-88ac-1fa8116c2b92">
      <Text>TITLE CARD:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="548b9a57-5209-4da5-b548-a61b5883bdbf">
      <Text>Who is like God? The Victor of Peoples (White letters)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="3948af25-e45e-498b-9981-9ea836892a8a">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="61" Type="Scene Heading" id="111f85bd-4bef-4ea3-873e-6c99ba934781">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="81" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GUARD 1">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="12a132c4-70b7-4c22-943d-df4a3ec7f496"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="7c4772f5-13a5-4e75-ba82-0175e8c88c1b"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GUARD 2">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="69ba184b-c22c-4f7b-9604-d0bde7df8e23"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Niculescu CASTLE </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> Later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="81dd021e-a829-445b-ae21-adf847f2a90e">
      <Text>Rowan stops the buggy outside the castle; two guards approach.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="769a4703-e0d2-475a-aa31-1e7d613a9eb8">
      <Text>Rowan gets out and leans against the frame. Wendy remains still.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="02d94421-087b-4bc4-8bde-ec75f210081a">
      <Text>Guard 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0e995bbb-1358-4de8-9c9d-60637770cf4d">
      <Text>State your business.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4f7c92ec-1d36-456a-ab4a-9992db92146b">
      <Text>RowAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2393fd87-62dc-4851-9240-1db3bc63b90b">
      <Text>Mihai Niculescu.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3b5eb2a6-1383-4198-b101-de2b73ab9607">
      <Text>The guards look at each other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4073bdd7-2109-44b8-b2de-27400557b6ca">
      <Text>Guard 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9511d227-142e-40f5-ae1c-9225e0fde84a">
      <Text>What about him?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3ccc7e3a-c649-4534-9321-9d226c91c1c5">
      <Text>RoWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d627e412-33c6-40d6-8fde-e36676528d9e">
      <Text>He wants to see us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8081b575-6da4-429c-bc21-05c8da460eaf">
      <Text>One guard nods to the other and leaves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="56eee492-2d8f-47e5-844d-7d399b435674">
      <Text>GuARD 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="76aad111-d555-4fb4-8e0e-113679ed271e">
      <Text>Wait here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="90193f85-0b1d-4079-8944-e39a7cb79c70">
      <Text>The gate opens and the second guard disappears inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8081b575-6da4-429c-bc21-05c8da460eaf">
      <Text>Rowan turns to Wendy; Rowan’s face softens.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="adda59de-c981-440a-89f7-35936e47b6be">
      <Text>A few beats of silence pass as Rowan turns back to the guard.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="648fbad7-9dd3-46fc-8045-97423e2b6c5d">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="994f7324-922c-4d38-8fe9-9ea80b4606bb">
      <Text>What’s up with the getup?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="80f3ba7c-900c-4642-8819-cb7d37c9c99a">
      <Text>GUARD 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7475255f-de41-4618-826f-ebbdf3dc01c4">
      <Text>Just what Mihai wants.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2441115f-dce3-4a10-923a-3fd53569716a">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9db5f3d5-6de6-4abc-8da4-3dd921626490">
      <Text>Hmm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="34ae9f7c-10dc-47a4-a6ed-8aad8d74f19b">
      <Text>The second guard emerges from within and waves them in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5807a7f5-13ca-4f88-a391-4df6688fc681">
      <Text>Rowan exhales.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d6ab6879-ae31-4564-a3ae-9c9ae2cf8695">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a08d7401-7d89-43d5-81b6-e5a8a2eb3a00">
      <Text>Ready, Wendy?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6aec4f05-d18b-4445-bdd5-12033777abb4">
      <Text>Wendy nods slightly and steps out of the buggy, slinging the guitar back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="91423363-1fa0-4d74-a4b9-a9b9c0ddf210">
      <Text>They enter. Rowan looks to Wendy, who’s looking straight ahead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="62" Type="Scene Heading" id="2d80332d-c20d-42c7-b17e-7a4fc6aa1602">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="82" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. NICULESCU CASTLE </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> conTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e54cf390-cac8-478b-961c-3d81b99e1b5a">
      <Text>R&amp;W are escorted down the hall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="817233a2-05c3-4c2b-bd2e-9df84ca9f260">
      <Text>Another pair of guards opens the doors to the throne room as they pass through.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="63" Type="Scene Heading" id="aae3761a-cc8c-47c6-aa4a-5bec5573ffbc">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="82" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MIHAI NICULESCU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="77da09da-279f-4218-bebd-9da0278dcf1a"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="844149e0-0856-4989-a243-a2a71b6d9a32"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. THRONE ROOM </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f32117a9-b8f0-4288-8119-3815320f6d39">
      <Text>Mihai Niculescu sits on his throne, clad in highly detailed garments: a white straw clop hat, a white silk tunic with black fractal detailing, a white vest with black paisley tapestry, white trousers and a pair of white poulaines a foot long with black bottoms.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3921a276-693a-460e-8226-1db8103ea35e">
      <Text>He sits, draped across the throne, legs crossed, tapping his foot.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d228d03a-007e-4251-b074-cbfc115a7733">
      <Text>R&amp;W march right up to the throne. Mihai raises his palm sharply, and they stop moving. Rowan crosses her arms and takes a toe</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>tapping stance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dc6580db-64b4-4235-a2b2-4da6562d6874">
      <Text>He lowers his hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a4edb013-4f39-47b1-9075-38c43af6eea8">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6a2fbedc-48f3-430f-a8a3-6945adc16cd2">
      <Text>Thank you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2d6125d6-3a56-4014-8cf5-a3dd0d3249ea">
      <Text>He examines them for a beat, then walks toward them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f8f1c6ee-e55c-4a5e-90fd-91f5bc5574d8">
      <Text>Mihai Niculescu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e6579315-6c1e-4e02-ad68-f02bada7776b">
      <Text>First, an introduction. I am Mihai Niculescu.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="db9e397f-fb4c-41d6-a351-e2f6cb03c096">
      <Text>He bows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7cdb9f79-0b7f-4fe6-8f53-db065198f2a9">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="04281d3a-217a-412c-b7b0-4bd1e3480a19">
      <Text>You two must be Rowan and Wendy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7abfb2e5-84eb-4ef6-a001-d335c2683ec3">
      <Text>He walks around them, examining them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="64c7ce06-acea-4b8c-a70f-a950de2121e9">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fd5a4c6c-90e7-409b-8f3e-f46c9da828ce">
      <Text>I didn't think you two would show up!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9ce803e0-5d4b-49bf-8387-dc2ff916db2d">
      <Text>He stops in front of them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0fba2a76-3649-4dff-87a8-a51025f4b547">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e6f44cf0-0b33-4030-9e52-aa256a5c86d2">
      <Text>What do you want?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="14b7fdf1-a45f-4bb6-8640-b42be1c80869">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="52dcb2a5-08c3-472b-a9bd-734b0ec6e09b">
      <Text>Stop trying to kill us!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8c0ee79f-aab7-4f46-b8a4-a719b4cc8838">
      <Text>MiHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dc58bc39-ca32-467f-a111-3f60bd7b2f40">
      <Text>I can do you one better: how about I get rid of the powers? Turn everyone back to normal?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="374ea640-6125-400c-98c1-91b697d2838a">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="488cbc67-50c7-40df-b24e-bb1078801ca7">
      <Text>Please!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="48239629-b391-4e68-939c-f1f3d8347524">
      <Text>He grins before bursting into laughter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="37d4b601-ceb4-476a-8e70-1f7b458932b0">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3bd8d62e-3629-40c1-b98b-89416a68b84a">
      <Text>Okay, okay, sorry, watch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3b9d042e-94a8-4c74-a3c1-9b4714d1ed7b">
      <Text>He raises his hands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="64" Type="Scene Heading" id="38df46ce-fc12-45e9-9899-43a6d6654eb9">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="83" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. NICULESCU CASTLE </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> SIMULTANEOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5a718d2d-2e34-4f36-8ee0-5219cfc1ec9c">
      <Text>Deep Crimson and Deep Blue black clouds begin swirling around the castle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="65" Type="Scene Heading" id="92185277-41c6-4e00-8113-5c3ea905f55b">
      <SceneProperties Length="7 5/8" Page="83" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="21b3056b-2f48-4995-a574-8b19305f82a8"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MIHAI NICULESCU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="13ea2df5-33cc-4dd5-8b4e-3310bf880d6c"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="b81d953a-ef26-4795-a0ea-2130ca7f366e"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. NICULESCU CASTLE </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> SIMULTANEOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ebedaf92-b367-4fa0-a1fe-1829f7cf9d12">
      <Text>Lightning crashes through the roof, striking both R&amp;W.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6020751f-aea7-4b0a-ae40-95aac3c3defc">
      <Text>A servant approaches Mihai with a hot dog. He takes a bite of it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7acbb804-1417-48d6-917e-bbc650a39b01">
      <Text>Rowan looks at her hands, then back to Mihai.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="527ffad8-dd25-476a-b4c0-5c9b029f3ea0">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="88fe7001-1165-461b-a756-be94a134a16e">
      <Text>Why didn’t it do anything?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1a6791ed-9c4c-48f9-9e73-bb005a3ea5bb">
      <Text>He puts a finger up as he finishes what’s in his mouth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="221035de-d383-4512-a26c-8c0a80257290">
      <Text>Mihai NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cbc2370c-e94d-4521-982b-2ac5a7863e3c">
      <Text>I lied.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d9d57a38-5927-4f7f-a842-42228b98760d">
      <Text>R&amp;W's faces grow angrier. He takes another bite.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="11eabff6-eefd-49d8-af79-91fe6e34dd9c">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="156b412c-6d58-44b4-bea3-4c181de96331">
      <Text>Did you two really think that there was something more to this? I created a storm that gave people powers!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="18761699-c8b8-448a-bf3d-7a15ed9b62ce">
      <Text>Thunder rumbles in the distance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="de790e3d-7ff6-495e-af21-632131b83946">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e620ff33-4a5f-453c-9bd3-ea1432efc7ba">
      <Text>I have everything I want now! I have power, a powerful country under my control, powerful henchmen at my side, and powerful enemies, like you two!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2e499e27-ca95-4e66-bc34-9c1312404088">
      <Text>Rowan glances at Wendy, who’s staring at Mihai. Mihai takes another bite.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1dc58d4b-a238-4422-b5a7-a324a82376b5">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2e49f8d1-5587-4a50-979e-a3b5c327ac9c">
      <Text>If you guys think that I was ever going to stop, you were wrong. I love this! I love that it got out of control, I love that it caused chaos, I love that it made you two!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f45db880-428d-4018-b265-0a4078581458">
      <Text>The thunder rolls.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="06ab323c-56da-49d4-9373-a48f0738d740">
      <Text>Mihai walks back to the throne and sits down, finishing the dog.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3dea17f4-2cd0-4148-925c-b43fbb80426c">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6dbbc961-ba00-46c1-abe0-0c7a2c17e2c6">
      <Text>Do you realize how many people have died from your stupid fucking experiment?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9c870ae0-1955-4b7e-a490-52fde9360419">
      <Text>Rowan's veins and pupils are now deep crimson.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="93e527be-3c60-4656-9aa5-adecbc9f34e4">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f702a9e0-a765-434d-9995-efc89a186bb6">
      <Text>Oh, thousands, I'm sure, but that's fine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b73b559-1aec-4092-accd-07e2c819be12">
      <Text>Rowan steps towards the throne.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b08063a5-5812-4e8a-9f26-0853005f58c6">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="316bbbcd-96c2-4378-8973-87bc1516dd86">
      <Text>Why? We lost everyone we've cared about because of this bullshit!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="78ee0a2e-bc2c-44cf-a711-b3d335be0940">
      <Text>He shrugs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ffc2a557-bbc0-4fdd-8284-7cdd0fa63ff9">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d93f2cb5-3021-4150-bbc7-c5d0659ba19c">
      <Text>Skill issue.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b8893a03-cb93-466f-963b-a33f9e84052a">
      <Text>Lightning cracks; Rowan is completely lost in anger now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c82da1d2-e3cc-4705-b967-6f80a0839943">
      <Text>Wendy equips her guitar and starts to play; the wisps create an almost obscuring circle around her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b93c04b8-3f03-418a-80e6-ee1278530642">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="73b0d66e-97ee-4ed1-b790-7907fc5393fc">
      <Text>If you really must know why before we begin...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e4f6b98a-d4b5-419a-adc6-cd0391c4d4c2">
      <Text>He cleans his hands, walks over and passes through the wisps before Wendy, gingerly holding her face up by the chin.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1ac62a5c-64d3-4743-b06a-a5e9fc493831">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="071e48db-ccc9-482d-9b29-c253b3693898">
      <Text>It was for the love of the game.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2da85349-e1fa-4bd9-9842-1794de65d296">
      <Text>Rowan stares at the ground, trying to contain rage as red lightning bolts strike into the throne room. Mihai steps back and stares, smirking; the wisps blend into a solid orb around Wendy, black with pastel blue paisley patterns.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="583f7b35-e3b3-427e-b128-1234e3f232a8">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a23dd246-7e3c-437b-bd44-722da4a0efb2">
      <Text>You worthless...heartless...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dd6d9113-78cc-4573-af67-616c78288310">
      <Text>The wisps blend into a ball, tightening around her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b4fa6e70-184b-4d70-8702-d4129a69c224">
      <Text>Mihai steps back onto the throne, awestruck and captivated by the display of power.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="76cc9526-7758-4073-9593-56afbb99d5cb">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cd40553f-ced9-468f-a451-bc61471e394b">
      <Text>Bastard!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4bd2b2fc-1153-4516-a039-1ae5a2cd9d44">
      <Text>A giant Deep Crimson lightning bolt strikes her. A bright red ball of light obscures her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e7e7e7e3-4ae6-4c05-a26a-638f092295b2">
      <Text>The black</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>and</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>white orb conforms around Wendy's body.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bfca02c1-f4ae-4638-b893-3f222790214a">
      <Text>The orb fades. Rowan's hair is swept up; her eyes radiate deep crimson smoke, and she is substantially more muscular, her Deep Crimson veins rippling across her translucent pale skin.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bfca02c1-f4ae-4638-b893-3f222790214a">
      <Text>Black seeps into Wendy’s body, dissolving the robe as it embeds itself across her body as black sigils with a pastel blue glow. Her bikini is now black with pastel blue patterns, and her eyes are black, with a pastel blue sigil for pupils. Black smoke seeps from the edges; her guitar strings are now hazy black, and the word "</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Olvido</Text>
      <Text>" is etched below the bridge. The guitar floats by her side, lightly strumming flamenco as wisps pour out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8560b2d0-1c03-4cd2-9f4e-9843c49db4e9">
      <Text>Mihai stands up, calmly, then extends a hand</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>as if to offer a dance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="44ffe834-4aa2-4baf-95f4-241e955812c4">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="45f9ad52-77ba-419e-9d0b-5971b102e4a5">
      <Text>Shall we, ladies?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="76f6f643-1e6d-426b-8c09-08f5d6fe6651">
      <Text>Rowan swings at Mihai. The guitar plays, and the largest flurry of wisps rushes toward Mihai.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a4c08ba9-4278-4bb4-97d8-6623e8cd5d35">
      <Text>Mihai vanishes; Rowan and the wisps look around for him. Wendy is already turned around; she meets his face right in front of him, and he's grinning.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="707b78b3-3c89-48f7-80d0-c8380c31da3c">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ad8fbdcd-164f-4757-910e-9ff5e58aa16c">
      <Text>You are stronger than I thought!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1907d4a6-6b21-4b0d-9960-3760ef3e8e91">
      <Text>He takes a step back, loosens himself up with a couple of hops and a neck roll, then strikes an offense pose.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c6e80a8f-4bed-41cc-87e7-0e6b6ff0d148">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="65e7128e-1b92-43dc-aefd-8286c7a93231">
      <Text>Let's dance!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7e1ec889-8c02-4adc-8bc3-b05d2176fc7a">
      <Text>He phases from their view again; Wendy’s head swivels to Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="50fae9c9-14e7-4855-a447-60eb2d41cb99">
      <Text>He appears before Rowan, socks her in the face, then disappears again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c033b632-003a-49e9-a80e-5a883dc571b1">
      <Text>Reappearing in front of Wendy, he swings, but her wisps shield the blow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ba311551-f1f3-44bb-957a-774c33b850c7">
      <Text>He continues to phase back and forth, landing hits on Rowan but getting blocked by dispersing wisp shields.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="09531449-4ed6-4a75-8af6-61b33aac81ed">
      <Text>He phases in front of his throne.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b04c9981-7688-4e44-83fd-de868fd5d8a0">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="17b7ac05-a95a-4d15-a9ee-bacbe5b2baad">
      <Text>What a shame.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ca021dbf-224c-41ec-9c7b-ae0c0b67cf7d">
      <Text>Rowan's holds her side, huffing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="773f9a1d-2ffa-4d53-85a9-bbea13e493ec">
      <Text>Mihai sits on the throne again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="657eb632-ac7b-4294-86f8-bc6e87f8334e">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="87b01356-8745-4df7-b857-57f9f40e668a">
      <Text>Tell you what. I'll hold back just enough to make it fair, and we see how far you two can push me. Deal?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b9479f5f-63ed-461f-bba3-e99b47931156">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37123773-2ac9-444a-b646-209f48ef311e">
      <Text>I don't think we have much of a choice.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fc73abf9-1f97-4a15-8d9f-de87bb2ed806">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3561ccdb-4e0c-412c-ac9a-9f98418d2bd9">
      <Text>Technically you do; it’s just that the other choice is death.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="224edbdf-f053-44bf-8172-4ec62d0da955">
      <Text>He slinks up into a different stance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a630c251-eeca-4731-8add-21604ffc7eab">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="572e3637-d5b0-4914-99fc-d25e9fb508bf">
      <Text>Which I don't think either of you wanna do right now, right?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6ee7cc41-c623-4760-bbbf-5e25cae1f395">
      <Text>They glare at him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4be79a5a-d38d-44d5-928b-36e7e7b51417">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="594d1da3-6f27-4e9c-afc0-49bbce74586f">
      <Text>Great, then let's see what you got!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="96137d89-9711-4b35-8577-10d834b38c3a">
      <Text>Rowan stands ready, then glances to Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="96137d89-9711-4b35-8577-10d834b38c3a">
      <Text>Wendy’s eyes are locked directly on Mihai’s as he smirks. The guitar plays a chord progression, and the wisps wrap around Rowan's fists.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="907bd735-e7c1-4aff-ae7b-98a9dda1dc90">
      <Text>Rowan charges at Mihai; he smiles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7681d40b-413f-446b-80df-4b11823a71ef">
      <Text>The punch lands, knocking him back and through his now</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>shattered throne.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4bb1f34f-df07-4132-a555-fdd9f4074d93">
      <Text>He crashes into the wall behind, and his guards run to his side.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6747499c-038c-4195-bb08-0ab0c9851419">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="bf07b740-e537-473c-b8bf-a1ea0769096b">
      <Text>(Dazed)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="83b3c9ef-1312-4ffe-9a24-35a3b89f04d0">
      <Text>Away!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e54d6252-8b7b-46cc-8b5b-fdd5dde03755">
      <Text>He sits up and shakes off the daze; the guards stand back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="05293d2b-d6c9-47ed-a3d5-1cb5b59698ac">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c210a84a-ec97-45db-8077-ec26bd667ed8">
      <Text>That's what I'm talking about!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fc151d51-604b-426f-9a2f-4423d15efdf0">
      <Text>He stands up, dusts himself off and walks back to the throne room's floor, laughing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3d206916-4033-44d0-8415-9da81be93bac">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="951031d9-f8e1-4590-bc1a-bf97d4ef8954">
      <Text>Again!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3f557497-acb4-4b65-b67b-e8b3be057f52">
      <Text>Rowan delivers a flurry of blows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d525d402-198d-4aa4-90d3-c0d72b56f727">
      <Text>Mihai blocks each of them gracefully; he spins through one punch, delivering his own straight to the ribcage.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8f13f59b-d63d-49fe-8521-6f11d0025fbc">
      <Text>Rowan winces and falters. Mihai then moves to swing at Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8f13f59b-d63d-49fe-8521-6f11d0025fbc">
      <Text>The guitar strums, and a shield of wisps forms in front of her, blocking the blow, but shattering the shield in a dispersal of wisps.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f34c4f87-ecea-49e4-982c-4d46e85d59d8">
      <Text>Rowan comes from behind. Mihai ducks. He punches Rowan in the gut.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b304727e-f952-47ba-a9c3-ba572b81e755">
      <Text>Rowan powers through it, delivering an even stronger wisp—powered punch to his jaw, sending him flying through the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="257f6e64-db9e-4cb0-af96-ae67e1c241f7">
      <Text>Mihai giggles maniacally on the ground. Rowan rushes on top of him and begins clobbering him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6e901f40-d7d9-4192-a412-a4c5b0462888">
      <Text>Wendy watches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3999bd66-7a8d-49ab-838e-fe06b0a07479">
      <Text>INSERT: IMPACT FRAMES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8c5cbc13-25ac-423c-b317-003237b958ac">
      <Text>FLASHBACK FRAMES FROM YOUNG ROWAN TEARING HER FATHER APART</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4cfd9d7c-2fb1-450b-b2b6-b166453d3903">
      <Text>The guitar’s music fades.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="687b0485-77f9-449d-924f-3f33a1e7965b">
      <Text>Rowan and Mihai notice the punches land softer, and the black wisps fade from her fists.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="46827012-9a2f-4f1f-b1c0-70b2c189a85a">
      <Text>Rowan stops punching and turns to see Wendy staring.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="de142c60-1365-4d89-9fed-99c08ac1767e">
      <Text>Mihai lifts Rowan off him, sets her to the side, and stands, walking to Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fc3d5949-b9dd-44f4-a9b6-68e6bd1c57c7">
      <Text>He stares deep into her eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b5ec5b37-530b-4d16-82f0-bb1f7b94a594">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0b843495-cefa-422c-89bf-4326e81495c3">
      <Text>What are you</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="515086d2-025a-4f14-8612-d44b6c9035df">
      <Text>Mihai raises a hand to Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ff3d1593-c5d2-4fc7-bff0-1568ea3ae8e6">
      <Text>He places his thumb on her temples.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="89406262-625a-41ab-83cb-6963c92729e3">
      <Text>INSERT: FLASHBACK SEQUENCE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a2445082-68bd-457c-8970-0fcee78d7fb1">
      <Text>A FLASH OF THE FRAME WITH WENDY IN THE BUGGY WITH THE WISP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Shot" id="2f65ccbc-9515-4531-b794-7d19f94dc99f">
      <Text>THE FULL FLASHBACK SEQUENCE of rowan’s murdering RAPIDLY PLAYS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bb774f86-7c58-492d-bf24-f76cbea98f4e">
      <Text>Mihai removes his hands then gingerly holds Wendy's face in one hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f42be0a0-238e-4eaf-9fc5-c30b0514c9db">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9a0076b1-2385-493d-818a-92071987fbc0">
      <Text>My sweet summer child. I'm so sorry you had to go through that.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="101e6a0d-e845-4afd-b273-4451103db983">
      <Text>Wendy, stone—faced, begins to well up with tears. Mihai takes her in his arms; she remains unmoved before slowly wrapping her hands around him and sinking her head into his chest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e790e079-b77c-4d69-bee7-5a8fab411861">
      <Text>Mihai looks back at Rowan, who’s stunned.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="02d02e67-0972-45e5-8bb7-52b60b3cc1f0">
      <Text>Mihai shakes his head softly, closing his eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c96b5034-3360-4d0d-bd85-a08b7040d928">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="5cb717f3-838d-45e4-85c2-8b372e3e6450">
      <Text>(Mouthing)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1a42a1bf-e077-4d0b-a47a-a8c9e011b12e">
      <Text>It's not your fault.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="aa4439cb-4db7-4fca-9e9c-18a9917077f4">
      <Text>Rowan gets angrier.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0aaeef51-350b-466d-bdfe-585373b3fc9c">
      <Text>Her color shifts to Crimson.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ece90502-d3bc-41fe-85d6-bdda61460bd7">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3d04be43-e299-43ce-8635-ebe5f05d23ab">
      <Text>No, no...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8613baab-daf0-4ab1-bda9-b67678542880">
      <Text>Mihai releases Wendy and takes her crying face in his hands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f7e45b74-bad2-49d6-8d68-bb4b86693cc7">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6026215c-561b-4b2e-949c-fc665bd4d741">
      <Text>One moment, okay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="89778376-2494-4138-bc90-91b295bd6e92">
      <Text>He smiles, pulls her in for a quick forehead kiss, then turns to Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="08c55751-d7f2-472d-80ca-058aa7b27954">
      <Text>Rowan's fist sails past Mihai's face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7d415305-2026-499a-a750-04b3731dba5e">
      <Text>Mihai snatches the arm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="082b5a19-52f9-4489-84f2-a90118cee15c">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="003f342d-d7f4-48b1-8bba-4d870a5ebcfe">
      <Text>Rowan, stop.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f2e6d24e-2220-4947-b8ec-8e37d04d70ec">
      <Text>Rowan tries retracting her arm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2f2c5ecd-3607-46ff-bb0d-cfbfdb4ce04d">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4f624290-fa74-40c7-a4c9-5b808009088e">
      <Text>Fuck you, you did this!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="33ed0f20-9d19-4db2-a02f-0718ea7e76e8">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1baa0106-b047-424a-873a-070290251eb6">
      <Text>Did what?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ca8231d5-a8b6-475f-a834-d45b90cd8583">
      <Text>He releases Rowan's arm and crosses his own.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="194b1dc9-048a-4260-a635-ac7c06c3ed27">
      <Text>Rowan hesitates, thinking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4582a432-b513-4147-af7c-774d9e412440">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7e97e7d4-808a-489d-b673-1b213faea8e7">
      <Text>All of this!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f838b9a7-01f3-4bc5-9b8b-df79490db7ae">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="19c141b5-ca5f-49db-94fc-4a718c26a76e">
      <Text>Rowan, let me tell you a quick story about myself; hopefully it'll help you understand better.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5ff91c04-4cd0-4f84-b4d4-4d9828c5af1c">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7021ed81-e86f-4a89-899a-c0c205864ea1">
      <Text>I don't want a fucking storytime from</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6fafb5f9-8ec5-4332-a0e3-3220fd1dd23e">
      <Text>Mihai places a finger on Rowan's lips.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5ac296af-656b-4675-8142-f95832d36e53">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="76094414-7264-492b-9365-0b359fb8fb4c">
      <Text>Shh, listen. A while ago I got bored with life, so I decided to make this storm that gave both you, me, Wendy, and every person you've fought up to this point their powers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2d0e41e5-3334-463d-9267-c68d15759f07">
      <Text>He removes his finger from her lips.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="31fe8e0a-9b8a-4a40-85dc-1aa7a4749e34">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b4baaef8-8b00-4320-9c51-23f5eb8beef3">
      <Text>Yeah, and?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c941f06a-d950-4918-9e2f-85aa06de7221">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1f59c8c8-62d9-487f-b5a1-0448b5d2fa4a">
      <Text>Well, you must understand that what you two have done up to this point is far better than what anyone else has done before.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ba8b46dc-606b-436c-9c53-b3de1afa0721">
      <Text>He turns towards Wendy, who's wiping tears from her eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="722a50c6-05b1-4d48-8b71-a68f317541c8">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b9aaea29-9703-4f1b-ac91-78f0c34c02df">
      <Text>What you two have is way better than anything else I’ve seen. I didn't even know this form stuff was possible!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="42cbd256-10c2-4230-9d71-745fbca9ccd4">
      <Text>He turns back to Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="849d76d9-3793-4642-a5c7-e4fb387c62f0">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="93054665-9430-4f4d-9134-3374aac8ce52">
      <Text>The point is, you two can be much better than you think. So, I'm going to pause this little exhibition match while you two work out your differences. Once that happens, we can fight again, and hopefully you’ll be even stronger than ever.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b42b88bc-4a52-4784-a0b9-590669fc3291">
      <Text>He walks back over to Wendy and leans close.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c1ee8687-51e0-43bb-a030-4da7f04323f0">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="745fc684-87a5-48d2-9c5b-f44fb248802f">
      <Text>(softly)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c3b21800-edb5-4805-b1a7-754ba1523979">
      <Text>By the way. Yes, she does.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5e558903-25ed-4408-8a2d-309ab0869895">
      <Text>Wendy huffs, amused. Mihai wipes a tear from her cheek as the other hand slides to the back of her head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7d22ca9e-9b4d-46a0-a0b2-fb90b97e830f">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1265439b-4e63-4127-a146-f3d4d2505d49">
      <Text>It's not her fault she did that. So don't blame her for it so much, okay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f80d4f23-4cc6-4f90-8c12-77aef8fcc3fb">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="ee811fcd-dd12-4333-ba00-7e4a12288a0a">
      <Text>(softly)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="30dc880a-f9c7-41fc-8c48-146c023dc001">
      <Text>Easy for you to say. You didn't fall for your parents' murderer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f4371028-8445-42eb-9c48-8c2aa84f1ca4">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8267ccd6-8edd-4f8c-9a16-4c0fd6ebc634">
      <Text>No, but I know that you don’t actually think of her like that either, do you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bcc56c28-5809-4136-9246-19a5ba89f224">
      <Text>She nods, and Mihai walks back to where the throne was and sits on the rubble.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6b0ec6be-41b4-4d51-b35e-bf9ed01cf07b">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="640a799e-2c32-4e5c-9847-4ce3a11b35fe">
      <Text>Guards, escort them out together.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="da7ba825-9b02-4370-ad54-5eb887e789ef">
      <Text>The guards nod and move them out, keeping them as close together as possible.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9bbd74d5-449e-407c-8ec3-c15a985215b2">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="cbca62fc-86a1-4609-a3a2-3dce74c00e26">
      <Text>(To self)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fab87a42-6577-4647-b09e-0dc61138e97e">
      <Text>See you two soon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="10c3de1e-53f7-4153-ac70-e4a4a59e4d5a">
      <Text>FADE TO BLACK.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="98fe2083-ae53-4770-b726-edfc1071afc5">
      <Text>Episode 11</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="928393fa-1bcc-4beb-a0bd-b6c49939f1ad">
      <Text>TITLE CARD:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="22f783cc-675c-46c0-81bc-acf5fa1d30eb">
      <Text>Shadow on the Sun XI (Name: Crimson/Numerals: Black with Pastel Blue outline)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="559372f7-9d29-4f07-b145-10320489a796">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="66" Type="Scene Heading" id="22859c70-ddc8-4786-a627-c93120e6f728">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="92" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Abandoned house </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> conTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="73c7fcfd-28d7-4c65-ab48-3c8234ce5f96">
      <Text>Rowan &amp; Wendy stop in front of an abandoned—looking house.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6d31d65a-1cd8-42d2-8aa1-992aaf7210b3">
      <Text>Leaving the buggy running, Rowan gets out and checks for anyone inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="966c7b4e-8521-4015-b96f-bcc30c0c52e8">
      <Text>She walks back to the buggy, sits in it and turns it off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="963ab0d1-2adb-48b6-b02f-0a1f7f959415">
      <Text>Wendy immediately exits, grabs her bag, whistles for a few wisps that bust down the door, and disappears inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="49e8ffb0-353d-47ed-b03c-1762236ff08a">
      <Text>Rowan stares, face blank; a tear rolls down her cheek.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="23951d8c-9bcc-4546-9deb-77292a5c099c">
      <Text>Her face turns sad as another tear rolls down her cheek, and her face shifts to a red blush.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="23951d8c-9bcc-4546-9deb-77292a5c099c">
      <Text>She buries her face in the wheel, softly crying.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8eb409b7-bd65-4771-bf27-42e360208519">
      <Text>The crying continues to get worse until she’s in a full, ugly—faced breakdown.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="957a67b5-e749-40ea-b224-aa5ca9d275e7">
      <Text>She leans back, wiping the tears from her face. Her body goes limp into the seat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7200eeab-7d9a-424e-b568-257c49d1d1c6">
      <Text>She rolls out of the buggy and trudges inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="67" Type="Scene Heading" id="bb4951fe-6ff6-464c-8d75-b75b038ab150">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="92" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="c3686403-2af1-4cf7-93aa-609f5b58bb90"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="85d22a1d-1c06-4beb-bea1-4cf3eccfd25f"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. AbANDONED HOUSE </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> conTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="89d33556-6f8c-4df9-bd99-4eb2e8414ba1">
      <Text>Rowan slowly walks around.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0195aa63-7053-49f2-b70b-5ba46193bbd6">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37e4304d-1e7c-47ee-8b71-c58acb069e39">
      <Text>Wendy, I’m sorry! I’m so, so, sorry!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0c4dcdb1-29cc-4964-9025-407b985d28e9">
      <Text>Silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="74785474-cceb-4d17-872b-cdbcf670197b">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37e4304d-1e7c-47ee-8b71-c58acb069e39">
      <Text>I know that doesn’t fix anything; it doesn’t bring your parents back either.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bf8816d7-dc99-4ff6-9044-7a31dfe49acc">
      <Text>Silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e1470754-858e-4aaf-b722-5ab847431ce4">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="979086ab-6096-43d6-b20b-48cd3c32ba98">
      <Text>Fuck! I wish I had words stronger than a lame ass, stupid fucking apology to make you feel better.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8cc356ee-6edd-4700-9cbd-41f656904ae9">
      <Text>She stops in the middle of the house.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c69006a8-be20-431a-ab5b-f11b5657db08">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="650f0fd6-1f19-4290-b0dc-63bcd3fe6b05">
      <Text>I want you to know that I’ve been reliving that moment for years, years!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="88069276-54d2-4b99-babb-b82c6185be9e">
      <Text>She leans against a wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="729e35c7-ef12-4613-bd63-83300f1c1af0">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="650f0fd6-1f19-4290-b0dc-63bcd3fe6b05">
      <Text>Every night I fell asleep in that place remembering the face of the little girl, scared, too hurt to cry, terrified of the girl who just ripped her dad’s face apart in front of her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2dff1eb6-d816-4277-b431-3d2d1cc09e62">
      <Text>She slides to the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7538701e-b3d2-4304-8dd2-78ce721604b0">
      <Text>Her crying gets worse again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5d9b5492-d280-4dc0-ac5b-1ee9aa0812f1">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="650f0fd6-1f19-4290-b0dc-63bcd3fe6b05">
      <Text>You don’t have to “find me interesting” anymore. I’ll leave. Yeah, I’ll leave; that’s what I’ll do. That way you don’t have to be with me. Better yet, I’ll let you kill me; would that be better?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="157e876d-8309-403a-b4bf-58ffbe9e187a">
      <Text>Rowan breaks down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="08c4611b-77da-43f0-bf81-80a8237db075">
      <Text>Wendy emerges from the darkness in front of Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2fe3c4fe-7cad-49c8-a87f-73cf1f592d48">
      <Text>Soft moonlight casts on Wendy, holding the side of Rowan’s face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7348d43a-dfab-47ca-b59f-f9eb97bae051">
      <Text>Rowan melts into the hold.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2fe3c4fe-7cad-49c8-a87f-73cf1f592d48">
      <Text>They make eye contact.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c7169232-a615-4aa0-877e-f46a074c0664">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ffe8acc2-a41c-4eb9-8d98-23187cac8e2e">
      <Text>Sleep, Rowan, please.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cdbbc457-c0e3-4d92-b4bb-e2966778c670">
      <Text>She releases and disappears back into the darkness.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="68" Type="Scene Heading" id="4455c6cd-7920-4b3a-9bed-b0cd38959672">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="94" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Abandoned room </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2a96d1f7-6ece-48d9-bf19-918641856671">
      <Text>Rowan, still crying, unties her shirt, folding it and placing it on the nightstand. She kneels and slips off her boots, then her shorts, which she folds neatly and places on top of the boots.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fb596bf0-cad6-4fa1-b390-53971e434ce5">
      <Text>She sits back against the bed, then leans down onto the floor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2cb5ce07-02f8-4151-808b-89a8e194f734">
      <Text>Her crying gets worse as she tries to bury her face into the floor and covers her face with her hands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="080ea5ac-bdb4-426e-89b0-2599f34cbf3f">
      <Text>A few more beats of crying.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="140ce26f-739f-46cd-a955-e637ae38edda">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="69" Type="Scene Heading" id="4dba71b8-758e-47ae-8433-8cdf2b36989f">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="94" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. AbANDONED room </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> morning</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="04cfa9f4-fe0c-461a-aed1-22df3a9d4113">
      <Text>Rowan wakes up on the floor; she looks around, dazed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="04cfa9f4-fe0c-461a-aed1-22df3a9d4113">
      <Text>She stands up and walks out of the room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="70" Type="Scene Heading" id="4e3c68fe-ce3d-4130-8e7f-7a5acafbf8bb">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="94" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. abaNDONED HOUSE </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> conTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1da04906-89ee-4e77-bc1c-356479aec136">
      <Text>Rowan walks to the buggy, unzips her bag, pulls out a full bar of soap and a red towel, and walks back inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="71" Type="Scene Heading" id="38e08fec-ef9b-403c-bf01-f5a7853e4f43">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="94" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="fca7b614-34a8-48d1-802c-94c112f82791"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. AbaNDONED HOUSE </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> conTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ddcd5c80-c6a9-41d6-b64b-adc513d72eb6">
      <Text>Rowan searches for a bathroom; Wendy spots her as she’s about to enter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c5562476-1128-4ff9-a813-2e81cf8481c6">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c477727c-2eaa-4ea1-bc1e-2ab123e31d7e">
      <Text>Wait there.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="57e091b5-dbd4-4c84-8d33-3b2fa4183558">
      <Text>Rowan stops and waits.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e873da35-fb35-4970-8e9e-7d0c0050edfa">
      <Text>A few beats later, Wendy returns with her own towel, Deep Blue with black paisley patterns, and they walk in together.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="72" Type="Scene Heading" id="a56afeec-bea5-4136-afe5-2b108d947936">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="94" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Bathroom </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> conTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e0d1055d-ac3f-4675-b6cb-406371355b16">
      <Text>Rowan takes off her underwear.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a6979fd9-f51a-4f36-8c2b-3947757ba84b">
      <Text>Wendy stares as Rowan folds the underwear and places it on the vanity.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6d163b07-098e-45d5-8aa7-6fdd1f9acdec">
      <Text>Rowan starts the shower and places her hand in the water, looking at Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="645bf26c-d8d9-4721-bb92-55f81ea76dbb">
      <Text>They make brief, instantaneous eye contact before Wendy looks down at her towel as she decides to hang it on the bar beside her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="645bf26c-d8d9-4721-bb92-55f81ea76dbb">
      <Text>Rowan hands Wendy her towel, and Wendy takes it, placing it beside hers without touching. She steps aside and lets Wendy in first.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="645bf26c-d8d9-4721-bb92-55f81ea76dbb">
      <Text>Wendy enters, wetting herself, then steps back and allows Rowan in. She enters and wets herself. While her back is turned, she hands the soap bar to Wendy, who begins cleaning herself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="645bf26c-d8d9-4721-bb92-55f81ea76dbb">
      <Text>Rowan turns, and Wendy hands the bar to Rowan and points to her back. Rowan takes the bar and rubs it around Wendy’s back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="645bf26c-d8d9-4721-bb92-55f81ea76dbb">
      <Text>Wendy turns around and R&amp;W swap places. Wendy rinses herself off, and Rowan rubs herself down with the soap. She stares at the bar as Wendy turns and notices Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="645bf26c-d8d9-4721-bb92-55f81ea76dbb">
      <Text>Wendy takes the bar and motions “turn around” with her hand. Rowan turns around, and Wendy washes Rowan’s back. Rowan turns around to Wendy already holding the bar out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="645bf26c-d8d9-4721-bb92-55f81ea76dbb">
      <Text>Rowan takes it, and Wendy steps out of the shower. Rowan exhales and rinses herself off, putting the soap down on the holder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ac0d2852-c4eb-4308-aeba-a4b24d3b8db1">
      <Text>Wendy is drying herself off, glancing through the translucent curtain at Rowan rinsing herself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="37a0670f-5cf1-4552-afbe-0e6d78758219">
      <Text>Rowan turns off the water and steps out. Wendy moves to the vanity and continues drying off as Rowan grabs her towel and starts drying herself, too.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ec198d31-026b-4599-91a9-61e968a6c9fc">
      <Text>Wendy wraps her hair in the towel and walks out. Rowan wraps it around her waist and grabs her underwear as she steps out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="73" Type="Scene Heading" id="3cdcfa29-2574-4ea4-9fc6-29f17d817f34">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="95" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Abandoned house </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> Later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f76c5cdc-e536-40af-85a0-b4e91bff12bd">
      <Text>Rowan walks over to Wendy’s room and leans against the door frame.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e2525329-b933-4143-8002-6b328a20b36b">
      <Text>Wendy packs her stuff; Rowan watches—unnoticed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="04bbbd87-81c3-4697-ba7e-5fcb6ee01098">
      <Text>She picks it up and slings it around her back. Taking her guitar in hand, she notices Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="432aa6c7-e652-46bc-a13f-07c0486bf0c3">
      <Text>A long beat of staring.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="432aa6c7-e652-46bc-a13f-07c0486bf0c3">
      <Text>Wendy takes the bag off her back and hands it to Rowan, and Rowan moves aside to let Wendy pass.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="74" Type="Scene Heading" id="2e9b0e33-30ad-4af9-a4fe-470129c60052">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="96" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="26432946-1b7f-41c6-8559-a698555a2704"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. AbaNDONED HOUSE </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> ConTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d7cefe90-20ae-4422-a267-90bbb4db70ab">
      <Text>Wendy walks outside and sits in the buggy. Rowan puts the bags in the back and sits down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="08510212-cd9d-473c-b270-45ae3803fceb">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6e8ec1b5-0e98-4a85-8906-4c218f8657dd">
      <Text>I want to take you somewhere. Is that okay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="19d7e9fc-c4d5-4ea1-ae9f-c9b1f88e807b">
      <Text>Wendy nods softly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="827d2c16-c987-4782-9341-9d5437afd4bb">
      <Text>Rowan starts the buggy and drives off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="75" Type="Scene Heading" id="1fd1c698-08aa-469a-bcc1-0d0c2770f6db">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="96" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Abandoned shack </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> afternoon</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fb91a51a-69cd-45b1-9f69-66ae795c817b">
      <Text>Rowan drives up to the shack and parks it, taking a deep breath before a deliberate exhale.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ad5ef7a2-7774-4bcb-b972-54429f8aca0a">
      <Text>Rowan steps out of the buggy and walks over to the shack’s door, opening it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4c69dc32-fcfb-4bd1-960d-9f2ebd1316ba">
      <Text>Wendy watches, then steps out and follows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="76" Type="Scene Heading" id="2a2b4fbc-28b2-4183-a4a9-8a90cf7463d9">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 7/8" Page="96" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="0b9263af-3b82-4e17-8398-c38db8ca2ec8"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="fcb335c8-97c5-4391-9cc6-3a3e010ec799"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. AbanDONED SHACK </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> contINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="74cba18f-dbc9-4632-ae19-8e7f9126219f">
      <Text>Wendy steps inside and looks around.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="64d15bae-12f2-46c6-aaf1-5038d625ac48">
      <Text>Rowan, about to cry, steps inside, leaving the door open.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e1c4c174-9523-4ffa-9e8d-e359c3123ac7">
      <Text>Wendy looks around; tears roll down Rowan’s face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="44d39811-8797-4091-afa8-ad5c61c253b6">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6de66672-b5f1-4af9-b892-ebb43a268f8d">
      <Text>I, I figured I should tell you that I’ve been living here since you left.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2d1a4dde-1440-48b3-ac6a-01e36f35ea7c">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b2974a42-74bf-4007-b02e-22c62dbdfd99">
      <Text>I know, you mentioned it last night.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="34feb100-bdf1-4425-b24c-8ebe9b3831a7">
      <Text>Wendy sits down on the bed, looking around, taking off her hat and putting it behind her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e7a42361-528a-441d-bfe0-8eef44f85e52">
      <Text>Rowan stands there, crying softly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cfe53289-ef02-48e1-af59-459b5e7fb43f">
      <Text>Wendy pats the bed next to her; Rowan sits down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="01b83f26-9f89-4b05-a5fe-69a0561622f9">
      <Text>Rowan cautiously takes a seat next to her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="00e0d679-4f3b-4d3c-b246-48dbc564908c">
      <Text>Wendy looks down at the floor, then at the bathroom. Rowan sniffles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bb2b57a7-93b8-4c77-b360-65088743a709">
      <Text>Wendy stares at the doorway. She slowly leans against Rowan’s arm, wrapping an arm around it and sliding her hand into Rowan’s, closing it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3a428710-e104-4af4-8993-36e64fb0079c">
      <Text>Rowan moves her arm around Wendy’s shoulders, still holding Wendy’s hand and wrapping her into her side.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="abfd33ba-b447-4ce5-9896-72e0cc0c3587">
      <Text>Rowan’s crying gets worse; she rests her head on Wendy’s and pulls her in closer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7f0b732d-b25e-44e5-b314-e9fe0531cd30">
      <Text>Wendy half—buries her head into Rowan’s chest and stares up at Rowan; they make deep eye contact.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9569525d-2532-450b-bf31-9c4f6b90bd43">
      <Text>Wendy kisses Rowan’s skin near her heart and turns her head into it. Rowan holds Wendy tighter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f4ad7cec-f97d-421b-b65d-727739b73d09">
      <Text>Wendy begins to cry as well.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b3a3520-c8bc-4933-aa95-16db5f324a9a">
      <Text>Rowan breaks down, then Wendy follows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1c847c52-baec-47f5-8e98-150a036e6188">
      <Text>Wendy wraps both her arms around Rowan, and they both hold each other tight as they cry.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c0ecd0c1-1b06-49eb-b65e-b442d2143678">
      <Text>A few beats of crying pass, and Wendy loosens her hold. Rowan reciprocates</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> as if waiting.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4a98bba4-2d99-4b92-9e5a-a9adf940b319">
      <Text>Wendy looks up to Rowan and stares for a moment.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4a98bba4-2d99-4b92-9e5a-a9adf940b319">
      <Text>She wipes the tears from Rowan’s face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8a84e789-7da0-486d-ba3c-a6bb261797f1">
      <Text>Rowan places a hand on her head, rubbing it and pulling her in for a deep, long forehead kiss before giving her a deep head hug.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d1933f4b-e703-474c-93ef-8d7ddf7198da">
      <Text>Wendy turns her buried face up to Rowan, and moves in closer. Kissing Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bb13b9f8-0668-41f6-aaca-8dd3bfb21d7d">
      <Text>They hold this kiss for a long beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="28fea286-7e23-4f70-82af-f1c89b782dca">
      <Text>After the kiss, they gaze at each other again. Rowan manages to smile.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="10fa2965-0077-4d74-b341-262da3e4496f">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6bb3f841-731f-47b7-aaee-4b2a3bcb0480">
      <Text>I’ve been waiting for that.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="57417700-1197-4532-8ab5-1be30de5be4b">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="97ef7279-0de4-460c-b8a1-d11714d7a2b9">
      <Text>Sorry it took so long, and that it had to be here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f389700f-d5a0-4af7-b6f8-18799fe54c91">
      <Text>Rowan loosens her hold; Wendy lies down on Rowan’s lap.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ce899ef7-fa6c-42f7-b197-b29890ff099f">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="68ea5db1-38b8-4e09-828d-bb16510888c6">
      <Text>It’s okay.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="32993914-9e06-404e-ae9d-57efa4a1f463">
      <Text>They stare at each other for a beat, and Rowan lies back as well, putting one hand on Wendy’s stomach and the other behind her head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="af691947-b8e2-44c4-8976-d79969479154">
      <Text>Wendy puts her hand on top of Rowan’s and curls her fingers in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3b4bf845-7257-4189-bccc-86522c34bde6">
      <Text>Rowan flips her hand, and they hold each other’s.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8c039357-4f3d-4bdf-8b48-6fed958ba143">
      <Text>They end up falling asleep together.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="01188eb5-8dac-43f9-aeb0-65ba3ff9c4f0">
      <Text>Their colors shift to Deep Crimson and Deep Blue, respectively.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="cc170d99-39cd-400a-b80b-4337d4010d57">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="bbe5d932-d3a4-4c12-a946-ee6d3697f47b">
      <Text>Episode 12</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="908bd9e9-7b26-410f-b9ef-3ad9d1bcc9bb">
      <Text>TITLE CARD:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="572eb6fe-f99b-46d5-9495-386ed4d31bdd">
      <Text>Celestial Elixir </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">XII</Text>
      <Text> (Name: Black with Amethyst outline/Numbers: Black with White outline)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="e9db6c91-22ed-46bf-9572-b9919e6e342e">
      <Text>Fade to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="77" Type="Scene Heading" id="ed13509d-c96f-48c9-8eaa-1a9dc3702e1e">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="99" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="c790d440-f8ae-4e28-a2f9-9d9050c8d10f"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="312ab4f7-a5ef-404c-ba39-af7a284f0b71"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>int. AbaNDONED SHACK </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> The NEXT morning</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d245a230-6cc5-4e9f-b84d-50cd24dd210b">
      <Text>Rowan wakes up and looks at Wendy</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> hands still held.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6eb28d47-fed7-4da3-993b-1617799b27dc">
      <Text>She sits up, petting Wendy’s head. She wakes up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="477e9a84-f3b0-43c9-acc7-28a1ae6e3bbf">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bc2ebfdc-7fa6-43e9-9abd-8cc10195d968">
      <Text>Good morning.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="509a6e04-3e04-4cf6-9368-a57ff6024e09">
      <Text>Rowan smiles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3291ce67-549a-4dc4-a22c-304679215529">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="39bb0a6f-a929-4a58-bf23-c47f8a3a4bb6">
      <Text>Good morning.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="376b280b-c576-4947-b4c9-18118a9ed244">
      <Text>Wendy closes her eyes and purses her lips. Rowan laughs, lifts Wendy to sit up and kisses her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="de512b3e-b8ed-4a11-a09b-51a606b7e8d5">
      <Text>They stare at each other for a long beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d4112bca-6a15-48f0-adfa-7b8cd424b510">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0fdebb50-3fa3-4752-b64b-bdf7fd63e763">
      <Text>I hope you slept well.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="decf041a-862f-4e47-9bf5-73fd1a797288">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="245c75c1-0281-4ce6-ac2a-1f48ae4df40b">
      <Text>I hope you slept better than me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b7f6ebd-052f-4a5c-b39b-205181e427c2">
      <Text>They both laugh.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="04775d81-5709-449c-af66-26984828aea1">
      <Text>Wendy leans on Rowan’s arm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bb0a4fec-0b86-4a6d-b319-ad6223187db6">
      <Text>They both deeply exhale.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7a5a841e-3f95-42dd-b626-d9c2461896a7">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bbcf67a2-1e27-42c6-acf2-d180ff7dc0cf">
      <Text>Can I ask you a question?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d1cea96d-c39b-4abc-9320-c02072ea1473">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7c579743-0aac-48e6-91fb-caa38ab56674">
      <Text>Of course.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="35e1e57e-b63e-4578-9c7c-3452cf1e8668">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fff437aa-ab80-40a7-8a1d-c7043024efa5">
      <Text>Is it weird that I still want to be with you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1cf03117-bde2-47bd-bcb3-37cffcd80b08">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca2141ef-17ac-41b4-8107-8294d1a5dd47">
      <Text>I don’t know.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="38d2f9e2-7936-48bd-9d68-73b1d01ac788">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ba0d8057-6ee7-4c20-a5f8-1042791618a8">
      <Text>Damn.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="24f84665-313f-430f-9f79-980103671ddb">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="aa168717-bae7-4d88-9078-d0847ee4f552">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="22b5f225-e4bf-476b-a19b-e79b03c2b7a0">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bf6b3707-a4c3-4b09-9781-c2f01658fa2e">
      <Text>I was hoping you knew.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7c9c4737-b597-45c4-8c76-75cc1b376121">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f80ee11b-ca7a-44d8-a977-718f6c838ebb">
      <Text>I was never good with words to begin with, much less deciding what the right thing to do is.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4066fac0-8bd6-433a-b42b-d7133b0dd0be">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e79410d0-51d9-467f-bd74-ca63f4a3216c">
      <Text>Fair enough.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cf814ffa-c4e4-4719-a03f-384236ae210e">
      <Text>Rowan gives her another forehead kiss and stands up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="74001cd3-7aba-4d52-a2d0-f66f075c1387">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b2c922ca-d197-4ed8-8aaf-1a582ddff9e3">
      <Text>I do think we should go though.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5a9f3071-c2a8-4f91-912e-3d470708e0cf">
      <Text>Wendy nods, grabs her guitar, takes a deep breath, looks around, and steps outside, closing the door behind her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Number="78" Type="Scene Heading" id="c431eab7-3563-41e6-962b-3202a5c432b9">
      <SceneProperties Length="6 3/8" Page="100" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROWAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="25d98ce0-b2a7-4119-8c5a-3f11c82334ca"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WENDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="6f80df7c-e17f-4815-b37e-fe997cf1d933"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MIHAI NICULESCU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="9c948545-3d40-4b12-adf4-5f776d404b6d"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. abanDONED SHACK </Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text> conTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a08acc36-e526-40eb-a61b-5c525fddba3e">
      <Text>Mihai walks up to them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cf189541-3ffb-483c-81e2-1abf17a8c89c">
      <Text>MihAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b1c528e9-0737-4151-b5ba-da971819c810">
      <Text>Good morning, ladies!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6b34d065-4892-46be-a7fe-c590cbb703bb">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="39508442-957a-4167-b7dc-51a3a72b2402">
      <Text>What do you want, Mihai?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fcaf90a2-cfa7-4cd8-800d-11b57e15c9c4">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0ca98f4c-97f8-4ab8-8fc9-e09181fca4f5">
      <Text>It’s time for your final bout!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1d76e98d-d72b-4e3b-8744-b223375a3fd0">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bfa94b50-cbe0-4cea-b983-cd2df1efe396">
      <Text>We really don’t want to do that right now; we’ve been dealing with a lot.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f6a7c2bb-220a-48d2-85f2-08db9a6d9fb9">
      <Text>Mihai NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6e57395f-04cb-49b3-85e1-ecd66f2c6a7c">
      <Text>I think a week is more than enough to get yourselves in order.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0e9368d5-9120-4a4b-8796-c9ee0b2857f2">
      <Text>He takes a stance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="85775805-5fab-4fb1-b57c-fafa2d6fb400">
      <Text>MiHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="266f0889-bc79-428d-b719-bfa3f5e267eb">
      <Text>You guys aren’t getting out of this.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f6f8f566-8338-4350-b013-b23f2b2e1649">
      <Text>R&amp;W look at each other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="522f930c-08a7-45d8-8380-022a1130d2b6">
      <Text>They both power up into their forms.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d51da99d-9088-4025-b306-d1ac14aa49e7">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="64cb87de-65ed-4413-a4ce-3ec3dec656bb">
      <Text>There we go!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="85dd36c3-1438-4b7a-8166-acd1100284f7">
      <Text>He disappears; Rowan shifts in front of Wendy and blocks a blow from Mihai. Wendy strums, and a black translucent sheen with a Deep Blue glow covers Rowan’s whole body.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d3f9aac7-ef61-4bfa-8ff9-3554c7db7dd9">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="00dd9c82-6483-436c-a90b-90b74124a3eb">
      <Text>Outstanding!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="90d77e57-a879-4880-91a1-ed3d6b741031">
      <Text>He and Rowan begin to trade blows. Wendy gives Rowan black arms and covers her arms and legs in the same color scheme as her nails.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="efd87dfe-cc9f-4eab-a2a3-a33e7013c74b">
      <Text>Mihai jumps over Rowan and goes for Wendy. Rowan grabs him out of the air and slams him into the ground. The fists turn to torpedoes as they repeatedly strike Mihai. Mihai uses Rowan’s wrist to pull himself into the air and twist</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>kick her in the head. The kick bounces off her head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="21017663-6150-446f-a05d-c2f34437ebc9">
      <Text>He flips himself away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cebac7a7-f3c4-4317-8f92-fabefda3b41a">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cf2143cc-4c45-496e-aca1-bbba4596067b">
      <Text>You gals have gotten much stronger! But I don’t think you’re quite in sync yet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7744e7be-e074-4b3d-9d4a-8fbb68a4bc67">
      <Text>He jumps and loosens his joints, then reloads his arms. He charges again, trading more blows with Rowan until she grabs one of his arms.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="39ace7d7-6828-4579-b494-9e98501b74c1">
      <Text>Wendy’s playing now sounds like a distorted guitar; Rowan’s grip tightens around Mihai’s arm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="581b89b6-76d1-41fc-afaf-46f849aa7014">
      <Text>Mihai chuckles. He knees Rowan in the gut, making her reel back in pain. A jab</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>uppercut</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>knee combo and Rowan is flat on the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5a70625e-a050-4694-a1c2-b8494544386b">
      <Text>Wendy steps forward, the patterns on her body brightening with a purple glow now as she plays neo</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>classical. The wisps move quicker, blurring into a set of weapons in Rowan’s hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7cc984b3-274e-42c5-86c2-924db09fd93e">
      <Text>She jumps up and begins swinging.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="79fb3389-0761-4701-9ac5-26e82a2a2e81">
      <Text>Mihai dodges and blocks, getting pushed back against the buggy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a75f1b6f-51b7-4391-a43b-d15b9ff26a1c">
      <Text>Rowan swings; Mihai rolls out of the way; the weapon crushes the roof of the buggy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b21e6e7f-9340-40f5-a84e-4a9895e4317c">
      <Text>Mihai pants; his white starts shifting to grey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="aaeb9ec3-c128-4397-85f3-d2610f06f5d4">
      <Text>Rowan lunges forward; Mihai flips over her and bounds for Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2c671a1f-6f00-49bc-9d62-3ee7243983e0">
      <Text>A school of wisps swirls around him, blocking sight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1dcaceac-003e-4876-8987-87e006b1d5a8">
      <Text>Rowan slices at the swarm and right into Mihai’s side as he shouts from the pain.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="91b592ed-5e7b-4a66-8e98-cf3c20067f4e">
      <Text>The wisps disperse. Mihai stands, staring right at Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="199530eb-b1bf-4a86-8477-78a0e30d628e">
      <Text>He grins, then shifts to behind Rowan, chopping at her neck and dropping her immediately.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2f18d672-77cc-4360-b8b5-a43bd91d2977">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="700fc89f-b634-4353-ae3b-d8fc94b152ae">
      <Text>Play time’s over; it’s you and me now!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="486d3da9-7d27-4a85-9fee-00c9215b1e46">
      <Text>Wendy’s face goes pale as she sees Rowan drop.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5afda8be-4e40-4213-9b6a-dd7127e6feff">
      <Text>She releases the guitar and steps forward, extending her hands as the weapons from Rowan go to her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8cc87893-f4e5-4836-80ab-43ead708000f">
      <Text>Wendy takes a stance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="02c54ab4-275b-4a6d-bac1-a54a48e2940a">
      <Text>Mihai’s white is now completely grey as he grins.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="01af90e0-b2b6-40e8-a985-ec21d3c075d0">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cbabe996-a06f-4886-a70f-05eb5737dac1">
      <Text>I never needed her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="baf6e24c-c673-48b5-9198-69146be8ae1b">
      <Text>Rowan’s red turns to purple with spots of pastel red as she stands up, ready to fight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="30242b40-6568-442f-adbd-647301b560f0">
      <Text>Wendy lunges towards him and thrusts one of the weapons; he blocks it with two fingers. Rowan throws a punch from behind that Mihai blocks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c40b4cd0-70ef-448b-bb48-0f5845aba0e8">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ad68f306-2647-4290-a4f7-85599b761d54">
      <Text>Everyone needs someone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3a16ba91-3189-4c0e-a75a-ab748ffceeb4">
      <Text>He flings the weapon away and throws Rowan, crashing into the shack.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="afbd2db6-23df-45d1-aad2-116563d3d436">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8d7b42e7-f402-476b-85bd-cf1b6d61bafb">
      <Text>Except you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="76ba5da1-d85d-4645-b9aa-caf6d4912540">
      <Text>She swings the other weapon; he blocks it again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c81e7ccf-8306-4556-adb1-d752071076a5">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37f417cd-e547-4809-821a-20b99550195f">
      <Text>I’m the progenitor; before me there was none.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="15bb4672-d5fa-4d87-a497-00a832a603ee">
      <Text>Wendy swings; he blocks it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fe746362-e5b4-4d81-9336-53816dbcf63f">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a2085947-2d2e-432d-a12a-12be9e77fb5d">
      <Text>And after you will come many.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ba86d005-3997-4e66-a479-388468f2dcdd">
      <Text>She grabs him; he headbutts her, and she staggers back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d5a1aca7-502b-41ea-bf52-9afb4d56cf2a">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a9ad2ba3-35d4-48a8-ab68-357591dd52e9">
      <Text>Then let your sacrifice be the call.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5f7c42c1-af96-40fa-89f0-2ce318171974">
      <Text>The wisps create arms, wrap around her fists, and give her armor; same with Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="94da0089-51e6-4b22-b814-d59c1177a115">
      <Text>MihAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bdc372c1-6676-4dd5-8f38-2e1ef134c2ca">
      <Text>See, I knew you were still holding back! Come on, stop hiding your tricks and give me all of you! It’s more fun that way.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ca7fee4a-6584-4d44-8d01-a04a8e381755">
      <Text>Wendy yells, and they blink out of view.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f2ec8d84-475f-4109-a5c0-460fe99b7d48">
      <Text>Mihai looks around; Wendy taps him on the shoulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="30d2b991-3117-4de6-acda-0f2ed54d6a30">
      <Text>Mihai turns around; Rowan hits him in the kidneys. Wendy punches him in the face, sending him flying through the shack, collapsing it and causing the rubble to bury him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d878c7ae-d02a-4b6d-bce9-5bcb96b16b3b">
      <Text>Wendy turns towards Rowan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6e1a6142-50ea-400d-9d98-78149022ffa7">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="61ce020a-814e-467a-8e5d-06d32d1e834b">
      <Text>Are you okay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="38829692-a766-4af2-b2f5-55d3c957b4ba">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3ff21b52-cb0a-4f35-9285-2af7d612053a">
      <Text>Yes, let’s end this.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f75c6254-9bd9-452d-b152-aa805e982d2f">
      <Text>Rowan kisses Wendy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5edaed9e-8b8a-405a-bd75-dbb527faccff">
      <Text>Wendy nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d878c7ae-d02a-4b6d-bce9-5bcb96b16b3b">
      <Text>Mihai emerges from the rubble, now completely black.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3fed02b9-3287-4904-850e-1fdb1d15197a">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8bcb2204-008d-4fcc-a257-fb62a4ef3856">
      <Text>Is this what you wanted? To see me at my peak?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="568d082b-d424-4f8b-84f2-e617fd3ba9e1">
      <Text>WenDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="116f1e05-ea4c-4c1c-9826-eb492b05169c">
      <Text>Your peak looks more like ruin.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e3272298-1f65-4431-a0e8-05772ccb08d7">
      <Text>He wags his finger.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="71e89309-10fd-4630-9958-057a0657ad4e">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="03183785-b253-4638-9dea-704f5ce7acf3">
      <Text>Only to you who still holds onto another. I never needed anyone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="498dc73d-cee7-4a14-868e-9a0bdadee7b2">
      <Text>He blinks away. The girl looks up. Mihai is floating above her. They jump, floating in front of him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7d083326-935a-4b22-beb7-c92fc9879d99">
      <Text>WEndy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2d539f80-d0c6-413e-947d-868fb26795b9">
      <Text>But you wanted everyone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="368573b5-33a9-4b7c-82a9-89824dff00f8">
      <Text>Rowan swings fast, catching him off guard and sending him crashing into the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="506ea411-4e29-4449-b01f-852d80f63c28">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c99a7733-11df-4a2b-8868-79ee48416ba0">
      <Text>I want spectacle!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4c1eb05c-b0bf-41f5-8cdb-b162d809f02f">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7cd2696c-b9f9-4fcc-bf72-eed2b2df9b99">
      <Text>The way I want Rowan!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="adee8cda-0b8e-4059-a444-aa4d703210bf">
      <Text>Wendy flies down, landing a fist into his chest. Mihai spurts blood from his mouth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="803b9bf3-0b37-46a1-9cb4-2da743c89a96">
      <Text>Mihai NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="81e1428d-3a69-43bb-9348-db340c019201">
      <Text>That’s the difference between the rest of you and me. Hopelessly wanting others.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3e5fb47d-d06d-4733-871a-666f573badee">
      <Text>He swings back, sending Wendy into a nearby building. Mihai leaps after her. Rowan clotheslines him and kicks him into the building.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f3f90a9e-83be-4225-b74a-4e97e091e2fe">
      <Text>Rowan flies after him and looks for him inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="06b170e5-f235-4707-adc9-71a6e0879f4a">
      <Text>MiHAI NICULESCU (o.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6a80a3d8-2007-4631-b581-bc52c34954f7">
      <Text>I live by a simple code, ladies!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ad85454a-fc8b-4fa8-9a57-46e6dd5c3c69">
      <Text>He grabs Rowan and throws her through a building.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1f7d58a1-26dc-40cc-8a66-f2212783abbc">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f8870f1c-bc9b-4d3b-9f3e-0b1a864a4396">
      <Text>For the love of the game!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a21137c3-86b6-4c1c-9191-ea8d3d43d9b1">
      <Text>Wendy kicks Mihai away, sending him out of the building and crashing on top of the buggy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="05bd29c7-110c-415c-9975-068ed7eb0d03">
      <Text>Several blinks of black and purple light crash in different points of the sky.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ae1dbd59-caf7-4569-a881-59749b63f952">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a1c68bbc-40bf-4f44-aa68-6553e835d7d6">
      <Text>Why did you do what you did?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="74c87fd2-0358-46d4-88c2-e938b503fdb6">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c8316d89-824b-4a02-a5c3-3cb0c915919e">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="96703d42-5f83-444a-8f16-80d530a13a25">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="337683de-9594-4544-b181-f60d4a747d39">
      <Text>What brought you before me? Some goal, ideal, bond, flaw?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f3db7cf7-d3d3-40b2-9375-c0644ef1b6a1">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2baf8c33-8b8a-4e07-83fa-aa56d24a3ca1">
      <Text>Nothing, I was bored and wanted to find more interesting things in the world.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0fdd7dbb-8e72-4787-8d04-a1f48c2b24dc">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a4207af3-b858-495a-acd0-ed08c6c9491e">
      <Text>You and I aren’t so different; these patterns are scars of a bond you don’t know how to handle. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a6a4789e-b7ee-429a-bedd-be7531dbd1ed">
      <Text>Mihai NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="571df067-9db0-49e8-8f75-0692d6fdbe94">
      <Text>Rowan, you have nothing! (To Wendy) You love a murderer, a bum even! Yet you still can’t reconcile that in your head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="86ad67a6-0d7e-40e2-9d87-df6051d99553">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3bc2b5cc-7bdd-4fff-820c-267ef4b1fe58">
      <Text>Be quiet!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="82531ead-58db-49c2-ab96-5660cac45e52">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9e2db944-88bc-4f7a-8243-5fda9dc060a7">
      <Text>Or what? It’s okay, Wendy. Love Rowan with all your heart. Stand firm in your decision!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b2234857-ce35-4daa-9770-610cd69e0377">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ffaa5a89-a8a1-4350-adef-9efb3f8874ef">
      <Text>I’m going to kill you!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c6cfd2a3-d121-45ad-87c1-fae907dc746f">
      <Text>She grabs him, twirls and then sends him through another building. Wendy follows up and punches him through the air.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7f56956b-2493-4982-8c96-e6e24e7013e2">
      <Text>He smashes onto the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="313815b0-124e-45ef-a642-744cfb492adf">
      <Text>R&amp;W stand back</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>to</Text>
      <Text>—</Text>
      <Text>back and raise a hand as a giant ball of wisps coalesces into a swirl of black and purple.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.50" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="84fbbaed-68f2-4f9f-bf8e-6a4c65461527">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="279d456a-e6cb-4c6f-91ff-1d93d5315245">
          <Text>Rowan</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="409f6ca2-3b0a-4e07-a4e7-1f07e56353c1">
          <Text>Fuck you, Niculescu!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fbd51ade-464e-43b6-98ec-5d88114d435b">
          <Text>Wendy</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="774e2fba-89c8-4c61-865c-3971aff6bece">
          <Text>Fuck you, Niculescu!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="63015eea-2472-400f-bcee-287728c368f3">
      <Text>They throw the ball; it smashes right into him. He tries to block it but is overwhelmed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8fefadd2-f3d5-4549-945d-6c4a01bfd24f">
      <Text>They land nearby and walk over, kneeling next to him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="af9a04bd-1c7b-4ebf-a144-bdb013d02a39">
      <Text>Mihai coughs up blood.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="58dc83ff-acc0-4b45-86e5-0148fb066771">
      <Text>Mihai NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fb032443-0526-4912-a0bf-83599595290a">
      <Text>I guess the show’s over.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="82226deb-0d98-4715-b02d-af14256ed282">
      <Text>Rowan punches the ground next to him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="78dd8a80-bba3-4132-92f7-00ce725e9f80">
      <Text>MIHAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1fec4df8-66b6-464d-8aef-1e070269fb45">
      <Text>You wanna know my other code?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7230aa09-2d18-42ad-a089-f73c3b9d1f72">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6105566e-a2bf-40f2-899a-07c804349ddf">
      <Text>It’ll be your final words.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="13f1a089-3a6e-41e5-bfd2-68ab3acdb27a">
      <Text>MihaI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="30a52745-0db8-4cbc-a06a-8b3c92d1f0de">
      <Text>It’s not what you do to others, it’s what you do about it afterward. Rowan has carried this guilt ever since. Even if she did or didn’t mean to as a child, it happened. But she would’ve spent the rest of her life letting it define her just as you let it command your life as well.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f19c9dc8-b5a0-4af2-8adb-28ad39ea05ed">
      <Text>He coughs and takes both their hands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e71af654-c540-454a-ab3c-8813e17b703d">
      <Text>MihAI NICULESCU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="aeb54958-e66b-42be-8461-0b395b76a63f">
      <Text>Be each other’s afterward, find your </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">culoarea</Text>
      <Text> adevărată</Text>
      <Text>, if not for yourselves, or for each other, then for me, for the love of the game.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="72050611-b6ae-45d1-a834-a4b02a811130">
      <Text>He dies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="04bb5faa-34f8-4edb-810b-4d29fcbeb06a">
      <Text>Wendy stands up slowly, looks at Rowan, then takes her in for a deep kiss, then an equally deep hug.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="04624d36-9cfc-4a5d-80cd-0a249c155648">
      <Text>Rowan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8b71c780-09d6-4a67-97b6-efed66683419">
      <Text>Good job, goober.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="750e2838-530a-4812-8feb-acdaed9fc05c">
      <Text>Wendy chuckles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2a427870-7210-412e-90b0-fcfcbcc84372">
      <Text>Wendy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="77672c17-49f4-47b4-86cd-ba7f537c859d">
      <Text>Says the one that got knocked out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="42effee1-7d4f-428c-bbb8-3ab021b79467">
      <Text>Rowan scoffs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="58ae591d-29fe-400a-bdd3-bfcf055e192c">
      <Text>ROWAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1c86d314-314a-4525-a5ae-5cfd246d5d3b">
      <Text>Oh, shut up. It looks like you didn’t need me after all.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6b450323-76e5-45ec-b34d-e14e6c3468f4">
      <Text>Wendy looks into her eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2bd0ee4e-c535-45cd-96be-e2f6d1bfde16">
      <Text>WENDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7b598fcd-26f4-472a-8843-06042d16497f">
      <Text>You’re right, I don’t need you; I want you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1010329b-d8a8-4e7e-95ab-7701e44b2395">
      <Text>She kisses her again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="a70c046d-8b83-4d35-a362-c934412c27a2">
      <Text>Fade out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

